<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Nabt New Testament</book>
  <para style="rem">Typesetting of Luke Nabt on 5th January 2026</para>
  <para style="h">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luk so n tɔɣɔ pa'an Yezu yela</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Na'ayen Yelehun-som la dol</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">golihug poŋi</para>
  <para style="imt1">Pĩ'ĩlug</para>
  <para style="ip">Na'ayen Yelehun-som la dol aa Luk n golih se'em la, pa'an ka Yezu a la buyi; nɔdiŋir fããt la tet Izirɛal ni tengbauŋa nirib zã'ã. Luk golih diŋ yi Daan la Sii la n da bɔɔl Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;U tar Na'ayen yelehun-som la na te tarinam,&gt;&gt; ka Yelehun-som boo mi pɛ'ɛl mi ni se'el woo ka nir buuri woo bɔɔt. Se'el n tet nyaɣahum Luk golihuga ni mi, sɔ̃ u pĩ'ĩlug bɔɣɔhug la n pa'an Yezu kenna la; ni ku ba'ahug ni, n pa'an Yezu n do U Ba' yir tensoŋi ha la. Solimir la n pa'an Krista biih sera sakir zɔɔgir ni di yaligir dol Yezu Ba' yir tensoŋ doo la nya'aŋ la, yi la Tooma gbauŋ la ni na, gban se'eog ka Luk nɔɔ golih la.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bɔɣɔhug-nam buyi ni buyoobi la ni (behum golihug la n dol se'em la n be teŋira) tar yela mi zɔ'ɔ zɔ'ɔ n be la Na'ayen yelehun-som gban-koo la wa ni ma'a, a aa solim se'er n tɔɣɔt Na'ayen maleka nam ni dunkeem la woomir la, bam n da keŋ Yezu dɔɣum zĩ'ĩ la; Yezu N da a bii ka be Na'ayen po'ohug doog la ni la, ni Samaariya teŋ Nivosoŋ la maɣahir la ni Dawɔɔ la Borigir la. Dol Yelehun-som la paagit a ba'ahug, po'ohug, Vo'ohun-som Sii la, bompɔɣɔh tooma n a se'a Yezu Tooma wa ni, ni Na'ayen suguru dii tet yelebe'et dem n a se'el ka golihug la ba' tɔɣɔt.</para>
  <para style="iot">Golihug la n dol Se'em</para>
  <para style="io1">Pĩ'ĩlug (1.1-4)</para>
  <para style="io1">Geon Baptis dɔɣum ni u biilimi ni Yezu yela (1.5—2.52)</para>
  <para style="io1">Geon Baptis Tooma (3.1-20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yezu soob ni U makir la yela (3.21—4.13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yezu yara tooma Galili poŋi (4.14—9.50)</para>
  <para style="io1">Zɛ'ɛl Galili yɛ Geruzalɛm (9.51—19.27)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bakɔ'ɔr zã'ã daan Geruzalɛm poŋi ni ka kɔrunkɔrum la ni (19.28—23.56)</para>
  <para style="io1">Daan la vo'ogum doo la, U nɛɛgirnam la, ni U Na'ayen tensoŋ yir doo la (24.1-53)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Luk Golihug Dol Tiofilɔs Wo'or Zugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Nirikooŋ poɣun golih yelese'a n tom gaat ha yit tam sa'ani la, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />a aa ba n da zaŋ a te ti yit yiiga ntomirib la n da nyɛ ni ba nini ka di sɛhira yit yetɔɣuma niŋa la. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Yela, mam mɛŋ vɛ̃'ɛ̃h se'el woo ma'a ma'a yit la pĩ'ĩlug ni na, yi n golih yela woo bõi bõi te nyɛ zugudaan Tiofilɔs, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />la n nan iŋ se'em ka i nyaŋ baŋ mɛɣɛla la, yit yelese'a woo ka ba pa'al i la.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Geon Baptis Dɔɣum Yela La Deŋ Yina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Wom-se'a ka Hɛrɔd da a na'ab Geudiya teŋ la, malemadaan n da be ka u wo'or a Zakariya, ka da be Abiga malemadem tiɣir la ni. U pɔɣɔ da a la Erɔn buuri, ka u wo'or bɔɔn Elizabɛt. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Zakariya ni u pɔɣɔ la da a la ntɔɔ Na'ayen tɔɔn, ba da vo' ba vom dol la Daan la nɔdiŋa la zã'ã, ni U wara nam la. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Amaa ba da ka biihe, se'el n so la Elizabɛt da a la kundɔɣir, ba mi da korig mi paa paa.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Ɔŋ n da a malemadaan ka tomit tet Na'ayen la, u saŋa n da paa yi u tom, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />ba da ŋmɛ la gbaŋa lɔɔg u, yit malemadem wara la n a se'em la, yi u kpɛ̃ Daan la doog la ni ti laŋ toolum laɣase'et n tar ŋwũũg la. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Ɔŋ n da yi u laŋ toolum laɣase'eog n tar ŋwũũg la, nirikooŋ la da zɛ' la yeŋ ha po'ohit. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Ka Na'ayen maleka da nɛɛ u mɛŋ te u, u da zɛ'ɛ u dituŋ nu'ug bɔba. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zakariya n da nyɛ maleka la, u yam da ɛ̃k mi ka dabɛɛm tar u; <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Amaa maleka la da yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Da bah ka dabɛɛm tar i ya, Zakariyaa; ka Na'ayen wom i po'ohug la mi. I pɔɣɔ Elizabɛt nan dɔɣɔ dawɔɔ te i, ka i nan sɛɣɛ ka wo'or Geon. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Popeelum ni nyɛɛma nan a ya den, nirikooŋ nan nyɛɛm u dɔɣum niŋa, <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />u nan a nivokãt tet Daan la. U da mak ŋwũ daam n mɔl bee kpe'em; Na'ayen Vo'ohun som Sii la nan be ni u ka ba nyaan dɔɣɔ u. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />U nan bah ka Izirɛal nirib la ŋmɛrig leb ba Daan Na'ayen sa'ani na. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />U nan tar paŋ ni sise'e ka Ilaagɛ da tar la be Na'ayen tɔɔn, u nan bah ka dɔɣɔrib leb tar ba biih gĩĩl, ka seba n da zaɣah yetɔɣum la nan ɛɛt ntɔɔ daan, yi ba maahum ba mɛŋ te Daan la?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakariya da bɔ'ɔh maleka la yii, &lt;&lt;N nan iŋ la yela baŋ yi yel la n la? Se'el n so la, mam a la buranya'aŋ, ka m pɔɣɔ mi korig?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Ka Na'ayen maleka la lebih u yii, &lt;&lt;Mam a la Gebiriyɛl. Mam zɛ' la Na'ayen nɔbir zugu, ka U tom mam yi n tana tɔɣɔ te i yit yelesomira niŋa. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Amaa nyɛ n pu sak sera te n yetɔɣum la zugu la, tɔɣɔse'eb n nan tom yit bu saŋa la, i nan lebig gaauŋ, kun tɔ'ɔn tɔɣɛ, gur daase'er daar ka yel ãã nan tom?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Ŋwala zã'ã n da it la, nirib la da gur Zakariya mi, ka bo'ot se'el n so ka u wuugit kããbug doog la ni ha la. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Ɔn da yi na la, u da naam ma gaauŋ, nirib la da baŋ mi yi u nyɛ la liligir kããbug doog la niŋa. U da bɔɔt yi u tɔɣɔ pa'al ba se'el ka u nyɛ doog la niŋa la, amaa u da kun tɔ'ɔn tɔɣɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Zakariya tooma saŋa la n da ba'ah la, u da kul la u yir. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Dabih aŋ n da gaat la, Zakariya pɔɣɔ Elizabɛt da ŋwɔ̃k poor, la da paa ŋmarih sinu ka u pu yi yeŋa. U da yel yii, <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />&lt;&lt;Daan la n tom se'el te n la, nirib kun le zɛrigum ma, se'el n so la, Daan la zo n nimbɔ̃'ɔ̃g?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba deŋ yel Yezu Dɔɣum yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Ŋmaar siyoobi poŋi ka Na'ayen da tom U maleka Gebiriyɛl Nazarɛf teŋ, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />U da tom u la pɔɣɔsa'ar so n nam pu mi buraaga sa'ani, Geusɛf so n a Devit yizugu nir la, n da maahimit yi u di u. Pɔɣɔsa'ara wo'or da a la Mɛɛri. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Maleka wa da tã u sa'ani na po'oh u ka yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Kamaalug a la i den! Daan la be ni i mi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Amaa u da a la bora, yit tɔɣɔse'eb ka u wom la. Ka da bo'ot bu vɔ̃ɔ̃r n a se'em. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Ka maleka la yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Da bah ka dabɛɛm tar i ya, Mɛɛri, ka Na'ayen sũũr n nɔŋ i. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />I nan ŋwɔ̃k poor dɔɣɔ buribig, ka sɛɣɛ ka wo'or Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />U nan a nivokãt, ka nirib nan bɔɔn U Gaatbazã'ã Dawɔɔ, Daan Na'ayen la nan zaŋ Devit na'am la te u. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />U nan so Gekɔb yir la yɛha, ka u so'olum kun tar ba'ahugo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Ka Mɛɛri yel maleka la yii, &lt;&lt;La nan iŋa yela tom, Mam n nam pu mi buraaga?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Ka maleka la yel u yi, &lt;&lt;Vo'ohun som Sii la nan sigi i zugu, ka Gaatbazã'ã Na'ayen la paŋ nan kaa i mu; ŋwala zugu bii la nan a kassi; U wo'or nan a Na'ayen Dawɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />I sɔ̃ɔ̃g Elizabɛt ŋwɔ̃k poor ni u korigir la zã'ã, u nan dɔɣɔ buribig; ŋmaar siyoobi n ŋwala ka u ŋwɔ̃k poora, so ka ba yet yi u a la kundɔɣir la. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Se'el ka' tɔ te Na'ayen ne?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Ka Mɛɛri yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Mam n ŋwala, Daan la ntomiraa; bahum ka la tom n vom poŋi a aa nyɛ n tɔɣɔ se'em la?&gt;&gt; Ka maleka la bah u ka keŋ.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛɛri keŋ Elizabɛt sa'ani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Dabih aŋ ha la, Mɛɛri da keŋ Geudiya teŋ n lɛm ni zɔya teŋ la, <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />ka da kpɛ̃ Zakariya yir po'oh Elizabɛt. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Elizabɛt n da wom Mɛɛri nkɔr la, bii la da nyɛɛm mi u poorin ni popeelum. Elizabɛt da pɛ'ɛl mi ni Vo'ohun som Sii la, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />ka da tɔɣɔ ni nkɔr kpɛ'ɛmir yii, &lt;&lt;Kamaalug a la i den bompɔɣɔh tinsok, ni biiga n be i poorin wa. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Lan n ta'ah ka ŋwala it mam vom niŋa, yi Daan la ma tã mam sa'ani na? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Se'em ma'a ka mam wom i po'ohug la, bii la m be m poorin la nyɛɛm mi ni popeelum. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Kamaalug be ni so daana n sak yi se'el ka Daan la tɔɣɔ la, nan tom yela nɔɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛɛri Woompɛ̃ɣɛ̃ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Ka Mɛɛri woom yii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">&lt;&lt;Mam sii pɛ̃ɣɛt Daan la,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />mam sii nyɛɛmirin ni Na'ayen so N a fããt la,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />se'el n so la, U nyɛ u ntomit la tarug ka zo u nimbɔ̃'ɔ̃g. Yelemɛŋir, nan nan na yɛha, nir woo nan bɔɔn mam kamaalug;<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />se'el n so la, Gaatbazã'ã Daan la toma yelekãt te m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">ka u wo'or bɔɔn Kassi.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />U suguru be ni seba n nam u nɔɔr</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">yit zomaan kãã la wa nirib, ti paagit zomaan se'e n kenna la.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />U pa'al paŋ ni U nkpãuŋ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">u sãɣam pa'alim mɛŋ dem ni ba sũya putẽ'ẽra.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />U sigih paŋ dem teŋ ba na'am la niŋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">ka zɛ̃k sirigum-mɛŋ dem saazugu;<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />u diih seba kom n dumit la ni yelesoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">ka sa'ah seba n tar la ka ba keŋ nubɛɛlih.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />U soŋ u ntomit Izirɛal,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">tẽẽgit U suguru ni ba la,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />dol ɔn da diŋ nɔɔr ni ba yaanam la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">tet Ebraham ni u buuri yɛ saŋa n ka ba'ahugo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Ka Mɛɛri da be ni Elizabɛt ti paa ŋmaar sitã ka pana leb kul.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Geon Baptis Dɔɣum yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Saŋa da paa ya yi Elizabɛt dɔɣɔ, ka u da dɔɣɔ buribig. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />U kpɛ'ɛh ni u sɔ̃ɔ̃t n da wom yi Daan la pa'al Elizabɛt nɔŋir la, ba da nyɛɛmit ni u.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Ka lan da paa dabiha anii daar la, ba da tar bii la keŋ yendoog la ni yi ba ŋma u wɔ'ɔr, ka sɛɣɛ u wo'or Zakariya, a aa u ba' la wo'or la n a se'em la. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Amaa u ma da yel yii, &lt;&lt;Aai; u wo'or a la Geon?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Ka ba da yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Ya yizuga so pu tar wo'ora taaba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Ka ba da pana yebihit pa'an Zakariya wo'ose'er ka ba nan zaŋ sɛɣɛ bii la. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Zakariya da dɛ'ɛ gbauŋ ni pɛn golih yii, &lt;&lt;U wo'or a la Geon?&gt;&gt; Ka la da iŋ ba zã'ã pakir. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Nila nɔɔ ka Zakariya nɔɔr wo'og ka u pĩ'ĩl tɔɣɔt, ka pɛ̃'ɛ̃git Na'ayen. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Dabɛɛm da sãã Zakariya kpɛ'ɛh la mi, yit yelese'er n tom la, ka nirib la da tɔɣɔt zĩ'ĩ woo Geudiya teŋ ni ka kɔrunkɔrum zã'ã. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />So woo n da wom yel la, da ya la nɔɔr ka bɔ'ɔhit yii, &lt;&lt;Bikãã wa yi ka a la nan biiga?&gt;&gt; Yelemɛɣir, Daan la nu'ug n paɣa ka zugu.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zakariya N da deŋ nyɛ se'el la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Geon ba' Zakariya da pɛ'ɛl mi ni Vo'ohun som Sii la ka tɔɣɔ yetɔɣɔ ãã:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />&lt;&lt;Kamaalug be ni Izirɛal Daan Na'ayen la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">se'el n so la U zo U nirib la nimbɔ̃'ɔ̃g ka fãã ba bah.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />U te ti Fããt so n a paŋ daan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">yit Na'ayen ntomit Devit yir la na,<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />a aa Un da tɔɣɔ dol U kassi nɔdɛ'ɛh nam la,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />yi ti nan nyɛ fããgir ti dindem nu'uhin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">ni seba woo n dim ni ti la.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />U tom dol la Un da diŋ nɔɔr</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">ni ti yaanam la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">ka tẽẽ u kassi nɔdiŋa la,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Nɔdiŋse'er ka U da diŋ ni ti yaab Ebraham la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:73">n so ka U tom te ti: <verse eid="LUK 1:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />Yi U fãã ti ti dindem nu'uhin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">la n nan iŋ se'em ka ti na'ahit U ka dabɛɛm kun bee,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />ka vo' kassi ni ntɔɔ vom U tɔɔn gur ti kum.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Ka nyɛ, biiga, i yi i aa Saazugu Bonkpe'eoŋ la nɔdɛ'ɛh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">se'el n so la i nan maahum Daan la sɔya la,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />i nan tɔɣɔt tet i nirib la yi ba nan nyɛ ba fããgir yit</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">la Mam n zaŋ ba be'em taal daah ba la.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Yit Na'ayen suguru la ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">saazugu ha som la nan sigi ti zut na, <verse eid="LUK 1:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />yi u te seba woo n zĩ' lik ni kum tɔɔn la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">ka gbɛ'ɛh ti nɔba dolih suma'ahum sɔr?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Bii la da zɔ'ɔ mi ni Vo'ohun som Sii la paŋ, ka da kpɛ̃'ɛ̃t sɛ̃ɣir la ni ha gur sanse'e ka u da nɛɛ u mɛŋ Izirɛal nirib la sa'ani.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu Dɔɣum Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Dabih aŋ ha la, Gɔmena Ɔgɔstus da teh wara yi ba kããl nirib teŋa zugu. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Laa la wa n da a yiiga nirib kããlug, ka sankaŋ mi la Kpiriniyɔs n da a gɔmena Siiriya teŋ. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />ka nir woo da kul la u teŋ yi ba kããl u. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Geuzɛf da bah Nazarɛt n be Galili teŋ la, ka keŋ Devit teŋ Bɛtilehɛm n be Geudiya, se'el n so la Geuzɛf da a la Devit buuri. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Geuzɛf da dol la Mɛɛri, so ka u da diŋ nɔɔr yi u nan di ka u tar poor la, keŋ yi ba kããl ba. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Ba n da be niŋa se'em ma'a la, saŋa da paa ya yi u dɔɣɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />U da dɔɣɔ u sar-sar biburibig, zaŋ fuug vaarum u dɔ'ɔl zoŋi, se'el n so la, dozaalug da pu be zĩ'ĩ la ni ka ba nan kpɛ̃'ɛ̃.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dunkem la ni Na'ayen Malekanam la yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Teŋ la ni dunkem n da be sɛ̃k la ni, gur ba dumih wo'oŋ. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Ka Na'ayen maleka da tã ba sa'ani na, ka Daan la nɛɛhum da kaa ba mum, ka dabɛɛm sãã ba. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ka Na'ayen maleka da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Da bahin ka dabɛɛm tar yaa; beh mi nii, Mam tar la yelesom se'a n nan tar nyɛɛma n ka makire na te nirib waabi: <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />zina dabehira, Devit teŋ la poŋi, ba dɔɣɔ Fããt te ya; so n a Krista la, Daan la. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Laa la wa nan a dããluŋ tet ya: ya nan nyɛ bii ka ba vaarum ka ni fuug ka ka dɔ zoŋ niŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Nila nila ka tensoŋ nirikooŋ laɣam ni Na'ayen malekanam la, pɛ̃ɣɛt Na'ayen ka yet yii,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />&lt;&lt;Pɛ̃k paa Na'ayen N be tensoŋ n be saazugu angola ha la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">ka teŋa zugu suma'ahum be ni seba ka Na'ayen sũũr nɔŋ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Na'ayen malekanam la n da leb tensoŋi ha la, dunkem la da yet taaba yii, &lt;&lt;Bah mi ka ti keŋ Bɛtilehɛm ti wol se'el n iŋ la, se'el ka Daan la bah ka ti baŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Ba da serin keŋ kalam paa nyɛ Mɛɛri ni Geuzɛf, ka bii la dɔ zoŋ la ni. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Ba n da nyɛ ŋwala la, ba da yel ba n wom se'el yit biiga niŋa, <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />La da iŋ nir seba woo n da wom se'el ka dunkem la yel la, la la pakir. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Mɛɛri da zaŋ tɔɣum ma iŋa u sũũr ni ka tẽ'ẽhit bu yela. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Dunkem la da leb ya, pɛ̃ɣɛt ka na'ahit Na'ayen dol se'el woo ka ba wom ka mi nyɛ la, a aa ba m poɣun womin se'em la.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba zaŋ Yezu Teh Yendoog ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Dabiha anii n da paa la, saŋa da paa ya yi ba ŋma bii la wɔ'ɔr; ba da sɛɣɛ ka wo'or la Yezu, wose'er ka Na'ayen maleka la da yel Mɛɛri ka u nyaan ŋwɔ̃k ka poor la.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Ka saŋa n da paa yi ba gbi'im ba mɛŋ dol Moozis wara la, ba da tar Yezu keŋa Geruzalɛm ti zaŋ U te Daan la <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />(a aa la n pɔɣun golih se'em Daan la wara gbauŋ la niŋa la, &lt;&lt;La dɔ' mi yi ba zaŋ burikpɛŋ woo keŋ yendoog ni ti te Daan la&gt;&gt;), <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />ba mi da iŋ kããbug dol Daan la wara la n golih se'em la, &lt;&lt;yi peribale'et bee nanam nangbana ayi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Buraa kakɔ̃ n da be Geruzalɛm, ka ka wo'or a Simiyɔn; buraaga da a la ntɔɔ daan, ka zɛ' dɔ'ɔ Na'ayen tɔɔn, u putẽ'ẽr da a la Izirɛal buuri la leb Na'ayen sa'ani, Vo'ohun som Sii la da be ni u mi. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Vo'ohun Som Sii la da poɣun deŋ nɛɛ te u mi, ka yel u yii; un pu nyɛ Daan la n a Krista laa, u kun kpii. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Vo'ohun Som Sii la n da be ni Simiyɔn la, u da bah ka u keŋ kpɛ̃ yendoog la ni. Ka Yezu dɔɣɔrib la da tar Yezu mi kpɛ̃ yendoog la ni na, yi ba malim a aa wara la n pa'al se'em la. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simiyɔn da dɛ'ɛ bii la mi, ka na'ahit Na'ayen, yet yii,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />&lt;&lt;Kpe'eoŋ zã'ã Daana, nan-nan na, I pana tɔ'ɔn bah I ntomit la, ka u kpi ni suma'ahum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">a aa I yetɔɣum la n yel se'em la;<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />se'el n so la mam nini nyɛ I fããgir la,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />se'er ka I maahum dɔ'ɔl nirisaal woo tɔɔn la,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />I a la nɛɛhum liligit pa'an seba n ka' Izirɛal buuri la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">ka a pɛ̃k tet Izirɛal buuri?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />La da iŋ Yezu dɔɣɔrib la la pakir ni Simiyɔn n yet se'el yit Yezu nina la. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Ka Simiyɔn da kamaal ba ka yel Mɛɛri, Ka ma la yii, &lt;&lt;Nirikooŋ Izirɛal poŋi luu ni ba dɔɔgir nan yi la bi-kãã la wa nina, ka la mi nan a dããlun se'eog ka nirib nan tɔɣɔ gɛ̃ɛ̃h U, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />ka la nan bah ka nirib putẽ'ẽra ni ba sũya nɛɛ, ka so'o nan kuh i mɛŋ sũh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Na'ayen nɔdɛ'ɛh-pɔk mi n da be ni, u wo'or da a la Anna, ka u a Fanewɛl pɔɣɔwɔɔ, ka ba buuri a Assa. U da korig mi, u mi da kpɛ̃' ni u ser paa la woma ayopoi ka u ser la kpi, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />ka u da pana a pɔkɔ̃ɔ̃r ka be ti paa wom pihinii ni anaahi. U da pu malegun bahit yendoog laa, ka u da na'ahit Na'ayen mi loot nɔɔr, ka po'ohit wo'oŋ ni wuntɛɛŋ. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Sankaŋ la, u da paa niŋa, ka pĩ'ĩl pɛ̃ɣɛt Na'ayen, ka tɔɣɔt tet nirib la Yezu yela, seba woo n da ɛɛt yi Geruzalɛm nyɛ fããgir la.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Geuzɛf ni Mɛɛri n da dolih malema n a se'em Daan wara la poŋi ba'ah la, ba da leb ba mɛŋ teŋ Nazarɛf n be Galili la. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Yezu da zɔ'ɔ mi ni paŋ, ka tar yam; ka Na'ayen nu'ug da paɣa u zugu.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu n a Bii la da be Yendoog la ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Womir woo Yezu dɔɣɔrib la, da ni keŋ Geruzalɛm mi ti di Zɔɔgaat malema la. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Ka Un da a wom pii ni ayi la, ba da keŋ mi a aa ba n ni poɣun it se'em la. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Malema la n da ba'ah la, ba da yɛ kun ni, ka Yezu n a bii la, da kpelim Geruzalɛm, ka u dɔɣɔrib la da pu baŋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Ba da tẽ'ẽh yi Yezu laɣun be ba nirib la ni mi, yɛ kun, ba da zaŋa dabih-mumir keŋ paa yir, ka ba pana da pĩ'ĩl ɛɛt U ba sɔ̃ɔ̃t ni ba zɔnam sa'ani. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Ba n da pu nyɛ U la, ba da leb la Geruzalɛm ti ɛɛt U. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ka dabiha atã daar ka ba pana nyɛ U yendoog la ni, ka U zĩ ni pa'an pa'alib la, womihit ka bɔ'ɔhit bɔ'ɔhug nam. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />La da iŋ so woo la pakir ni U bɔkir ni U lebihug la ni la. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />U dɔɣɔrib la n da nyɛ U la, ba iŋa lɛɣibi, ka U ma' yel U yii, &lt;&lt;M Biigaa, Nan ka I iŋ ti yela? Behimaa, I Ba' ni mam ɛ I mi fɛ̃ɛ̃ fɛ̃ɛ̃ ka pu nyɛ I ya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Ka Yezu bɔ'ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya ɛɛrim yela bo? Yam pu mi yi N nar yi M be Mba yir laa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Amaa, ba da pu bɔk Un yel ba se'el la. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Ka U da dol ba sigi Nazarɛf teŋ, ka nam ba. Amaa U ma' da zaŋ yel ãã la wa iŋa u sũhin. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yezu N da zɔ'ɔgit se'em la, U yam ni U naani mi da pa'ahira yela, ka tar zusoŋ Na'ayen ni nirisaalib sa'ani.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Geon Baptis Maal Sɔr la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Na'ab Tibɛriyɔs n da a Na'ab paa wom piiga ni anu la, Pontiyɔs Palet n da a Geudiya Gɔmena, ka Hɛrɔd mi da a Galili na'ab, ka u sɔ̃ɔ̃g Filip a Ituriya ni Trakonitis na'ab, ka Lisaniyas a Abilinɛ teŋ na'ab, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />sankaŋ la Anass ni Kayafas n da a malemadem kpɛɛnam, ka Na'ayen yetɔɣum tã Zakariya dawɔɔ Geon sa'ani na sɛ̃ɣir la niŋa. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />U da tɔɔlum Na'ayen tɔɣum la Geɔdan teŋ la zã'ã, tɔɣɔt pa'an ba kɔ'ɔm soob ni putẽ'ẽr tɛɛgir n nan bah ka Na'ayen zaŋ ba be'em bah te ba se'em, <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />a aa lan golih se'em dɔ Azaaya gbauŋ la niŋa la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;&lt;So nkɔr n kaahit yit sɛ̃k la ni na:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;Maahum mi Daan la sarɔɔg la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">bah mi ka U sarɔɔg la a ntɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Bɔlimbɔɣɛh la waabi nan palih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">ka zɔya ni nkubirih zã'ã nan sirig sigi teŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">ka sɔrɔ ŋmɛlima nan tẽẽ ntɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">ka zĩse'e n a bɔɣa bɔɣa nan palih;<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />ka nirisaal buuri zã'ã nan nyɛ Na'ayen fããgir.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Geon da yel nirikooŋ seba n ken u sa'ani na yi ba dɛ'ɛ soob la yii, &lt;&lt;Yam zankpããh buuri wa! Ɔn n kpã'am ya yi ya zo yi sãɣan se'eog n kenna la tã kpela na? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Iŋ mi se'el n nan pa'al yi ya tɛɛ ya vom. Ka da pĩ'ĩlin yet ya mɛŋ yii, &lt;Ebraham n a tam ba;&gt; n yet ya mi wa, Na'ayen tɔ'ɔn zaŋ kuga wa ka ba lebig biih te Ebraham. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Lɛɛŋ poɣun deŋ dɔ tiih la tila ni; ka tise'e n pu won wolesomaa, ba ŋmaagit ka mi lobit buɣum ni ha?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Ka nivokooŋ la bɔ'ɔh u yii, &lt;&lt;Ti pana nan iŋa yela?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Ka u lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ so daan n tar fut tiyi lɔɔgum kukɔ̃ te so n pu tara; so mi n tar diit, iŋim yela nɔɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Hali seba n a lempo-dɛ'ɛhirib da tã u sa'ani mi na yi ba dɛ'ɛ kɔ'ɔm soob, ka bɔ'ɔh u yii, &lt;&lt;Pa'alaa, ti nan iŋa yela?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Ka u yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Da dɛ'ɛhirin gat ba n yel ya yi ya dɛ'ɛhit se'em laa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Ka soogɛnam mi da bɔ'ɔh u yii, &lt;&lt;Ka tam mi, ti nan iŋa yela?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Da pɛ̃rig bee pã'ãh so dɛ'ɛ laɣauho, bah mi ka ya nini tɛɣɛ ni ya wɔɔt la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Nirib la da pɛ'ɛl mi ni putẽra, ka ba zã'ã bɔ'ɔhit ba sũũr ni yi Geon na, tɔ'ɔn a Fããt la, <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Geon da lebih ba zã'ã yii, &lt;&lt;Mam soot ya mi ni kɔ'ɔm; ka so n kenna la, tar paŋ gaat mam; ka mam Geon pu sɛk yi n lorig u taɣara miihe. Ɔŋ daan nan so ya ni Vo'ohun Som Sii la ni buɣum. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />U yɛɛlug ŋman-zak la be la U nu'uhin, yi U yɛɛl ki la zaŋ su doɣot ni; ka U nan ŋwɔ̃ ut la ni buɣunse'eb n dit ka pu kpĩŋit la?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Yela u da doliha tɔɣum berigu ni, tɔɔlum Na'ayen yelesomir la te nirib la.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Amaa Hɛrɔd n da a na'ab la, ka Geon da zɛrig u dol u sɔ̃ɔ̃g pɔɣɔ Hɛrɔdiya, ni toom-bese'et zã'ã ka Hɛrɔd da tom la, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />u da le maan yalig u toon-gãliha la nko'og yit un da bah ka ba wo Geon sãriga doog niŋa la.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu kɔ'ɔm soob la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Un pana da so nirib la kɔ'ɔm soob ba'ah la, Yezu mi da tana dɛ'ɛ soob la ka pana po'ohit ka tensoŋ wo'o, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />ka Vo'ohun Som Sii la da sigi U zugu na a aa nangban la. Ka nkɔr zɛ'ɛl tensoŋi na yet yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ a la N Dawɔɔ, Mam Sũnɔŋir bii; Nyɛ poŋi ka N tar popeelum zɔ'ɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Yaanam yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yezu da a la wompihitã ka pĩ'ĩl U tooma. So woo da (tẽ'ẽh yi) Yezu a la Geuzɛf so n</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:23">a Heli dawɔɔ la dawɔɔ, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli da a la Mata dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Mata da a la Livi dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Livi da a la Meleki dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Meleki da a la Gɛnnai dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Gɛnnai da a la Geuzɛf dawɔɔ,<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Geuzɛf da a la Mattatiyas dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Mattatiyas da a la Emɔs dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Emɔs da a la Nahum dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Nahum da a la Esili dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Esili da a la Naggi dawɔɔ, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Naggi da a la Maaf dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Maaf da a la Mattatiyas dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Mattatiyas da a la Semiyan dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Simiyan da a la Geusek dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Geusek da a la Geoda dawɔɔ,<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Geoda da a la Geonam dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Geonam da a la Risa dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Risa da a la Zarubabɛl dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Zerubabɛl da a la Siyatel dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Siyatel da a la Neri dawɔɔ,<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neri da a la Meleki dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Meleki da a la Adi dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Adi da a la Kosam dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Kosam da a la Elemadam dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Elemadam da a la Er dawɔɔ,<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Er da a la Gesuwa dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Gesuwa da a la Eliyaza dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Eliyaza da a la Georim dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Georim da a la Matat dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Matat da a la Livi dawɔɔ, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Livi da a la Simiyɔn dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Simiyɔn da a la Geuda dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Geuda da a la Geuzɛf dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Geuzɛf da a la Geonam dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Geonam da a la Eliyakim dawɔɔ,<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliyakim da a la Miliya dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Miliya da a la Mina dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Mina da a la Mattata dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Mattata da a la Netan dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Netan da a la Devit dawɔɔ, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Devit da a la Gesi dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Gesi da a la Obɛt dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Obɛt da a la Bowazi dawɔɔ, Bowazi da a la Sala dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Sala da a la Nasɔn dawɔɔ, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nasɔn da a la Aminadab dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Aminadab da a la Adimin dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Adimin da a la Anni dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Anni da a la Hezeron dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Hezeron da a la Pɛris dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Pɛris da a la</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Geuda dawɔɔ, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Geuda da a la Gekɔb dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Gekɔb da a la Aizik dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Aizik da a la Ebraham dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Ebraham da a la Tɛra dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Tɛra da a la Nahɔr dawɔɔ,<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahɔr da a la Sirug dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Sirug da a la Rew dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Rew da a la Pɛlig dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Pɛlig da a la Ebar dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Ebar da a la Sila dawɔɔ, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sila da a la Kainan dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Kainan da a la Afazad dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Afazad da a la Sim dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Sim da a la Nowa dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Nowa da a la Lamɛk dawɔɔ,<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamɛk da a la Mɛtusɛla dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Mɛtusɛla da a la Enɔk dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Enɔk da a la Gerid dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Gerid da a la Mahalalil dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Mahalalil da a la Kainan dawɔɔ, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kainan da a la Enɔs dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Enɔs da a la Sɛf dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Sɛf da a la Adam dawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Adam da a la Na'ayen dawɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu Makir la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yezu, n da pɛ'ɛl ni Vo'ohun Som Sii la, da zɛ'ɛn Geɔdan leb na ka Sii la tar U keŋ sɛ̃k la ni ha, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />zĩkaŋ ni ka sitaana da mak U dabiha pihinaahi. U da pu di se'ela dabih aŋ nii, ka nɔlor la n da ba'ah la, U kom n da pana dumit. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Ka sitaana la da yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ N serin a la Na'ayen Dawɔɔ, bahum ka kugira lebig boruboru?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Ka Yezu lebih u yii, &lt;&lt;La poɣun golih yii, &lt;Nirisaal pu vo diit ma'a zugo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Ka sitaana la tar U do ha ti pa'al U kpela kpela so'olum nam la n be tengbauŋa zugu la zã'ã. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Ka yel U yii, &lt;&lt;N nan zaŋ so'olum nama ni ba kpe'eoŋ zã'ã te I; ka ba zaŋ se'el woo te la mam, ka mam mi tɔ'ɔn zaŋ te so woo ka n sũũr nɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Ka Nyɛ n nan na'ah mam, se'el woo nan a I den?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Ka Yezu lebih u yii, &lt;&lt;La golih dɔ' yii, &lt;Na'ahum ti Daan Na'ayen, ka tomit tet Ɔŋ ma'a.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Ka sitaana la zaŋ U keŋ Geruzalɛm, ti do yendoog la mɔpil-ŋwũ'ũ zugu ha, ka yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ N a la Na'ayen Dawɔɔ, zaŋim I mɛŋ zɛ'ɛl kpela fãb teŋ ha, <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />ka la golih yii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">&lt;&lt; &lt;U nan bah ka Na'ayen malekanam tã I sa'ani na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">gu I,' ka<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />&lt;Ba nu'uh nan gi I zɛ̃k,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">ka kugir kun mak kalim I nɔbire.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yezu da lebih u yii, &lt;&lt;La mi golih yii, &lt;Da mak I Daan Na'ayene.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Sitaana n da ba'ah ni u makir nam la, u da keŋ ka bah U gur un nan ti le nyɛ fɔl.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu pĩ'ĩl Na'ayen tooma Galili Teŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Ka Yezu, n da pɛ'ɛl ni Sii la paŋ la, da leb Galili teŋ, ka tɔɣum yit U yela ni na tii teŋ la ni ka kɔrunkɔrum la zã'ã. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />U da pĩ'ĩl pa'an yendobibih la ni ka so woo da pɛ̃ɣɛt U.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba n zaɣah Yezu Nazarɛf Teŋ la yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Un da leb Nazarɛf na la, zĩse'e ka u da zɔ'ɔ la, u da keŋ yendobibih la ni vo'ohug daar la, a aa Un da poɣun ni it se'em la. La n da paa yi U kããl la, <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />ba da zaŋa Azaaya Na'ayen nɔdɛ'ɛh la gbauŋ te U. U da wo'o gbauŋ la nyɛ zĩse'e ka la golih yii:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />&lt;&lt;Daan la Sii n be ni Mam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">se'el n so la, U kamaal Mam mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">yi N tar yelesoma na te nɔndem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">U tom Mam mi yi N tɔɔlum fããgir tet seba n be bobir ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">ni nin-nɛɛgir te zɔ'ɔnam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">ka bah ka seba m be mugir poŋi nyɛ fããgir,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />yi N tɔɔlum Daan la sũnɔŋirum womir la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />U da wo' gbauŋ la, zaŋ lebih te didaar ntomit la, ka zi'in. Ka seba woo n da be yendobil la ni la, kpã won U zĩĩ. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Ka U da pĩ'ĩl yet ba yii, &lt;&lt;Zina wa se'el ka ba golih ka N kããl ka ya woma a la mɛɣɛla?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Nirib la zã'ã da Pɛ̃ɣɛt U mi ka la mi iŋ ba pakir ni yelesonse'a n yit U nɔɔrin na la. Ka ba pana bɔ'ɔhit yii, &lt;&lt;La ka Geuzɛf dawɔɔ la n laa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yam nan ti sak sera N maɣahira ni yii, &lt;Dɔɣɔta waa, tebum i mɛŋ!&gt; Ka ya nan yel yii, &lt;Iŋim kpela mi I mɛŋ teŋa yelese'a ka ti wom yi I tom a Kapanaum teŋ la.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Ka U yel yii, &lt;&lt;Yelemɛŋir ka N yet ya wa, Na'ayen nɔdɛ'ɛh pu be ka ba dɛ'ɛgu nu'uh siyi u mɛŋ teŋa. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Ka yelemɛŋir la a la, pɔkɔ̃ya da zɔ'ɔ mi Izirɛal teŋ Ilaagɛ saŋa la, sanse'e ka saa da pu nii ka la paa woma atã ni ŋmaar siyoobi la, ka kon-nyaliŋ da sigi teŋa zã'ã la; <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />ni yela mɛŋ zã'ã ba da pu tom Ilaagɛ ba so sa'ani, la n ka pɔkɔ̃se'er n da be Zarifat Sidom teŋi laa. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Nkɔma mi da zɔ'ɔ Izirɛal teŋa mi Na'ayen nɔdɛ'ɛh Ilisa saŋa la, ka ba so da pu nyɛ u tebugo, la n ka Neeman n yi Siiriya teŋ na laa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Ba n da wom ŋwala la, seba woo n da be yendobil la ni la, sũya da dɔɔ mi ka la ka makire. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Ka ba da dɔɔ, sa'a Yezu yi teŋ la ni, tar U do zɔse'er n beŋ ba teŋ la lebih na la yi ba da'a U bah bok ni ha. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Amaa U da yɛɛ la ba tinsok keŋ gaat un yɛ zĩ'ĩ la.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buraa la ka Kolekpãbɛ'ɛh dol la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />U da keŋ sigi la Kapanaum, tense'e n be Galili la, ka da pa'an ba, la mi da a la vo'ohug daar. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />La da iŋ ba la pakir ni U pa'alug la, se'el n so la, kpe'eoŋ n da be U tɔɣum la ni.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Burase'e da be yendobil la ni ka kolekpãbɛ'ɛ kpɛ̃ u, ka u da kaahit ni nkɔr kpɛ'ɛmir yet yii, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />&lt;&lt;Bahum ti bããlam! I tar la nan yi I iŋ ni ti? Yezu Nazarɛf niraa? I tana yi I sãɣum ti mii? Mam mi nyɛ N a so, I a la Na'ayen kassi Daan?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Amaa Yezu da tãh u mi, yet yii, &lt;&lt;A bããlam, ka yi u sa'ani na!&gt;&gt; Kolekpãbɛ'ɛga da da'a buraaga bah ba tɔɔn, ka yi ka bah u ka pu sãɣam uu.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />La da iŋ ba zã'ã la pakir ka ba yet taaba yii, &lt;&lt;Nan bon tɔɣum n ŋwala? Tɔɣɔse'eb n tar kpe'eoŋ ni paŋ tɔ̃ sa'ahit kolekpãbɛ'ɛh ka ba yit na!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Ka U tooma wa yela da tii zĩ'ĩ woo teŋ la ni.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nirikooŋ nyɛ Tebug Simɔn Yir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Un da bah yendobil la ni la, U da kpɛ̃ la Simɔn yir. Simɔn dɛɛmpɔk da gbi'irin ni ɔɔt, ka ba da yel Yezu ka yel. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Ka U da keŋ u sa'ani ti zɛrig ɔɔt la, ka ti bah u. Nila nɔɔ ka bompɔk la da dɔɔ ka saam ba.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Wuntɛɛŋ n da lut la, seba nirib n da bẽ'ẽt ni bã'ãh buuri buuri la, ba da tar ba tã Yezu sa'ani na; ka U da zaŋ U nu'ug pa'al ba zut ka ba nyɛ ba tebug. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Kolekpãbɛ'ɛh da yi nirib berigu niŋa mi na, ka yet ni nkɔr kpɛ'ɛmir yii, &lt;&lt;I a la Na'ayen Dawɔɔ la!&gt;&gt; Amaa U da tãh ba mi ka pu sak yi ba tɔɣɛ, se'el n so la, ba da mi yi Ɔŋ n a Fããt la.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu pa'al yendobibih la ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Ka beog n da yelig ba'ah la, U da bah ba mi ka keŋ zĩse'e ka nirib pu bee. Ka nirikooŋ la da ɛɛt U; ka ba n da paa U la, ba da bɔɔt yi ba gu U mi ka U da keŋ ka bah baa. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Amaa U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;La aa M pɛ̃rigir toomir yi N tɔɣɔ Na'ayen yelesoma la te tense'e n kpelim la mi; yel dee la zugu ka Na'ayen da tom M na?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Ka U da kpelin tɔɣɔt Na'ayen yelesoma la Geudiya yendobibih la ni.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu bɔɔl U yiiga Nya'andolib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Yezu da zɛ' la Gennisarɛt mɔɣir la doon, ka nirikooŋ la da it ba n nan iŋ se'em paa U sa'ani womih Na'ayen yela la, <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />U da nyɛ ããrina ayi ka a zɛ' mɔɣir la doon; zin-gbã'ãrib la da sigi ããrina la ni mi pɛɛt ba woɣih. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />U da kpɛ̃ ããruŋ kukɔ̃ n da a Simɔn ããruŋ la niŋa, ka yel Simɔn yi u bah ka ããruŋ la leb nya'aŋ bɛ'ɛla ha. Ka U pana da zi'in ka pa'al nirikooŋ la.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Un da tɔɣɔ ba'ah la, U da yel Simɔn yii, &lt;&lt;Zaŋim i wok la lob kɔko'og la niŋa ha gbã zimi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simɔn da lebih U yii, &lt;&lt;Daana, ti sa tom mi wo'oŋ la zã'ã, amaa ti pu gbã'ã se'el la. Ka Nyɛ N yel yela, mam nan lob wok la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Ba n da lob wok la, ba da gbã zimi berigu ka wok la da yi ka ããhih. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Ba pana da yebih ba taab la n be ããrun-koo la ni ha la, yi ba tana souŋ ba. Zimi da pɛ'ɛl ããrina bayi la mi, ka ããrina la da kpelim yi ba sim kɔ'ɔm la ni.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Amaa Simɔn Pita n da nyɛ ŋwala la, u da kpã la duna Yezu tɔɔn, ka yet yii, &lt;&lt;Kem ka bahum, Ndaan naa, ka mam a la yelebe'et daan!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />La da iŋ Simɔn Pita ni u taab la la pakir ni zinse'a ka ba gbã la; <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />La da a la yela nɔɔ ni Gemis ni Geon seba n a Zebedii dawɔɔh ka laɣun tomit ni Simɔn la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Ka Yezu da yel Simɔn yii, &lt;&lt;Da bah ka dabɛɛm tar i ya; ka zina saŋit yɛ ha, ya nan kã'ãhit nirib?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Ba n da tar ããrina la leb kɔ'ɔm la nɔɔrin la, ba da bah se'el woo mi ka dol Yezu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Teb Nin-sãɣuŋ daan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Yezu n da be tenkãra la kakɔ̃ niŋa la, buranin-sãɣuŋ daan da be niŋa. Buraaga n da nyɛ Yezu la, u da kpã la duna ka belimit U, &lt;&lt;Daana, nyɛ M bɔɔt, I tɔ'ɔm bah ka n ningbiŋa saalim feppi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Ka Yezu tẽẽ U nu'ug, kalim u, ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;Mam bɔɔt yi N teb i ka i ningbiŋ la a feppi?&gt;&gt; Nila nila ka u bã'ã la bah u.<verse eid="LUK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Ka Yezu yel u yi u da yel so so. &lt;&lt;Kema, &lt;&lt;Zaŋim i mɛŋ pa'al malemadaan la, a aa Moozis n yel ya se'em la, kem ti iŋ teeb pa'al yi i nyɛ i tebug?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Amaa Yezu tɔɣum la da malegun yerig mi zĩ'ĩ woo ka nirib berigu kenna yi ba womih ka nyɛ ba tebug. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Amaa U da yi la nkpeŋ ha U ma'a sɛ̃k la ni ha ti po'ohit.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Teb Kaaruŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Daar dikɔ̃, ka Farasiinam ni warapa'alib n zɛ'ɛl Galili ni Geudiya ni Geruzalɛm tana zĩ lɛm ni zĩ'se'e ka Yezu da pa'an la; ka Daan la paŋ da be ni U ka U teb ba. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Niŋa ka buraah baseba da tana, ka ziit kaaruŋ ka u dɔ sandɛya zugu. Ba da bɔɔt yi ba tar u kpɛ̃ ti dɔ'ɔl Yezu sa'ani; <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />amaa ba da pu nyɛ fɔl nan tar u kpɛ̃ Yezu sa'ani, se'el n so la nirib la da zɔ'ɔ mi mikit, ka ba da lak mɔpil, zaŋ u dolih nirikooŋ la tinsok sigi Yezu tɔɔn.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Ka Yezu n da nyɛ yi ba tar sera sakir la, U da yel yii, &lt;&lt;N zɔɔ, i nyɛ i yelebe'et suguru?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Ka gban-mi'irib ni Farasiinam la da bɔ'ɔhit ba mɛŋ, &lt;&lt;U aa ɔni tɔɣɔt to'ot Na'ayene? Ɔni n nan tɔ'ɔn di nirisaal yelebe'et suguru te u, la n ka Na'ayen ma'a?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yezu n da baŋ ba n tẽ'ẽhit se'em la, U da lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;La iŋa yela ka ya tẽ'ẽhit yela ya sũya ni? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />La nan itug n tɔ', i yel yii, &lt;I nyɛ i yelebe'et suguru, &lt;bee, i yel yii, &lt;dɔɔgum zɛ'ɛl saazugu ka keŋe?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Amaa la nan iŋ se'em ka ya tɔ'ɔm baŋ yi Asaal Dawɔɔ la tar kpe'eoŋ tengbauŋa zugu, yi U di nirisaal yelebe'et suguru te u,&gt;&gt; U da yel kaaruŋ la &lt;&lt;Mam yet ti yii, dɔɔgum zɛ'ɛl saazugu ka zaŋ i sandɛya la kul.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Nila nila ka u dɔɔ zɛ'ɛl ba tɔɔn, zaŋ u sandɛya la, kul u yir, ka pɛ̃ɣɛt Na'ayen. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />La da iŋ ba waabi la pakir, ka ba da pɛ̃ɣɛt Na'ayen ni U yelenyalima la, ka pana yet yii, &lt;&lt;Ti nyɛ yelesaan zina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Bɔɔl Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Ŋwala nya'aŋ la, Yezu da yi mi ka nyɛ Levi n a lempodɛ'ɛh n zi lempoo-doog la ni; ka U da yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Dɔɔgum dol Mam.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Ka u da dɔɔ, bah se'el woo, ka dol U.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Ka Levi da iŋ dii u yir yi ba di ni Yezu; lempoo dɛ'ɛhirib la da zɔ'ɔ mi ka baseba laɣun zĩ teebul ni ni Yezu nam. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Farasiinam ni ba gban-mi'irib la da nɔɔmit tet Yezu nya'adolib la, yet yii, &lt;&lt;La naam ma yela ka U dit ka ŋwũũt ni lempodɛ'ɛrib ni yelebe'et dem ma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Ka Yezu lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;Nir seba n pu bẽ'ẽra pu ɛɛt tebaa, ka seba n bẽ'ẽt ma'a; <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Mam pu tana yi M bɔɔl la ntɔɔ dem ma'a. amaa yelebe'et dem n nan iŋ se'em ka tɛɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nɔlor Bɔ'ɔhug yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Ka ba bɔ'ɔh U yii, &lt;&lt;Geon nya'adolib la, a aa Farasiinam la, loot nɔɔr ka po'ohit, amaa nyɛ nya'adolib la ditin ka ŋwũũt?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Ka Yezu yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya kun tɔ'ɔm bah ka pɔɣɔdir daan la zɔnam lo nɔɔr ka pɔɣɔdir la nan pu ba'ahe, ya nan tɔ'ɔm bahee? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Dabiha kenna ka pɔɣɔsaaŋ la kun be ni baa, niŋa ka ba nan loot nɔɔr?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />U da le mak maɣahir te ba: &lt;&lt;So pu zaŋit fupaalug tan ligit fukorugo; ka yela n iŋ, tam paal la nan bah ka tan kot la ãã pa'ah, ka tam paal la kun ŋman ni tan kot laa. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />So pu zaŋit dãkumirum it leŋ niŋa ka bɛ'ɛra; ka yela n iŋ leŋ la nan tãh ka daam la kpa'ah. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Ka dãkumirum nar yi bu be la lem-paalig ni. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />So ka' nan ŋwũ dãkorim ka le ɛɛt dãpaalim, u nan yel yii, &lt;&lt;Dãkorim la a soma gaat?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Vo'ohug Dabihir Bɔ'ɔhug yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Vo'ohug dabiha la dikɔ̃ ni ka Yezu ni U nya'andolib la da buugit poog ni gat, ka U nya'andolib la ãhit ki la ŋmɛmit ɔbit. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Ka Farasiinam la baseba da yel yii, &lt;&lt;Nan n ta'ah ka ya it se'el n pu nar vo'ohug dabihir la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yezu da lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya pu kããl se'el ka Devit da iŋ, u ni u nirib la kom n da dumit laa? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />U da kpɛ̃ Na'ayen yir la ti zaŋ boruboru se'eb n kih la di, se'eb ka la pu nar yi so di bu, la n ka malemadem la ma'a, ka zaŋ baseba te u nirib?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Asaal Dawɔɔ la n a vo'ohug dabihir la Daan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Burase'e nu'ug n kpi la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Vo'ohug daar dikɔ̃ ka Yezu da kpɛ̃ Na'ayen dobil la niŋa ti pa'an, ka buraa kakɔ̃ da be ni ka u nu'ug kpi. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Ka gban-mi'irib ni Farasiinam la behit Yezu yi ba nyɛ nyaa U nan teb nirib vo'ohug dabihir laa, la n nan iŋ se'em ka ba tɔ'ɔn zɛrig U. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />U da poɣum mi ban tẽ'ẽhit se'em mi, ka yel bura-nukpiuŋ la yii, &lt;&lt;Kem na zɛ'ɛl nir woo tɔɔn kpela?&gt;&gt; Ka u da dɔɔ zɛ'ɛl.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Ka Yezu yel ba yi, &lt;&lt;Mam bɔ'ɔh ya mi, la nar yi i iŋ som bee be'em vo'ohug daar la, i fãã vom bee i ko'?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />U da beh kaa ba waabi, ka yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Tɛ̃ɛ̃gum i nu'ug la?&gt;&gt; Ka u iŋ yela nɔɔ, ka u nu'ug la leb tar paŋ. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Amaa ba sũũr da dɔɔ mi ni U, ka ba da sɔ̃hit ni taaba ba n nan iŋ Yezu se'em.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Lɔɔh U Nya'andolib pii ni Bayi la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Dabih aŋ la, Yezu da do zɔɔr la zugu ha yi U po'oh; U da Zaŋa wo'oŋ la zã'ã po'oh Na'ayen. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Beog n da kãã la, U da bɔɔl U nya'andolib la ka da lɔɔh nir piiga ni bayi, seba ka U da sɛɣɛ yi apɔstaliinam: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simɔn, so ka U da sɛɣɛ u wo'or Pita la, ni u sɔ̃ɔ̃g Andiru, ni Gemis, ni Geon, ni Filip, ni Batolomio, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />ni Matieu, ni Tɔmas, ni Gemis so n a Alfayɔs dawɔɔ la, ni Simɔn, so ka u wo'or da bɔɔn Zilɔt la, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />ni Geudas so n da a Gemis dawɔɔ, ni Geudas Isekarɔs, so n da lebig nivodɔ̃tik la.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Pa'an ni ka Tebit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yezu da sigi na zɛ'ɛl zĩse'e n dɔ salililii, ni U nya'adolib babug ni nirikooŋ seba n zɛ'ɛl Geudiya, Geruzalɛm, ni mɔɣir doon teh, Taya ni Sidon na la. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Ba da tana yi ba womih U pa'alug ka nyɛ ba tebug; ka seba woo ka kolekpãbɛ'ɛh da daamit la da nyɛ ba tebug mi. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Nirikooŋ la zã'ã da bɔɔt yi ba si'ih U mi, se'el n so la, paŋ n da ni zɛ'ɛl U sa'ani yina teb so woo n si'ih U.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kamaalug ni Sabaab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Ka U da gɔrig beh U nya'adolib la ka yel yii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">&lt;&lt;Kamaalug a la yam seba n a nɔndem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">ka Na'ayen so'olum la a la ya den.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Kamaalug a la yam seba kom n dumit nan-nan na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">ya poya nam pɛ'ɛl.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Kamaalug a la ya seba n kumit nan-nan na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">yam nan ti la',<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />&lt;&lt;Kamaalug a la yam seba ka nirib yaa, ka zaɣah ya, ka to'ot ya, ka sãɣamit ya wo'ora Asaal Dawɔɔ la zugu.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Nyɛɛm mi dabih den daar, ka yelemɛŋir la n a ya ŋwɔ̃ɔ̃t la kãrig mi tensoŋi; ba yaanam n da iŋ Na'ayen nɔdɛ'ɛhirib la se'em n la.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />&lt;&lt;Amaa sabaab be ni yam seba n a bontatib la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">yam poɣun nyɛ ya von som.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Sabaab be ni seba woo poya n pɛ'ɛl nan-nan na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">kom nan a ya den.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Sabaab be ni seba woo n la'at nan-nan na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">yam nan nyɛ sũsãuŋ ni nkuma.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />&lt;&lt;Sabaab be ni ya seba woo ka ba pɛ̃ɣɛt la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">ya yaanam la da iŋa yela nɔɔ tet nɔdɛ'ɛh namaɣanam la.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dindem Nɔŋir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />&lt;&lt;N yet ya mi yi ya womih, Nɔŋ mi ya dindem, iŋ mi som tet seba woo n dim ni ya, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />kã mi maal seba woo n po nɔɔr te ya, ka po'ohit tet seba woo n iŋ ya be'em. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />So n lob i tampɛ̃k, ŋmɛrigin tampɛ̃k kãã la te u; ka so n zaŋ i fuug, zaŋim i soot pa'ah u. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Tem so woo n soh i; ka so n zaŋ i laɣat, da bɔ'ɔh ti yel ya'a ha. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Iŋim ya taab a aa ya n bɔɔt yi ba iŋ ya se'em la.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />&lt;&lt;Nyɛ n nɔŋ seba n nɔŋ i ma'a, nambon ŋwɔ̃ɔ̃t ka i yi i nyɛ? Se'el n so la, hali yelebe'et dem nɔŋ seba n nɔŋ ba mi. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Ka nyɛ n tomit som tet seba n tomit som tet i, nan ŋwɔ̃ɔ̃t ka i yi i nyɛ? Se'el n so la be'em dem mi it la yela. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Ka nyɛ peŋit so ka i tar putẽ'ẽr yi u nan ti lebih te i, nan ŋwɔ̃ɔ̃t ka i yi i nyɛ? Hali yelebe'et dem pehit ba taab mi, yi ba leb nyɛ ŋwɔ̃ɔ̃t berigu. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Amaa nɔŋim seba n dim ni i, tomum som te ba, ka pehit, ka da tẽ'ẽhit yi i lebih nyɛ se'el ba sa'anii. I nan nyɛ ŋwɔ̃ɔ̃t berigu, ka mi nan a Na'ayen bii; se'el n so la, Na'ayen it som tet seba nini n pu tɛɣɛt ni U ni putodem. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Tar suguru, a aa i Ba' la N tar suguru se'em la.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taab Gãkir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />&lt;&lt;Da gãke, ka nyɛ mi kun nyɛ gãkire; da zɛrig so'o, ka nyɛ mi kun nyɛ zɛrigire. Zaŋim i tadaan toom-be'et daah u, ka nyɛ mi nan nyɛ i toom-be'et taal daahug; <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />te ma, ka nyɛ mi nan nyɛ teeb. I nan nyɛ teeb somma, tem yar yar ka pu tot ta, ka la nan leb sigi pɛ'ɛl i nu'uh ka yaamit; nyɛ n iŋ i taab se'em la, yela nɔɔ ka i nan nyɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yezu da le mak maɣahir te ba: &lt;&lt;zɔ'ɔm nan yaŋ ve'et zɔ'ɔmm? Ba zã'ã kun lu bok poŋii? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />So n a nya'andol, kun tɔ'ɔn gaat pa'al la, amaa so daana n zamih somma, nan a aa pa'al la. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />La iŋa yela ka i nyɛ sauk i kpɛ'ɛ niuh niŋa, ka pu nyɛt dɔɔg la i mɛŋ niuh la ni? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Bee la nan iŋa yela ka i yel i kpɛ'ɛ yii, &lt;N zɔɔ, bahum ka n yih sauk i niuha ni,' ka pu nyɛt dɔɔg la n be i mɛŋ niuh ni la? Namaɣan-daana, yihum dɔɔg la i mɛŋ niuh la ni yiiga, lan nan iŋ se'em ka i tɔ'ɔn nyɛt somma ka yih i tadaan niuh sauk la bah.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tii ni ka Wol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />&lt;&lt;Tisoŋ pu won wolebe'ere, bee tibe'eog wol wolesomaa; <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />se'el n so la, i nan baŋ tii woo yit la ka wola ni. I kun tɔ'ɔn laɣah mu'ut gɔ̃'ɔ̃h niŋa, bee i pĩ'ĩh ta'ama dɔ̃ɔ̃h niŋa. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Nivosoŋ tomit u toonsoma mi ka la zɛ'ɛn u sũũr yit na, ka nivobe'eog mi tomit u tooma ka la zɛ'ɛn na u sũũrin yit na; se'el n so la se'el woo m be nirisaal sũũrin la, yela nɔɔ ka u daana tɔɣɔt.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛ̃ɛ̃ba ayi La yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />La iŋa yela ka ya bɔɔn Mam yi &lt;Daana, Daana,' ka pu it se'el ka N yet ya la? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Mam nan pa'al ya seba n ken N sa'ani na ka womit N yetɔɣum la, ka dol bu ba vom ni. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Nivokãã la daan ŋmani ni so m mɛɛt u yir, ka tũ di ɛ̃ɛ̃bir la sigi yaɣɛl taŋ zugu; sakãt n ni ka mɔɣir pɛ'ɛl doo, ka kɔ'ɔm tana ŋmɛ yir la, se'el se'el kun iŋ dii, se'el n so la ba mɛ di la somma. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Amaa so daana n wom tɔɣuma, ka pu tar bu tomira, la ŋmani ni so n mɛ u yir ka ɛ̃ɛ̃bir pu be niŋaa. Mɔɣir n kɔ ka kɔ'ɔm ŋmɛ di, nila nila nɔɔ di nan lu, lu gberaam?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu da teb Soogɛ kpɛ'ɛm Ntomit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yezu N da tɔɣɔ te nirib la ba'ah la, U da keŋ la Kapanaum teŋ. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Niŋa, soogɛ kpɛ'ɛm da'abir, so ka u nɔŋ paa paa la bẽ'ẽt, ka la a kum ŋwuuŋ. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Un da wom ye Yezu kpɛ̃ teŋ la ni na la, u da tom Geudem kpɛm baseba yi ba keŋ Yezu sa'ani ti belim U ka U tana teb u da'abir la. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Ba n da tã U sa'ani na la, ba da belim U yet yii, &lt;&lt;Bura-kãã nar mi yi I soŋ u, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />den zugo, u nɔŋ ti nirib la mi, la a la ɔn n da mɛ ti po'ohug dobila te ti. <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Ka Yezu da dol ba yɛ, ba n da pɔr nira yir la, Soogɛ kpɛ'ɛm la da le tom u zɔnam, yi ba to'oh yel U yii, &lt;&lt;N daana, da daam I mɛŋa, ka mam pu nar yi I tã mam yir naa; <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Yela n so ka mam tẽ'ẽhin yi n pu nar ka n tã I sa'ani naa. Ka I ya'an ya'a nɔɔr yel se'el, ka n ntomira nan nyɛ u tebug. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Se'el n so la mam mi a la buraa n tar kpe'eoŋ, behit soogɛnam ka ba tomit. Ka man ya'a nɔɔr yel ba nkɔ̃ yii, &lt;kem ha,&gt; u nan iŋ yela nɔɔ, man ni le yel yi, &lt;kem na,&gt; u yɛ mi na. Man yel n da'abir yii, &lt;iŋim ŋwala&gt; u it ti?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yezu n da wom ŋwala la, la da iŋ U la pakir, ka U ŋmɛrig yel nirikooŋ la n dol U la yii, &lt;&lt;N yet ya mi wa, hali ni Izirɛal poŋi ha Mam pu nyɛ nir n tar sera sakir ŋwalaa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Ka niriseba ka u tom la n da lebit na la, ba da nyɛ ka da'abir la bã'ã la bah mi.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Da Vo'o Pɔkɔ̃ɔ̃r Dawɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />La da pu wuugɛ ka Yezu keŋ teŋ n bɔɔn Nayin, U nya'andolib la ni nirib berigu da dolih U mi. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Un da paa kpɛ̃'ɛ̃t teŋ la ni la, U da to'oh la nirib ka ba ziit buraa n kpi (kum) yit na. Ka ma da a la pɔkɔ̃ɔ̃r, kan mi n da a ka ma la bii, ka zã'ã, ka zugu ka dɔɔg; ka nirikooŋ da yi teŋ la ni dol u. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Daan la n da nyɛ bompɔk la, nimbɔ̃'ɔ̃g da gbã'ã U mi, ka U yel u yii, &lt;&lt;da kumira?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Ka da yɛɛ gaat tɔɔn ti kalim kumsouŋ (daka) la, ka bayaah la tɛk zɛ'ɛn ki'i. Ka U yel yii, &lt;&lt;Burasa'araa, Mam yet i yi i dɔɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Ka kum la dɔɔ zi'in ka pĩ'ĩl tɔɣɔt, ka Yezu zaŋ u te u ma.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Dabɛɛm da sãã nirib la zã'ã; ka ba pɛ̃ɣɛt Na'ayen, yet yii, &lt;&lt;Na'ayen bah ka som paa U nirib!&gt;&gt; ka ke ka &lt;&lt;Nɔdɛ'ɛh n bɔɔn nɔdɛ'ɛh yi tam tinsok na!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />U yeledee la wa da yerig paa Geudiya teŋ ni ka kpɛ'ɛh la zã'ã.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntomirib seba n yi Geon Baptis sa'ani na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Geon nya'andolib la da pirig yel ãã woo te u. Ŋwala ka Geon da pana bɔɔl u nya'andolib la bayi <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />tom ba Daan la sa'ani yi ba bɔ'ɔh yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ n a so n nan tana laa, bee ti yi ti gur la so ha?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Buraah la n da tã U sa'ani na la, ba da yel yii, &lt;&lt;Geon Baptis n tom ti na yi ti bɔ'ɔh yii, &lt;nyɛ n a so n nan tana laa, bee ti kpelin gur la so?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Sankaŋa Yezu da kɔ'ɔn teb la nirib zɔ'ɔ zɔ'ɔ yit ba bã'ãh buuri buuri poŋi, ni seba ka kolekpãbɛ'ɛh dol, ka kpelim bah ka zɔ'ɔnam leb nyɛt. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Ka U da lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;kemi ti yel Geon yam n nyɛ ka wom se'el la: zɔ'ɔnam leb nyɛt, kaarena dɔ'ɔh ken, nkɔma ningbina leb saalim, tokperanam leb womit, kpi'inam vo'o dɔɔ, Na'ayen yelesomir la paa nɔndem mi na. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Ka kamaalug paa so woo n ka taal ni Mam?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Geon ntomirib la n da gaat ba'ah la, Yezu da pĩ'ĩl tɔɣɔt Geon Baptis yela tet nirikooŋ la yii: &lt;&lt;I da keŋ sɛ̃ɣir la ni ɛɛt yi i nyɛ la nani? Sambeog n lobit mɔɔg la ka ku mimit laa? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ka lan ka i da yi i nyɛ? So n yɛ laɣawɔɣa sommaa? Beh ma, niriseba n yɛ laɣasoma ka vo bondem vom, be la na-yɛ'. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Ka lan ka ya lee yina, yi ya nyɛ? Na'ayen nɔdɛ'ɛhiraa? Ẽẽ, N yet ya mi wa, i nan nyɛ se'el n gaat nɔdɛ'ɛhit. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ɔ̃ɔ̃ N a so yela n poŋun deŋ golih dɔ yii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">&lt;Behimaa, Mam tomira N ntomit yi u gaat i tɔɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">so n nan ma'ahum i sɔr la gur i.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Mam yet ya mi wa, so pu be ka bompɔk dɔɣɔ u teŋa ka u gaat Geon Baptise; ka tensoŋ nir ni u billa mi gaat u mi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />(Ka niriseba woo n da wom ŋwala la, laɣum ni lempodɛ'ɛhirib la, da sak Na'ayen gãkir la, se'el n so la ba da dɛ'ɛ Geon soob la mi. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Amaa Farasiinam la ni warami'irib la n da zaɣah yi ba dɛ'ɛ u soob la, da zaɣah la Na'ayen n tar putẽse'er tet ba la.)<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />&lt;&lt;N nan zaŋ la nan mak ni zomaaŋ kãã niriba? Ba ŋwani ni nani? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Ba ŋwani ni biih n zĩ da'a ni ka bɔɔn taaba yet yii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">&lt;ti pɛɛb yiih bah ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">ka ya pu wa'a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">ti kã namɔr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">ka ya pu kaahe.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Geon Baptis tana ka pu dit boom bee ŋwũũt daam, ka yam yel yii, &lt;u tara kolekpãbɛ'ɛh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Asaal Dawɔɔ tana dit ka ŋwũũt, ka ya yet yii, &lt;beh mi ni, U a la ponya'an daan ni dãbuɣit, Lempodɛ'ɛrib ni yelebe'et dem zɔ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ni yela n zã'ã, Na'ayen yam la nɛɛgit tet la seba woo n sak te U la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bompɔk Nyɛ U Yelebe'et Duuhug</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Farasiinam la nkɔ̃ da bɔɔl Yezu yi U di ni u ka U da ti kpɛ̃ u yir, zi'in yi U di. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Bompɔk da yi teŋ la ni na, a yelebe'et daan, ka un da wom yi Yezu be Farasii la yir dit la, u da tar la doɣobil ni kpaam na. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />U da zɛ'ɛl la U nya'aŋ na dɔ̃bel U nɔba bɔba kumit ka tar u nintam la n sigit Yezu nɔba zugu la pɛɛt a, ka tar u zɔɔbit duuhit a. U pana da tar u kpaam la sɔ̃ɔ̃t Yezu nɔba la. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Ka Farasii la n da nyɛ ŋwala la, u da yel u mɛŋ yi, nira n serin a la nɔdɛ'ɛh, u nan baŋe bompɔka n a so, yi u a la yelebe'et daan.<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yezu da tɔɣɔ bah na, bɔɔl u yi Simɔne, Mam tar se'el nan yel i, ka u lebih yii,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">&lt;&lt;Pa'ala&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Tɔɣɔ ma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Sampehit so n da be, da tar san-ditib bayi, nkɔ̃ la samir da a la sidi-kɔbig ka nkɔ̃ a sidi-pihinu. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Ka ba n da kun tɔ'ɔn wɔ la, u da zaŋ sama la bah te ba zã'ã mi. Nan-nan na, ba ɔn n nan nɔŋ san-daan la gaat zã'ãga?<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simɔn lebih u yii, man tẽ'ẽh yi so samir n zɔ'ɔ la. Ka Yezu yel u yii,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">&lt;&lt;i gãk somma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Yezu ŋwɛrig tɔ bompɔk la ka yel Simɔn yii, i nyɛ bompɔkaa? Mam n kpɛ̃ i yira na; I pu te N kɔ'ɔm ye M pɛɛ n nɔbaa, amaa u pɛɛ Mam nɔba ni u nintam ka zaŋ u zɔɔbit duuh. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Nyɛ pu iŋ se'el pa'al i nɔŋire, ka Man kpɛ̃ na daar bompɔka m pa'alim la nɔŋir. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />I pu sɔ̃ɔ̃h Mam zugu ni kpasom mo. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Yela zugu, man yet i mi, u nyɛ u yelebe'et la n zɔ'ɔgin la suguru dii; yela u pa'al la nɔŋir berigu. Ka so n pu nyɛ suguru dii berigu la, mi kun tar nɔŋir zɔ'ɔge.<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Ka yel bompɔk la yii, &lt;&lt;N di i yelebe'et suguru te i?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Seba n da laɣun zĩ dit la da yet taaba yi, U a la ɔni dit nirib yelebe'et suguru?<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Ka Yezu yel bompɔk la yii, &lt;&lt;I sera sakir fããgi bah, paagum ni suma'ahum?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Bompɔɣɔse'eh bɛɛl Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />La da pu wuuge, ka Yezu da ɛɛt tenkãra ni tembibih ni, tɔɔn Na'ayen tensoŋ yelesoma la tɛt nirib. U nya'andolib pii ni bayi la da be ni U mi, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />pa'ah ni bompɔɣɔse'eh ka u da kar ba kolekpãbɛ'ɛh bee teb ba bã'ãh buuri buuri la. Mɛɛri ka ba da bɔɔn Magdalin, so ka U da kar kolekpãbɛ'ɛh siyopoi yih u ni la, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Geoana n da a Kuza pɔɣɔ ka a Hɛrɔd ntomit la ni Suzana ni ba taab baseba berigu, bompɔɣɔha n da a seba n diihit ba, ka laɣun tet ba se'el woo ka ba bɔɔt ni ba mɛŋ nɔtatim.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpaat La Maɣahir la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Nirikooŋ n da yi kateŋ kateŋ tana la, U da zaŋ maɣahir yel ba yii; <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />&lt;&lt;kpaat n da bor u bomboora, ka baseba lu sɔya zut ka nirib nɔ ba ka niih mi di baseba. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Baseba mi lu kuga zugu, ka ba nyaɣa pu nyaŋ sigi teŋa, ka ba koolim kpi, kɔ'ɔm n pu paa ba la zugu. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Ka baseba lu gɔ'ɔh ni ka gɔ'ɔh la zɔ'ɔ nyaɣɛ ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Seba mi da lu la ntan somit zugu, nyaŋ zɔ'ɔ somma, wol wola kɔbih kɔbih?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Un da tɔɣɔ ba'ah la, U da yel yii, &lt;&lt;So n tar toba yi u wom un womih ma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Ka U nya'andolib la da bɔ'ɔh U yii, maɣahira vɔ̃ɔ̃r a la nani. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;N zaŋ Na'ayen yelese'a n sɔɣɔ la tɔɣɔ pa'al yam, ka seba mi, N zaŋa maɣaha tɔɣɔ te ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">ba nan behit ka kun nyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">ba nan womihit ka kun bɔke.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpaat la maɣahir la Vɔ̃ɔ̃r</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Maɣahir la vɔ̃ɔ̃r n a se'em n ŋwala: Bomboora la a la Na'ayen yelehum. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Seba n lu sɔr zugu la, a la seba n wom; ka sitana pĩ ba sũya, ka ba pu sak sera ka kun nyɛ fããgir la. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Seba mi n lu kuga zugu la, a la seba n wom yelehum la ka dɛ'ɛ ni popeelum. Amaa bam pu tar nyaɣa la, ba sera sakir la pu wuugira, makir n ti paa na ba luu pu tɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Ka seba n lu gɔ̃'ɔ̃h ni la, bam ŋmani ni seba n wom yelehum la ka nam, ligiri ni vom nyaɣahum nɔŋir n bah ka bam pu nyaŋ wole. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Ka lan a seba n lu ntan somit niŋa la, bam a la seba n ni wom yelehum la, tar kankaŋ ni yelemɛɣir ni sũsomir, tar suguru ni ŋmibig ti wol wola.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kania ka Peog Vugul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />&lt;&lt;So pu be nan laŋ kania ka zaŋ peog vugule, bee zaŋ sɔɣɔ garug leoŋ nii, u nan zaŋ yaɣɛl zĩse'e ka nirib n kpɛ̃ doog la ni, ba nan nyɛt. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Se'el n so la, se'el pu be sɔɣɛ ka nir kum baŋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Yela, iŋim ki'i ka baŋ nyɛ n nan womih se'em, se'el n so la, nutatim bee laɣɛt pa'ah la bondaan ka seba n pu tar se'el la, hali ni bam poɣum tar se'el la, ba nan kɔŋ la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Buuri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Yezu ma ni U sɔ̃ɔ̃t da tana yi ba nyɛ U, amaa ba da pu nyaŋ paa U sa'ani, nirib la n da ba zɔ'ɔ mikit la zugu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Ka ba da yel U yii, &lt;&lt;I ma ni I sɔ̃ɔ̃t n zɛ yeŋ bɔɔt yi ba nyɛ I.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Mam ma ni N sɔ̃'ɔ̃t a la seba n womit Na'ayen yelehum la, ka mi tar bu tomit?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Gɔ'ɔ Sambekãt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Daar dikɔ̃ ka U da kpɛ̃ ããruŋ ni, ni U nya'andolib la, ka da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Bah mi ka ti yak mɔɣira yakin dee ha?&gt;&gt; Ka ba pĩ'ĩl yɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />ka ban da yɛ yakit mɔɣir la, Yezu da zɛɛ gɔ'ɔm gbĩhit. Sambekãt da vuk na pĩ mɔɣir la ka kɔ'ɔm sigit pɛ'ɛn ããruŋ la. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Ba da keŋ U sa'ani tãh kpɛ'ɛmir nɛɛ U ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;N Daana, N Daana, kɔ'ɔm ma dit ti mi!&gt;&gt; Ka Un da nɛɛ la U da tãh sambekãt la ni kɔmiih la, ka ba ma'a sininini ka zĩ'ĩ woo a bããlam. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />U da bɔ'ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya sera sakir lee?&gt;&gt; Dabɛɛm da sãã ba mi ka la iŋ ba pakir, ka ba yet taaba yii, &lt;&lt;ɔ̃ɔ̃ daan a la ɔni, hali ka sambeog ni kɔ'ɔm womit U tɔɣum ka dɛ'ɛgit bu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Teb Garasenes Nir n tar Kolepkãbɛ'ɛh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Ba da paa la Garasenes teŋ, n be Galili yaɣir la. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Un da doot mɔɣir la ni na la, buraa ka kolekpãbɛ'ɛh dol n da to'oh U. Buraaga da a la bɛɛl ka mi pu kpɛ̃'ɛ̃t yir ni, u da dɔ la wɔɔt zĩ'ĩ. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Un da nyɛ Yezu la, u da lu la u nɔba ni, ka kaah baɣa baɣa yet yii, &lt;&lt;I tara lan it ni mam, Yezu, Na'ayen Se'er N gaat zã'ã Dawɔɔgaa? M belemit I mi, da mɛrim mam naa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Se'el n so la Yezu da tãh kolekpãbɛ'ɛh la mi yi ba yi buraa la ni na. (Lan da ni ti gbirig u, ba da ni gur u mi ka ba' u ni bana, ka ni yela mɛŋ zã'ã u da ni kɛ̃h bana wa mi ka kolekpãbɛ'ɛha tar u yi sɛ̃ɣir ni ha.)<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yezu da pana bɔ'ɔh u yii, &lt;&lt;I wo'ore?&gt;&gt; U da lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Tam (ligin)&gt;&gt; — se'el n so la kolekpãbɛ'ɛh la da zɔ'ɔ u poŋin mi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Ka ba belim U yi U da kar ba ka ba yi leb boɣokãt la ni.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Sankaŋ ma'a la Kurikurinam berigu n da ɛɛt zɔɔr la labin dit, ka kolekpãbɛ'ɛh la da soh Yezu yi U bah ka ba kpɛ̃ kurikurinam la. Ka U da sak teba. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Ka kolekpãbɛ'ɛha da bah buraa la ka keŋ ti kpɛ̃ kurikurinam la, ka ba da zo sigi mɔɣir la ni, ka kɔ'ɔm di ba.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Seba n kemit kurikurinam la n da nyɛ se'el n iŋ la, ba da zo mi kpɛ̃ teŋ la ni, ni tembibise'eh woo n kpɛ ba la ti n tɔɔlum se'el ka ba nyɛ la zã'ã te ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Ka nirib da yina yi ba beh se'el n it, ka ban da paa Yezu sa'ani la, ba da nyɛ burase'e ka kolekpãbɛ'ɛh dol la n zĩ Yezu nɔba bɔba, yɛ fuug ka u yam leb na. Dabɛɛm da gba'a ba mi. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Seba n da be ni ka nyɛ lan iŋ se'em la, da tɔɣɔ pa'al ba buraaga n da nyɛ u fããgir la se'em. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ka Garasenes ni ka kɔrun - kɔrum nirib la zã'ã da yel Yezu yi u keŋ ka bah ba, den zugu, dabɛkãt n da gbã'ã ba. Yela ka U da kpɛ̃ ããruŋ la ni tulig leb. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Kolekpãbɛ'ɛh la n yi burase'e ni la, da soh Yezu yi U bah ka u dol U, amaa Yezu da yel u yi u keŋ, ka yet u yii, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />&lt;&lt;Lebim kul, ni i ti bah ka nirib wom Na'ayen n tom se'el te i?&gt;&gt; Buraaga da keŋ, tɔɔn teŋ la zã'ã kaagit, yet Yezu N tom se'em te ɔŋ.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bompuŋ Leb Vo'o ka Bompɔk mi nyɛ u Tebug</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yezu n da tulig leb la, nirikooŋ la da to'oh U mi ni popeelum, ban da gur U la zugu. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />La da pu wuuge ka buraa wo'or n bɔɔn Gayirus, so n da a tɔɔn-gat be Yen po'ohug dobil la ni la da paa na. U da lu Yezu nɔba ni ka belim yi U tã u yir na, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />u biyeŋ, bompuŋ n a wom pii ni ayi, n da dɔ bẽ'ẽt yɛ kum.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Ka Un da ken la nirib la da mikirin nɔɔt taaba nɔba dol U. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Bompɔk kakɔ̃ mi n da be sigi sɛɛ ka ka pu kãhigira ti paa wom pii ni ayi; ka da sãɣam ka laɣat zã'ã dol teb-nam, ka ba so da pu nyaŋ teb u wa. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />U da dolih Yezu nya'aŋ ti kalim U fuug, nila nila ka ziim la ŋmaa.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Ka Yezu da bɔ'ɔh yii, &lt;&lt;Ɔni n si'ih M ma?&gt;&gt; Ka nir woo n da ki'ih la, Pita da yel u yii, &lt;&lt;N Daana, niriba n zɔ'ɔ se'em kaa I bah tinsok da'at taaba se'em maa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ka Yezu yel yii, &lt;&lt;So n si'ihum, se'el n so la M baŋ yi paŋ yi N sa'ani?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Bompɔk la n da baŋ yi u kun le nyaŋ sɔɣɔ la, u da yi mi na gbi'it ka lu Yezu tɔɔn; ka yet nirikooŋ la se'el zugu ka u si'ih U la. U da yel ba yi un si'ih U la u bã'ã la bah u mi nila nila. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yezu da yel u yii, &lt;&lt;M pɔɣɔwɔɔga, i sera sakir la teb i; kem ni suma'ahum?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Un da nan be ni tɔɣɔt la, so da zɛ'ɛl kpɛ'ɛm la yir tana yel yii, &lt;&lt;I pɔɣɔwɔɔ la kpi ya; da le nɔŋ yi i daam pa'ala ya'aha?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Yezu n da wom yel la, U da lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Da zot dabɛɛm. Sakum sera, ka u nan nyɛ fããgir?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Un da paa yir la ni la, U da pu sak ka so dolih U kpɛ̃ doog la nii; Pita, Geon, ni Gemis zaŋ bii la ba' ni u ma' ma'a n da dol kpɛ̃. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Ba zã'ã da kumiri ka si'imit kum la zugu; amaa Yezu da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Da kumiri nii; se'el n so la, u pu kpi'i ka u gbihirin mi.<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Ka ba da la'at U, ka mi yi u kpi mi. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Ka U da gĩ u nu'ug ka bɔ'ɔl u yii, &lt;&lt;Biiga, dɔɔ ma!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Ka ka vom la da leb na, ka u vaa dɔɔ kalam. Yezu da yel ba yi ba te u se'el ka u di. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />La da iŋ u dɔɣɔrib la la pakir, amaa U da yel ba yi ba da bah ka so wom se'el n iŋaa. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false" /></note><verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu da tom u nya'andolib pii ni bayi la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yezu da bɔɔl U nya'andolib pii ni bayi la te ba paŋ ni kpe'ense'eog n nan tɔ'ɔn sa'ah kolekpãbɛ'ɛh ka mi teb bã'ãh, <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />U da tom ba yi ba keŋ tɔɣɔ Na'ayen so'olum na'am la yela ka mi teb nirib. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Da zaŋi se'el se'el keŋ ya sɔraa, dɔɔr bee tapɔk bee dii bee laɣauho, da poɣun zaŋi fuug pa'ahe. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Ya n ti kpɛ̃ yise'er la, been yi den ti paa daase'er ka ya nan bah teŋ kaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Zĩse'e n pu dɛ'ɛ ya saanɛ, bah mi niŋa, ka kpa'ah ya taɣara ntampuɣuhum la bah ka yi, ŋwala n nan a ya dããluŋ dɔ gi'in ba. <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Ba da yi dolih teh la tɔɔn Na'ayen yelesoma la, ka tebit bã'ãh zĩ'ĩ woo.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hɛrɔd Yam borigir la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Na'ab Hɛrɔd n da wom se'el woo n iŋ u teŋ la ni la, u da yar gaami, se'el n so la, nirib la seba da yet yi Geon, so n da soot nirib la n vo'o dɔɔ kum poŋi, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />ka seba mi yet yi Ilaagɛ n nɛɛ u mɛŋ, hali ka seba mi yet yii, daalimi nɔdɛ'ɛhirib la nkɔ̃ n vo'o dɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Na'ab Hɛrɔd da yel yii, &lt;&lt;Geon, so ka mam da fik u zugu laa; ka la pana a la ɔni ka n womit u yela wa?&gt;&gt; Ka u da pana bɔɔt yi u nyɛ u.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu da Diih Nirib Tuha Anu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Ba n da leb na la, nya'andolib la da tũ se'el woo ka ba iŋ la pa'al Yezu. Ka U da tar ba yi ba ma'a keŋ teŋ ka ka wo'or bɔɔn Bɛfesayida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Nirikooŋ la n da baŋ la, ba da tũ U zĩ'ĩ mi keŋ; ka U da dɛ'ɛ ba ka tɔɣɔ Na'ayen so'olum na'am la yela pa'al ba, ka teb seba n tar bã'ãh la.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Wuntɛɛŋ n da yɛ luu la, U nya'andolib pii ni bayi la da paa U tɔɔn yel U yii, bahum nirib la ka ba keŋ tenkpeha ni ha beh zĩse'e ka ba nan gbɛ̃ ka bɔ dii di, ka ti n be zĩ'ĩga so so ka niŋa.<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Amaa U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yam te m ba se'el ka ba di?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Ka ba lebih U yel yii, Ti tar la boruboru banu ni zimi ayi ma'a, lan ka yelaa, la a la ti keŋ da diit na te nirikooŋa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Se'el n so la, buraah ma'a kãl da a aa tuha anu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Ka U yel U nya'andolib la yii, &lt;&lt;Bah mi ka ba zi'in nirib piih-nu, nu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Ba da iŋ yela ka bah ka ba zi'in teŋ. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />U pana da zaŋ boruboru ba nu la ni zimi ayi la, gɔrig beh Yen zugu ha ka kamaal ba, ka gbɛ'ɛh ba zaŋ te U nya'andolib la, yi ba tɔ̃r nirikooŋ la. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Ba zã'ã da di tɛɣɛ mi ka se'el n da kpelim la, ba da vaa pɛ'ɛl pe'et pii ni ti yi.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pita da Pa'al Yezu n a So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Saŋa kakɔ̃, ka Yezu da po'ohit U ma'a, Ka U nya'andolib la da pu zĩ zãã ni U wa, ka U bɔ'ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;nirikooŋ la yel yi Mam a la Ɔni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Ka ba lebih yii, Seba yet yi &lt;&lt;Geon Baptis, ka seba yet yi Ilaagɛ, hali seba kpelin yet yi daalimi ha nɔdɛ'ɛhirib la nkɔ̃ n vo'o dɔɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Ka U le bɔ'ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ka yam yel yi N a la ɔni?&gt;&gt; Ka Pita lebih yii, &lt;&lt;I a la Fããt la n yi Na'ayen sa'ani na la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu deŋ yel U kum ni U vo'ogun dɔɔ yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />U da kpa'am ba kpɛ'ɛmiri yi ba da yel so so'o, <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />yet yii, &lt;&lt;La a la pɛ̃rigir yi Asaal Dawɔɔ la nyɛ namihug n ka makire, ka kpɛɛnam, malemadem ni gban-mi'irib la zã'ã, nan zaɣah U ka ko' U, ka Dabiha atã daar U nan vo'o dɔɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Ka U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Seba n bɔɔt yi ba a Mam Nya'andolib la, a la ba ki'ih ba mɛŋ ka zaŋ ba mpuuredɔɔg daar woo dol Mam. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Seba n bɔɔt ba vom nan kɔŋ bu, ka seba n kɔŋ ba vom Mam wo'or zugu nan tar bu. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Lan ŋwɔɔt ka ba nan nyɛ bam n tar teŋa zugu laɣat zã'ã ka kɔŋ ba vom? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Valim n tar seba ni Mam ni N yeletɔɣum la, yela nɔɔ ka Asaal Dawɔɔ la mi nan ti tar valim ni ba dem Un ti tana ni U na'am la ni Ba' la ni U Maleka soma la.<verse eid="LUK 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Yelemɛŋir ka N yet ya wa, seba zɛ kpela ka kum kun paa baa, lan ka la ba nyɛ la Na'ayen tensoŋ so'olum laa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ningbiŋ tɛɛgir la yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Un da ti tɔɣɔ ŋwala ba'ah ka dabiha a nii gaat la, Yezu da zaŋ Pita, Geon ni Gemis dol ni ba do zɔɔr zugu yi ba po'oh. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Ka Un da be ni po'ohit la, U nindaa da tɛɛ mi, ka u fuug la peelig nyaɣit fina, fina. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Ka nila nɔɔ, ba da nyɛ ka buraah siyi, Moozis ni Ilaagɛ nɛɛ na ni ba saazugu som zɛ tɔɣɔt te Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Ba da tɔɣɔt te U dol la U Geruzalɛm teŋ ken la, ni U kum la se'el ka U maahimit yi U iŋ la. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Gɔɔm da ven Pita ni U taab la mi, ka ban da nɛ se'em ma'a la, ba da nyɛ U ningbiŋ tɛɛgir la mi, ni buraah siyi la n da zɛ ni U la. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Moozis ni Ilaagɛ n da yi ba keŋ ka bah U la Pita da yel U yii, &lt;&lt;N Daana, la a somma yi ti be kpela; bahum ka ti tĩ soɣa atã, Nyɛ dikɔ̃, Moozis dikɔ̃, Ilaagɛ dikɔ̃&gt;&gt; ka poɣum pu mi un yet se'el la gbine.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Un da be ni yet ŋwala la, ka sangbauŋ da vuu na pĩ ba zã'ã, ka ba da gbi'it ni dabɛɛm.<verse eid="LUK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Ka nkɔr zɛ'ɛl sangbauŋ la ni na yet yii, &lt;&lt;Mam Dawɔɔ n ŋwala, so ka N lɔɔ la, womih mi ni U!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Nkɔr la n da tɔɣɔ ba'ah la, ba da nyɛ ka Yezu zɛ U ma'a. Ka ba da leb sin bããlam ka dabih aŋ poŋi la ba da pu yel so so se'el ka ba nyɛ laa.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu da Teb Buribig so n tar Kolekpãbɛ'ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Beog n da kãã, ka ba poɣun zɛ'ɛn zɔɔr la zugu sigi na la, nirikooŋ n da to'oh U. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Niŋa la, ka buraa zɛ'ɛn nirib la tinsok ha tãhit yii, &lt;&lt;Pa'ala, m belimit I mi, yi I beh n dawɔɔga, n bii ka zã'ã n la. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Nila nila ka kolekpãbɛ'ɛ la zɛ' bii la bah teŋ, ka u tɛ̃bit ka nantɔ̃pulumpuut dɛ'ɛ u nɔɔr zã'ã a aa niiŋ n gbã'ã u la; la da it u la ŋwala ka pu maam bahira. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Mam daa so'oh I nya'andolib la yi ba teb u ka ba daa pu nyaŋe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yezu lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yam seba n ka sera sakir ni ya punanim zomaaŋa ni, Man yi M be ni ya wuu la yela, ka laɣam maan ya yela? Tar i dawɔɔ la tã kpela na?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Bii la n da be ni kenna la, ka kolekpãbɛ'ɛga zaŋ u fãb teŋ a aa niiŋ n ni gbã'ã bii se'em la. Ka Yezu tãh kolekpãbɛ'ɛga, ka buribig la nyɛ ka tebug, ka U zaŋ u leb te u ba'. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Ka nir woo da ya nɔɔr ni Na'ayen toon tinta'ara.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yezu le deŋ tɔɣɔ U Kum yela</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Nir woo n da nan ya nɔɔr ni yelese'a woo ka U tomit la, U da yel U nya'andolib la yii,<verse eid="LUK 9:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />&lt;&lt;Bah mi ka yelehum ma kpɛ̃ ya toba ni: Ba nan dɔ̃r Asaal Dawɔɔ la zaŋ iŋ nirib nu'uh ni?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Amaa ba da pu bɔk Un yet se'el la, tɔɣum la gbin da pu nɛɛ te baa, ka ba nan bɔk buu. Ba mi da zot yi ba bɔ'ɔh U tɔɣum la gbin.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔni n a kpɛ'ɛm Yelemɛŋire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Ngaam n da dɔɔ ba tinsok bɔ'ɔhit nyaa ba ɔni paŋ n gaat zã'ãga? <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Ka Yezu n poɣum baŋ ban te'ẽhit se'em la, U da darig bii paa U sa'ani, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />ka yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;So n dɛ'ɛ biiga ni sunɔŋir Mam wo'or zugu, dɛ'ɛ la Mam, ka so mi n dɛ'ɛ Mam ni nɔŋir dɛ'ɛ la so n tom Mam na la, so n a tarim ya ni ɔŋ kpe'eoŋ n gaat ya zã'ã?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samaariya Tembil zaɣah Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Geon da lebih yii, &lt;&lt;N Daana, tam nyɛ la so n tar I wo'or kat kolekpãbɛ'ɛh, ka ti zɛɣɛt yi ti gu' u, lan zugo, ɔŋ m pu laɣun dol ti la?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Ka Yezu lebih u yii, &lt;&lt;Da gu'ut in u wa; ka so woo n pu kih i a la i nir?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samaariya Tembil Zaɣah Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />La n da pɔ̃r yi ba tar U do tensoŋin la, U da ŋmɛrig U nimbia yɛ Geruzalɛm. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />U da deŋ tomma nirib yi ba gaat U tɔɔn ha, ba n da be sɔr yɛ la, ba da kpɛ̃ Samaariya tembil se'e yi ba ma'ahum te U, <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />amaa teŋa dem da pu sak dɛ'ɛ U, Ɔŋ N da deŋ kpã yɛ Geruzalɛm la zugu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />U nya'andolib, Gemis ni Geon n da nyɛ ŋwala la, ba da yel yii, &lt;&lt;N Daana, I bɔɔt yi ti tãh ka buɣum zɛ'ɛl Na'ayen zugu na di baa,?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ka Yezu da ŋmɛrig tãh ba. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Ka ba da keŋ lɔŋ tembil kakɔ̃ ni ha.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Seba n sa nan a Yezu nya'andolib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Ba n da dol sɔr la yɛ la, so da yel Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;N nan dol I keŋ zĩ'ĩ woo ka I yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Ka Yezu yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Piini tar woɣot, ka niih m be saazugu ha la mi tar tɛɣɛt; ka Asaal Dawɔɔga pu tar zĩ'ĩ ka U nan zaŋ U zugu koɣole?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />U da le yel so yii, &lt;&lt;Dol Mam na?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Amaa u da yel yii, &lt;&lt;N Daana, bahum ka n kul ti laa n ba' yiiga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Ka Yezu leb yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Bahum ka kum laa ba mɛŋ; ka lan a nyɛ, kem ti tɔɔlum Na'ayen tensoŋ yela la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Nkɔ̃ mi da yel yii, &lt;&lt;Mam nan dolih I, N Daana; ka bahum ka n kul ti ke'eh n yir dem?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yezu da yel u yii, So n zaŋ u nu'ug paɣɛl naɣakɔɔra kũũr zugu, ka gbel won u nya'aŋ ha, pu nar yi u be Na'ayen so'olum la poŋii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Nir-pihiyopoi la Toomir la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ŋwala n da ba'ah la, Daan la da lɔɔ la nir seba mi pihiyopoi tom ba bayi, bayi yi ba gaat U tɔɔn keŋ tense'eh woo ka U da tar putẽ'ẽr yi U keŋ la. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Dii la zaŋir zɔ'ɔ mi, ka seba n nan tom la n pɔ'ɔ; yela zugu, yel mi daan la n a poog la daan la, yi u ke ka ntomirib tana pa'ah. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Ya kemma. Beh mi, Mam tomit ya mi a aa pebibih n gɛ̃rigit ni ngbeya la. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Da zãlin potamaan, bee tapɔk, bee taɣaraa; da po'ohin so n be sɔr la zugo.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Ya n ni kpɛ̃ yise'er woo, ya n po'ohum ba yii, &lt;Suma'ahum be yidee ni!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Ka so m be ni ka sak po'ohuga, ya suma'ahum la nan be u sa'ani; amaa la n ka yela, bu nan leb ya sa'ani na. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Kpelim mi yiden ni, dit ka ŋwũũt se'el woo ka ba te ya, se'el n so la, ntomit woo nar yi u dɛ'ɛ wɔɔt. Da lɔhirin yɛ'ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Ya n keŋ teŋ ni, ka nirib la dɛ'ɛ ya saan, di mi se'el woo ka ba te ya; <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />teb mi ba'anam seba n be ni la, ka yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Na'ayen tensoŋ so'olum la tana lɛm ni ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Ka sanse'e woo ka ya n kpɛ̃ teŋ ni ka ba pu dɛ'ɛ yaa, yi mi ka ni do pala zut ka yel yii, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />&lt;Hali ya teŋ ntan la n poɣum puk ti nɔba wa, ti kpa'ah ba bah pa'an yi ti gɛ̃ mi ni ya. Baŋ mi dee la wa: Na'ayen so'olum la tã la pɔ̃riga na.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Mam yet ya mi wa, daan den daar la, la daa nan a ma' ma' Sodom teŋ la ni gaat tenkaŋ.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɔɔ nan paa Tense'eh n pu sak tɛɛgire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Bɔɔ nyɛ yam, Korazin! bɔɔ paa yam Befesayida! Yelenyalinse'a ka ya nyɛ wa Taya ni Sidon dem n da nyɛɛn na aŋ taab, ba da naan ki'ihin ba yelebe'et wunse'erin ha zĩ ni bora fut ni tampɛ̃ɣɛlum. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Amaa gãkir la ni daan nan a sɔ̃sɔ̃ tet Taya ni Sidon gaat yam. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Ka yam Kapanaum, yam nan kpɛ̃ tensoŋaa? Aai, ba nan tar ya sigi wɔɔrin.<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />&lt;&lt;So woo n womihit ya, womihira Mam, ka so woo n zaɣah ya, zaɣah la Mam, ka so n zaɣah Mam, zaɣah la so n tom Mam na la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nirib pihiyopoi la lebig na la yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Nirib pihiyopoi la da leb mi na ni popeelum, yet yii, &lt;&lt;Daana, I wo'or zugu hali kolekpãbɛ'ɛh sak te ti mi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Mam nyɛ sitaana ka u zɛ'ɛl Na'ayen zugu lut na a aa saa n nyak la. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Wol mi nii, Mam te ya kpe'eoŋ yi ya nɔɔt bombɛ'ɛh ni nah, ka ya dindem paŋ kum nyaŋ bik yaa, se'el ka' nan daam yaa. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Ni yela mɛŋ, da nyɛɛmirin yi kolekpãbɛ'ɛh sakit ya nɔya, ka toɣun nyɛɛm mi yi ya wo'ora golih dɔ tensoŋin ha?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Nyɛɛm mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Sankaŋ la nɔɔ, Yezu da nyɛɛm ni Vo'ohun Som Sii la poŋi ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;N te I tooma, M Ba'a, saazugu ni teŋ Daana, se'el n so la, Nyɛ sɔɣɛ yel ãã la wa yam ni mi'ilim dem sa'ani ka nɛɛ a te bibibih; ẽẽ, M Ba'a, ŋwala wa pa'al yi I tom la I sũũr M bɔɔt se'em la.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Mam Ba' la zaŋ se'el woo te M mi; ka so pu mi Dawɔɔ la n a so'o, la n ka Ba' la ma'a, bee Ba' la n a so'o, la n ka Dawɔɔ la ma'a ni so ka Dawɔɔ la lɔɔ yi U pirig pa'ale?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Ka Un da ŋmɛrig tɔ U nya'andolib la, Yezu da yel ba ma'a yii, &lt;&lt;Kamaalug be ni yam n nyɛt se'el la! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />M yet ya mi yi nɔdɛ'ɛhirib berigu ni nanam da bɔɔt yi ba nyɛ yam n nyɛt se'el la, ka pu nyɛɛ, ka mi da bɔɔt yi ba wom yam n womit se'el la, ka pu wom?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samaariya teŋ Nivosoŋ la Maɣahir la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Nila nila wara-mi'it da dɔɔ zɛ'ɛl yi U mak Yezu. Ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;Pa'ala,&gt;&gt; mam nan iŋ la yela ka nyɛ vom kum ba'ah la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Ka U yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Lan n golih dɔ wara la ni? Lan ka i kaan niŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Ka u lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Nɔŋim i Daan Na'ayen la ni i sũũr zã'ã, ni i sii ni i paŋ ni putẽ'ẽr zã'ã; ka nɔŋ i taraan a aa i mɛŋ la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Ka Yezu yel u yii, &lt;&lt;I lebihug la a ntɔɔ, iŋim yela, ka i nan vo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Un da bɔɔt yi u te u mɛŋ boot la, u da le bɔ'ɔh Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;Ka ɔn n a mam taraana?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yezu lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Buraa n da zɛ'ɛl Geruzalɛm yɛ Geriko, ka da lu naɣayi fããrih nu'uhin, ba da ŋmɛ u ka fã u se'el woo, ka bah u ka u a nan kpi. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />La da ti mak mi ka Malemadaan dol niŋa yɛ gat, ka un da nyɛ u la, u da lɔk mi keŋ gaat. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Yela nɔɔ, ka Levi nir mi da paa ni, nyɛ u ka gaat. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Amaa Samaariya teŋ nir mi da paa na nyɛ u, ka zo u nimbɔ̃'ɔ̃g. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />U da paa u sa'ani zaŋ daam duuh u nɔra la, ka zaŋ kpaam ma' ka bob a somma. U pana da zaŋ u yaɣɛl u boŋ zugu tar u keŋ saam yir, te behit u. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Ka beog n da yelig la, u da zaŋ ligiri n a dabiha ayi wɔɔt, te so n behit yir la ka yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Wolim u zugu somma ka man ti leb na n nan wɔ sam-se'er woo ka i nyɛ la.<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Nirib batã wa poŋi, ba ɔni ka nyɛ tẽ'ẽh yi, u a taraan tet nira ka naɣayiih fã wa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />&lt;&lt;Ka u yel yii, &lt;&lt;So n zo u nimbɔ̃'ɔ̃g la?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Ka Yezu yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Kem ti iŋ yela nɔɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu limih Maata ni Mɛɛri gɔɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Bam n da dɛ'ɛ sɔr yɛ la, U da kpɛ̃ tembil se'e ka bompɔk n bɔɔn Maata da dɛ'ɛ U saan kpɛ̃'ɛ̃h u yir. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />U sɔ̃ɔ̃g mi n da be, bɔɔn Mɛɛri, so n da zĩ kpɛ Daan la nɔba bɔba ka womihit se'el ka U yet la. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Amaa la da womit Maata mi ni tooma la n da zɔ'ɔ se'em nar yi u tom la; Ka u da tana bɔ'ɔh Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;Daana, la pu pak I ni n sɔ̃ɔ̃ga n bah tooma wa zã'ã te mam ma'a waa? Yelim u ka u soŋum?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Ka Daan la da lebih u yii, &lt;&lt;Maata, Maata, yela zɔ'ɔ zɔ'ɔ n daamit i; <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />ka yel dikɔ̃ ma'a n pak, Mɛɛri lɔɔ la yelesomir la, ka so kun nyaŋ dɛ'ɛ di u sa'anii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Daan la po'ohug</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />U da po'ohirin zĩ'ĩ kakɔ̃, ka Un da po'oh ba'ah la, U nya'andolib la nkɔ̃ da yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Daana, pa'alim ti po'ohug, a aa Geon n da pa'an u nya'andolib la se'em la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yam m po'ohit, yan yel yii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Ba'a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">I wo'or zɔ'ɔ mi ni pɛ̃ɣɛb.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">I na'am so'olum la tana,<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Tem ti dabihir woo ti nɔɔr dii.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Ka di ti yelebe'et suguru te ti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">a aa tam mi n dit suguru te seba woo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">n tom taal gɛ̃'ɛ̃h ti se'em la.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">Ka da tar ti paa gãkir saŋa laa.<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋmibig ni po'ohug</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Ka Yezu yel ba yii, maɣah wuu ya so n tar u zɔ, ka keŋ u sa'ani wo'ontasoo saŋa ti yel u yii, n zɔɔ, peŋim mam boruboru batã; <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />ka n zɔ n tã n sa'ani na, ka m mi pu tar se'el n nan te u wa.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Ka u be u doog ni ha ka lebih yii, &lt;Da daam mam; doog koliŋ la poɣun deŋ wo' mi, ka mam ni m biih dɔ gbihit; n kun nyaŋ dɔɔ zaŋ se'el te i ya.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Mam yet ya mi wa, un poɣun kun dɔɔ te u se'el la, ɔŋ n a u zɔ la zugo, u bolig la zugu, u nan kpelin dɔɔ te u se'el woo ka u bɔɔt la.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Yela la N yet ya mi wa, Bɔ'ɔh ma, ka i nan dɛ'ɛ; Ɛ ma ka i nan nyɛ; ŋmɛ'ɛm koliŋ la, ka ka nan wo'o te i. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />So woo n bɔ'ɔhit, nan dɛ'ɛhit, Ka so woo n ɛɛt, na nyɛt, ka so woo n ŋmɛ'ɛt koliŋ la, ka nan wo'ohit.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Ya so be ti tinsok kpela ka u bii nan bɔ'ɔh u ziŋ yel, ka u zaŋ bombɛ'ɛ te u ka ka ziŋaa? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Bee bii la nan bɔ'ɔh gel yel, ka u zaŋ naŋ te u? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Yam n poɣun lɔr ni se'em mi, ya mi bonsomila mi tar te ya biih, la pana nan iŋ la yela, ka Ba' la N be tensoŋ na'am yir la, kun te seba n bɔ'ɔhit la, Vo'ohun Som Sii la!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ni Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Sankãã la wa, U da kat la kolekpãbɛ'ɛ yi ka yi, ka ka sin digi digi; kan da yi ba'ah la, ɔŋ so n da sin digi digi la, da ya'a nɔɔr tɔɣɔt, ka la da iŋ nirikooŋ la pakir. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Amaa ba seba da yet yii, &lt;&lt;U tar la Beelzebul so n a kolekpãbɛ'ɛh na'ab la paŋ kat kolekpãbɛ'ɛh la yihit nirib la ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Seba n bɔɔt yi ba mak U beh la, da zɛ mi yi U te ba yelemaan n zɛ'ɛl saazugu na.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ka U da baŋ ban tẽ'ẽhit se'em la mi, ka yel ba yii, tense'e woo n bɔɣɔh ba mɛŋ zabit, nan lebig daboot, ka yir lut yir zugu. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Sitaana mi n bɔɣɔh u mɛŋ, u so'olum la nan iŋa yela zɛ'ɛle? Yam yel yi Mam tar la Beelzebul paŋ kat kolepkãbɛ'ɛh. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Nan-nan na, Mam N kat kolekpãbɛ'ɛh ni Beelzebul paŋ, yam dol nan-taah la tar la ɔn paŋ kat ba bahit la? Yela la bam n nan a seba n nan gãkit tet ya. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Ka lan a la Na'ayen nubil paŋ ka N tar kat kolekpãbɛ'ɛh la, la pa'al yi Na'ayen tensoŋ na'am la tã ya sa'ani na.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Paŋ daan n yɛ zabir laɣɛt gur u yir, u lauk kun borige. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Amaa so' mi paŋ n gaat u daan ka zab nyaŋ u ka fãã u zabir laɣɛse'et n te u paŋ la, u nan nyaŋ yerig u laɣɛt la bah.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />So woo n pu be ni Mam a la N dindaan, so woo n pu kã'ãhit ni Mam, yerigit mi.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kolekpãbɛ'ɛ la lebig na la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />&lt;&lt;Kolekpãbɛ'ɛ n yi nir poŋi, u ɛɛt la zĩse'e ka kɔ'ɔm ka'a behit zĩse'e ka u nan vo'oh, u mi kun nyɛ. Ka u nan yet yii, &lt;N nan leb la yise'er ka n daa yi na la.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Un paa di ni, u nan nyɛ yi di piih mi ma'al ma'al dɔ wolam. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />U nan pana leb ti tar kolekpãbɛ'ɛh siyopoi n lɔr gaat ɔŋ mɛŋ na pa'ah ka ba kpɛ̃ ningbiŋ la niŋa; ka nir la anim nan lɔr gaat un daa a se'em yiiga la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kamaalug Yelemɛŋir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Sanse'e ka U da yet ŋwala la, ka bompɔk zɛ'ɛl nirikooŋ la ni ãrig nkɔr kpɛ'ɛmir yet yii, &lt;&lt;Kamaalug be ni pose'er n da zi I la, ni bĩ'ĩh se'a m mɔɣɔh I la!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Ka U lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Kamaalug toɣum be mi ni seba n wom Na'ayen yelehum la ka sak te bu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Geona Dããluŋ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Nirikooŋ la n da ti laɣah zɔ'ɔgit pa'ahit la, U da pĩ'ĩl yet yii, &lt;&lt;Zomaan-kãã wa a la be'et zomaaŋ; ka ɛɛt la dããluŋ, amaa ka kun nyɛɛ lan ka Geona dããluŋ la ma'a. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />A aa Geona n da lebig dããluŋ tet Ninevedem la, yela nɔɔ ka Asaal Dawɔɔ la nan a tet zomaaŋa. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Teŋir pɔɣɔna'ab nan dɔɔ gãkir daar la ni zomaan-kã'ã dem ka zɛrig ba, den zugu u da zɛ'ɛ la teŋ gbin ni na yi u womih Solomɔn yan som la, ka beh mi nii, se'el n gaat Solomɔn ni u yam la n ŋwala! <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Nineve teŋ dem nan dɔɔ saazugu gãkir daar la ni zomaan-kã'ã niriba ka zɛrig ba, se'el n so la ba da ki'ih ba yelebe'et la Geona tɔɣum la ni, ka beh mi nii, se'el n gaat Geona n ŋwala!<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ningbiŋ la peelim la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />&lt;&lt;So' pu be nan laŋ kania ka zaŋ ka sɔɣɔ zɛ'ɛl leoŋ nii, u nan zaŋ yaɣɛl la zĩse'e ka la nan nɛɛgit tet so woo n kpɛ̃'ɛ̃t na. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />I niuh n a kania tet i ningbiŋ la. I niuh n tar nimma'ahum i ningbiŋ la zã'ã pɛ'ɛl mi ni peelim; ka bun ka nimma'ahum, i ningbiŋ la mi nan pɛ'ɛl ni ligir. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Den zugu, behim nyaa i peelim la n be i poŋin la nɛɛgit mi bee bu a la lika. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Ka lan a la i ningbiŋ la pɛ'ɛl mi ni peelim, ka lik pu be zĩ'ĩ zĩ'ĩga, ka nan pɛ'ɛl ni peelim, a aa kania peelim n nɛɛ se'em la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu zi'ih Farasiinam ni Wara gban-mi'irib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Un da be ni tɔɣɔt se'em ma'a la, ka Farasiinam la nkɔ̃ da yel U yi ba keŋ u yir ti di; ka U da dol ni u ti kpɛ̃ ka ba zi'in yi ba di. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />La da iŋ Farasii wa la pakir yi un nyɛ ka Yezu pu pɛɛ nu'uhe ka ma'ahum yi U di la.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Ka Daan la da yel u yii, Nan-nan na, yam Farasiinam ma pɛɛra ŋmana ni laah la nya'ah, amaa ya poŋin la pɛ'ɛl mi ni bɛ'ɛt ni putoog. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Yam gaana wa! La ka so' n da maal nya'aŋ la nɔɔ n maal poŋin la mi? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Yela la zaŋ mi se'el zã'ã n be poŋin la te nɔndem, ka beh mi, se'el woo nan a filam tet ya.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />&lt;&lt;Bɔɔ nan nyɛ yam Farasiinam! Yam te Na'ayen pii kɔbig poŋi, se'el woo ka ya nyɛ a aa ki bee bonkɔ̃bit, ka toɣum bah yelemɛŋir ni nɔŋir tet Na'ayen; yel ãã n nar yi ya it, ka da lɔɔgin baseba la bahe.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Bɔɔ nan laŋ yam Farasiinam ma! Yam n nɔŋ yi ya zĩ birikina koɣih zugu Na'ayen po'ohug dobibih ni ka nirib it ya naa naa da'ah poŋin la.<verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Bɔɔ nyɛ ya! Yam n a aa wɔse'et n saa ka nirib nɔɔt gat ka pu mi la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Wara gban-mi'irib la nkɔ̃ da lebih U yii, &lt;&lt;Pa'ala, Nyɛ n yet yel ãã wa, I to'ot ti mi n la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Ka U yel yii, Bɔɔ nan laŋ yam wara gban-mi'irib ba! Yam n tar zitebiha n gaat zã'ã ziin nirib, ka yam ya mɛŋ pu zɛ̃kit nubil yi ya soŋ ba la.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Bɔɔ laŋ yam! Yam m mɛɛt Na'ayen nɔdɛ'ɛhirib seba ka ya yaanam da ko' la wɔɔt la. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Yela la ya a la sɛhira nam, ka mi nam ya yaanam n da tom se'em la; bam n da ko' ba la, ka mɛɛt ba wɔɔt. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Yela mi la Na'ayen yam la yel yii, &lt;Mam nan tom N nɔdɛ'ɛhirib ni nya'andolib ba sa'ani na, ba nan ko' baseba ka gãk baseba ni ŋwɛlima,' <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ŋwala la, zomaan-kãã nan nyɛ gãkir yit Na'ayen nɔdɛ'ɛhirib la ziim la n da kpa'a teŋa pĩ'ĩlug ni na la, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />zɛ'ɛn Abɛl ti paa Zakariya zi'im ni, bam seba n da kɔŋ ba vom kããbug nkuna la zut la. Ẽẽ, Mam yet ya mi wa, ba taal la dol la zomaan-kãã la wa.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Bɔɔ nan nyɛ yam wara gban-mi'iriba! Yam n zaŋ mi'ilim saafi la keŋ la; yam mɛŋ da pu kpɛ̃'ɛ̃, ka ya da gu' la seba n kpɛ̃'ɛ̃t la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Un da yi yeŋ la, gban-mi'irib la ni Farasiinam la da daamit U mi ka bɔ'ɔh U yela berigu, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />bɔɔt yi ba bɛ̃r U ni se'el ka U nan yel la.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ŋmɛlema dem Tobir ŋmaagir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Nirikooŋ la n da mikit ka nɔɔt taaba la, U da pĩ'ĩl tɔɣɔt tet U nya'andolib la yii, &lt;&lt;Mi'in Farasiinam dãbin la yel, lan a la ba ŋmɛlema la. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Se'el pu be sɔɣɔ ka kun nɛɛ naa, yel mi pu be sɔɣɔ ka daan kun yi naa. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Yela, se'el woo ka ya yel lik poŋi, nan ti kpɛ̃'ɛ̃t toba ni peelimi, ka se'el ka ya wɔɔhit taaba toba ni la, nan ti do gɔhit zut tɔɔn bahit na.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />&lt;&lt;N yet ya mi wa, N zɔ nam maa, da zotin seba n koot ningbiŋ la, ka ban ko ba'ah, ba kun le tɔ'ɔn iŋ se'el se'el pa'ahe. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />N nan pa'al ya so ka ya nan zot: zo mi so', n ko' i ba'ah, ka tar kpe'ense'eog n nan lob i ba'ah tenzɛ̃'ɛ̃ug buɣum poŋi la. Ẽẽ, N yet ya mi wa, zo mi ɔŋ daan! <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Ba pu kɔɔh niin-tɔɣɔrih sinu la kɔɔba ayi? Ni yelam zã'ã, Na'ayen pu tamit ba nkɔ̃ yel le. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Hali i zugu zɔbit tar kãl mi. Da zotin dabɛɛm; yam tar tebihum gaat niitɔɣɔrih kooŋ kooŋ.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />&lt;&lt;N yel ya, so woo n yi paalug na dɛ'ɛ Mam Asaal Dawɔɔga, Mam Mi nan ti dɛ'ɛ u Na'ayen maleka nam la tɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ka so mi n zaɣah Mam nirib tɔɔn, mi nan nyɛ zaɣahug Na'ayen maleka nam la tɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />So n tɔɣɔ zɛrig Asaal Dawɔɔ la nan nyɛ u suguru, amaa so n tɔɣɔ be'em gɛ̃ɛ̃h Vo'ohum Som Sii la kun nyɛ suguru.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Ba n ti tar i paa yendobibih la ni yi ba gãk, tɔɔngatib la, ni kpɛ̃'ɛ̃nam la tɔɔn, da fabin nyɛ n nan tɔɣɔ se'em fãã i mɛŋa, bee nyɛ n nan yel se'el la; <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Vo'ohun Som Sii la nan pa'al i sankaŋ nɔɔ, nyɛ n nan tɔɣɔ se'em?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bontat-gerug maɣahir la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />So' da zɛ'ɛl nirikooŋ la ni yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Pa'ala, yelim n sɔ̃ɔ̃ga yi u tɔ̃r ti laɣavaarit la, ka te mam n tɔ̃t?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Ka Yezu lebih u yii, &lt;&lt;N zɔɔ, ɔni n zaŋ Mam yi N a ya gãkir daana?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Beh mi somma! ka da sak ka bɛ'ɛt ni fĩĩ mi paa yaa; ka nirisaal pu vo la u laɣat mɔrum n zɔ'ɔ se'em?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Ka U da pana te ba maɣahir: &lt;&lt;Bontat poog n da maal ka zoot wol vɛ̃'ɛ̃lim vɛ̃'ɛ̃lim. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Ka u da tẽ'ẽhit u putẽ'ẽr poŋi yii, &lt;N nan iŋa yela, ni mam n ka zĩ'ĩ nan diŋ n zoora?'<verse eid="LUK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Ka u da pana tẽ'ẽh ko yii, &lt;N nan iŋa ŋwala: N nan gbi n boya wa bah ka mɛ bokãra, niŋa ka n nan su' n zoot la zã'ã. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Ka pana yel m mɛŋ yii, &lt;&lt;N tar zoot berigu nan di kããl woma; vo'oh ma, dim ka ŋwũ, ka nyɛɛm?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Amaa Na'ayen da yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Geruga! Wo'onkoo la wa i nan kpi. Ka laɣase'et waabi ka i ma'ahum deŋ i mɛŋa, ɔn n nan tɛɛ so ti? <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />La nan a la ŋwala tet seba n bɔɔt laɣat diŋit ba mɛŋ ka pu tẽ'ẽhit Na'ayen yele?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ya Da Fabinna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Yezu da yel U nya'andolib la yii, Mam yet ya mi wa, da fabin ni ya vom yela, se'el ka ya nan di' bee ya ningbina yela, se'el ka ya nan yɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Vom gaat diit, ka ningbiŋ la mi gaat fut. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Beh mi nangbana wa, ba pu bot bee bun na, ba mi pu tar laɣɛt doog bee boore, amaa Na'ayen diihit ba mi. Yam tar tebihum gaat bãã la wa! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ka ya so' be ka fabelug nan zaŋ saha bɛ'ɛla pa'ah u ŋwɔvom niŋaa? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Ka yam n kun nyaŋ iŋ yel ãã fĩĩ fĩĩha, la nan iŋa yela ka ya fabin yelese'a n kpelim la?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Tẽ'ẽh mi beh, bonvobibih ha maɣah wuu pilimpina n zɔ'ɔgit se'em: ba pu mɛrimit bee kiin na, amaa N yet ya mi yii, hali Solomɔn ni u na'am la zã'ã, da pu yɛ baɣalim paa ba nkɔ̃'ɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Ka Na'ayen n yɛɛn mɔɔg n be sɛ̃kin la, n vo zina ka beog ka ba nan zaŋ bah buɣum ni, la nan iŋa yela ka U kun yɛɛl yamma yam sera sakir pɔ'ɔ mi! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Da bahin ka yan nan di bee ŋwũ se'el, a daauŋ tet yaa, da kpelim mi fabela nii. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Den zugu, la a la seba n pu mi Na'ayen la n zãlemit ɛɛt teŋa zugu laɣat, ka ya Ba' la mɛŋ mi yi ya bɔɔt ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Amaa toŋun ɛ mi la tensoŋ na'am la, ka se'el woo nan pa'ah te ya. <verse eid="LUK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Da zotin dabɛɛm, biihaa, ka la a la ya Ba' sũnɔŋir yi U te ya Na'ayen so'olum la. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Kɔɔh mi ya laɣat, zaŋ te nɔndem. Maal mi potamaan somma seba n pu sa'amit la tar ya mɛh, seba n a tensoŋ laɣasoma, ka naɣayii kun lɛm ba naa ka bommɔɣɔra mi kun nyaŋ sa'am. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Ka i toolum lauk n be zĩ'ĩ' la, i sũũr mi be la niŋa.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Da'ab seba n a Gutib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Yɛ mi ya tooma laɣat ka lah ya kania nam maahum gur; <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />aain aa seba n gur ba daan n zɛ'ɛl pɔɣɔdir kibih lebit na la, yi un ti paa na ŋmɛ'ɛt koliŋ la ba nan wo'o ka kalam te u. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />La nan a somma te da'ab seba n nan nɛ' gur Daan la paagir saŋa na; yelemɛŋir ka N yet ya, wa, u nan bob u sɛgbaŋ ka bah ka ba zi'in teŋ yi ba di, ka u pana nan tana tɔ̃r ba diit la u mɛŋ. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Un yaa paa la wo'ontasoo, bee be-nkãhug, ka nyɛ ba yela, som nan paa da'ab baa la wa. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Ka baŋ mi ŋwala: yir daan la n mi'in sanse'e ka naɣayii la ken na, u kum bahin ka ka nyaŋ wo'o u zanɔr laa. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Yam baŋim somma ka ma'ahum ya mɛh, se'el n so la Asaal Dawɔɔ la ken na la, a la ndi'iri ken.<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sera sakir Da'abir bee Putẽra ayi ayi Da'abire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Pita da bɔɔh yii, &lt;&lt;N Daana, I mak maɣahira tet la tam bee niriwoo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Ka Daan la yel yii, &lt;&lt;Ɔni m pana a sera sakir ni kassi daan la, n nan zaŋ u da'aba gu'ul kpɛ'ɛn so, ka u nan tet ba dii saŋa ma'a ma'a? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Som nan paa da'abir so ka daan la nan nyɛ ka u tomit u lebig la ni na la. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Yelemɛŋir ka N yet ya wa, u nan zaŋ u se'el woo iŋ ɔ̃ɔ̃ la wa nu'uh ni ka u behit. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Amaa da'ab dee wa n yel u mɛŋ yii, &lt;N daan la wuugit ni u ken na la mi, ka pĩ'ĩl ŋmɛ'ɛt u taab la ka dit ka buɣit daam, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Da'ab dee daan la nan ti dĩ'ĩ paa la dabih se'er ni sanse'e ka u kum baŋɛ, u nan kɛ u zɔ̃ra zɔ̃ra, ka zaŋ u pa'ah seba n pu tar sera sakir la ni.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Da'ab so n daa mi u daan la n bɔɔt se'el, ka pu ma'ahum u mɛŋ yi u iŋ u daan la n bɔɔt se'em la, nan nyɛ ŋmɛ'ɛt n ka ba yele, <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Amaa so n pu mi'i ka tom toonse'er n nar ni ŋmɛ'ɛt la, nan nyɛ ŋmɛ'ɛt bɛ'ɛla. So woo n dɛ'ɛ berigu, nar yi u lebih berigu; so mi ka ba zaŋ berigu gu'ul, hali u lebihug mi, yi ku gaara zã'ã.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Pa'alug la N Nan Ke ka Bɔɣɔhug Tana la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />&lt;&lt;Mam tana yi N laŋa buɣum teŋa,' ka mi bɔɔrin yi ŋwala ma'a bu poɣun laŋim mi! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Mam tar la Na'ayen soob yi N dɛ'ɛ, ka ɛ̃rug n ŋwala N zugu ti paagit se'em ma'a ka sooba nan ba'ah! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Yam tẽ'ẽh yi Mam tana yi N tar la suma'ahum tã teŋa naa? Aai, N yet ya mi wa, la toɣun a la yelihug! <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Zina zãŋit yɛ ha, nirib banu m be yir ni, nan bɔɣɔh buyi, ba batã nan kih bayi, ka bayi la mi nan kih batã la; <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />ba nan bɔɣɔh taaba:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 12:53">ba' nan kih dawɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 12:53">ka dawɔɔ mi nan kih ba',</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 12:53">ma' nan kih pɔɣɔwɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 12:53">ka pɔɣɔwɔɔ mi nan kih ma',</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 12:53">danyaam-pɔk nan kih sampɔɣɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 12:53">ka sampɔɣɔ kih u danyaam-pɔk?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba'ahug Saŋa la Gbin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Ka Yezu da yel nirikooŋ la yii, &lt;&lt;Yan nyɛ sangbana ka a doot dampoona bɔba, ya ni yel kalam yii, &lt;Saa n yi ka ni'; ka ka mi nan serin ni.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Ka yan nyɛ ka sambeog zɛ'ɛn ya dituŋ nu'ug bɔba lobit na, ya ni yel yii, &lt;&lt;Dawalik wuntɛɛŋ n ken na, la mi nan serin a yela. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Yam ŋmɛlima demaa! Ya mi teŋa ni sangbana yela mi bɔɣɔhit, ka la iŋa yela ka ya pu mi sankãã wa yela la?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yela Maalug ni Ya Dindem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Ka lan n so ka ya pu gãkit ya mɛŋ lan nara se'em? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Yela la, nyɛ ni i dindaan n tar taaba yɛ wara gãɣahit daan sa'ani, kpeŋ mi ya mɛŋ ka zɛ'ɛlim maal tɔɣum la ya mɛŋ, ka ban yaa tar ya paa wara gãɣahit la tɔɔn, ɔŋ mi tɔ'ɔn ta'ah ya u kpɛ'ɛm la sa'ani ka u bah ka ba ta'ah ya paɣarib doog ni. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />N yet ya mi yii, ya kum maligun yi naa, gur ya n ti wɔ' se'el woo ba'ahe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ki'ihum i Yelebe'et bee i Kpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Sankaŋ ma'a la, seba n da be niŋa la da yel yezu yii, Palet da ko Galili nirib la n da be ni kããbit Na'ayen se'em ma'a la. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Ka U bɔ'ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya tẽ'ẽh yi Galili nirib bãã la wa ka u da ko wa, bam yelebe'et n da gaat Galili nirib zã'ãgaa? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Aai, N yet ya mi wa; yam pu ki'ih ya yelebe'ere, ya zã'ã waabi nan kpi a aa bam n da kpi se'em la. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Bee nir pii ni banii seba ka Siloam yitoɣoma la da lu dĩ ko la, ya tẽ'ẽh yi bam yelebe'et n da gaat nirib zã'ã Geruzalɛm poŋii? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Aai, N yet ya mi wa, yam pu ki'ih ya yelebe'ere, ya zã'ã waabi nan kpi a aa bam n da kpi se'em la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkan-se'e n pu won maɣahir la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Ka Yezu da mak maɣadee yii; &lt;&lt;Buraa n da lɔ nkaŋ u poog ni; ka pana da tana ɛɛt mu'ut ka ni, ka pu nyɛ se'el se'ela. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Ka da pana yel u pogut la yii, &lt;Behim kpela! Woma atã n ŋwala, ka n ken ɛɛt mu'ut nkaŋa ni, ka pu maan nyɛt se'ela. Ŋmaagum ka bah! La nan iŋa yela ka ka sa'amit tam la?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Ka pogut la lebih yii, &lt;N daana, bahum ka, ka la iŋ womir pa'ah, ka n tũ kaa ka, ka iŋ buɣulug iŋ ka. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Ka kan wol womse'er n ken na wa, somma n la, ka kam pu wole, i tɔ'ɔn pana ŋmaa ka bah.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu teb Bompɔk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Yezu da pana be la Na'ayen po'ohug dobil la ni pa'an Na'ayen po'ohug daar. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Nila nila ka bompɔk ka sibɛ'ɛ kpɛ̃ ka, ka la paa wom piiga ni anii yina. Ka da ŋwũr mi gɔ'ɔhit ka pu tɔ̃ dɔɔgit zɛ'ɛn sa'aa. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yezu N da nyɛ bompɔk ka la, U da bɔɔl ka mi yel ka yii, &lt;&lt;Bompɔkaa, i nyɛ i bã'ãga tebug?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Ka Un da zaŋ U nu'uh paɣɛl ka zugu la, nila nila ka ka da va dɔɔ sa'aa ka pĩ'ĩl pɛ̃ɣɛt Na'ayen.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Ka Na'ayen dobil tɔɔngat la poor da pu pɛɛ ni Yezu N teb nir Na'ayen po'ohug daar la, ka yet nirikooŋ la yii, &lt;&lt;Ti tar la dabiha ayoobi ka ti nar yi ti zaŋ tom ti tooma: kemi dabih aŋ na dɛ'ɛ ya tebug ka ka' Na'ayen po'ohug daare?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Ka Daan la da lebih u yii, &lt;&lt;Yam ŋmɛlema demaa! Ya ɔn n pu kat ya nigi bee boh yit sapakin na sigit kolik yi ba ŋwũ kɔ'ɔm? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Ka la nan iŋa yela, ka bompɔka mi, n a Ebraham pɔɣɔwɔɔ ka sibɛ'ɛ gbã'ã ka wom pii ni anii wa, kun nyɛ ka tebug Na'ayen po'ohug daare?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Un da yel ŋwala la, U nan-taah la zã'ã da nyɛ la faɣahum: ka nirikooŋ la zã'ã da nyɛɛmit ni yelenyalin se'a ka U da it la.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkansɔ̃ɔ̃g biiluh maɣahir la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />U da pana bɔ'ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Na'ayen Na'am yir la ŋmana yela? N nan zaŋ di mak mi ni lani? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Di a mi aa nkansɔ̃ɔ̃g biiluh ka so zaŋ bor gaar niŋa; u nan zɔ'ɔ lebig tii, ka niih n be saazugu ha la, tɛɣɛ ba tɛɣɛt u yila niŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />U da le yel yii, &lt;&lt;Lani ka N nan zaŋ Na'ayen yir la make? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Di a mi aa dãbin ka bompɔk zaŋ dɔ̃ dãdouk n bɔɔn dãdouk ka bu kum doot fɔ̃fɔ̃?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kolim-mik la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yezu N da ken lɔmehit teh la se'em yɛ Geruzalɛm la, U da pa'an na yela ken. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />So da bɔ'ɔh U yii, &lt;&lt;Daanaa, nirib fĩĩ ma'a n nan nyɛ fããgiree?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">U da yel ba yii, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />&lt;&lt;Terig mi ya mɛŋ dol kolim-mik la kpɛ̃; ka N yet ya mi wa, nirib berigu nan zɛɣɛt yi ba kpɛ̃, ka kun nyaŋe. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Yir daan la n ti va dɔɔ keŋ wo' u zanɔr lebih, ka ya pana paa na zɛ yeŋ ŋmɛ'ɛt dayɛŋ la, yet yii, &lt;n daanaa, wo'ogum te ti,' u nan lebih yel ya yii, mam pu mi yam n yi zĩ'ĩ naa.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Ka ya nan pana pĩ'ĩl yet yii, &lt;Tam ni nyɛ da laɣan dit ka ŋwũũt, ka laɣam pa'an ti pala la zut.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Ka u nan yel yii, Mam pu mi yam n yi zĩ'ĩ naa; fɔ̃rig mi n nindaagin ha, yam toon-fɛ̃'ɛ̃ha demaa!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Nkuma ni nyina ɔbig nan be yan ti nyɛ Ebraham ni Aizik ni Gekɔb ni nɔdɛ'ɛhirib la zã'ã Na'ayen yir la, ka ba nan lob ya bah yeŋ. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Ka nirib nan ti zɛ'ɛl dampoona ni zanɔya, dituŋ ni gɔbig, ka nan di Na'ayen yir la poŋi. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Lan a se'em la aa, seba n be tɔɔn la nan ti leb nya'aŋ, ka seba mi n be nya'aŋ la, nan ti gaat tɔɔn?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Geruzalɛm Putẽtula la yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Sankaŋ ma'a la, Farasiinam seba da tana yel Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;Yima ka bah kpela, ka na'ab Hɛrɔd bɔɔt yi u ko' I mi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Kemi ti yel pẽẽoh la yii, Mam nan kar kolekpãbɛ'ɛh ka teb nirib zina ni beog, ka dabiha atã daar la, N nan ba'ah N tooma mɛŋ. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Ka zina, beog, ni dabih se'er n taɣen la, N nan be sɔr, den zugu, la tɔ mi yi ba ko Na'ayen nɔdɛ'ɛh Geruzalɛm yeŋ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />&lt;&lt;Oi, Geruzalɛm, Geruzalɛm, yam seba n koot Na'ayen nɔdɛ'ɛhirib, ka lobit seba ka ba tom ya sa'ani na ni kuga la, sugum bule ka Mam ni bɔɔt yi N kã'ãh ya biih laɣah a aa nɔnya'aŋ n ni kã'ãh u bii um se'em la, ka ya pu sakira! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Beh maa, ba bah ya yir la te ya ka so ka nii. Ka N yet ya mi wa, ya kun le nyɛ Mam ya'aha, lan ka saŋa la paa mi ka ya nan ti yel yii, &lt;Kamaalug be ni so n tã ti Daan wo'or zugu na la.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu Teb Bã'ãt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Daar dikɔ̃ ka Yezu da yɛ Farasiinam la kpɛ'ɛm yir, yi U ti di Na'ayen po'ohug daar, ka ba da dol U nɔba fɛ̃t fɛ̃t. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />U da nyɛ U tɔɔn, ka bã'ãt n a buraa zɛ, ka u nu'uh ni nɔba foohum. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Ka Yezu da bɔ'ɔh wara mi'irib la ni Farasiinam la yii, &lt;&lt;La tar sɔr yi i teb nirib Na'ayen po'ohug daar bee la ka'a?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ka ba sin. Ka Yezu da gĩ bã'ãt la paa U tɔɔn teb u, ka yel yi u kem kul.<verse eid="LUK 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Ka pana da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya ɔn n tar bii bee lɔlig ka ka lu bulik ni, Na'ayen po'ohug daar ka u daan kun zo kalam ve'eg u dona?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Ka ba kɔŋ lebihug.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sirigum-mɛŋ ni nɔŋir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Un da nyɛ nirib la n lɔɔhit na'ahidem zĩ'ĩh la, U da te ba la maɣahir. <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />&lt;&lt;Bam bɔɔl i pɔɣɔdir kibih ni yi i tana di, da paa zi'in na'ahidem zĩ'ĩha la nii, ka daase'ere, kibih la daan bɔɔl zugudaan so' n gaat nyɛ; <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />ka so n bɔɔl ya zã'ã la, tɔ'ɔn tana yel i yii, &lt;Dɔɔma ka ɔ̃ɔ̃ zi'in niŋa,' ka i pana dɔɔ lebit tarenam zĩ'ĩ la ni faɣahum. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ka bam bɔɔl i zĩ'ĩ ka i paa, kem ti zi'in nya'aŋ bee teŋir zĩ'ĩha la ha, ka kibih daan la n ti paa na, u nan yel i yii, &lt;&lt;N zɔɔ, dɔɔgum do kpela na; niŋa ka i pana nan dɔɔ ni na'ahi doot ka niriwoo won i. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Seba woo n zɛ̃kit ba mɛh, nan nyɛ sirigir, ka seba woo mi n sirigit ba mɛh, nan nyɛ zɛ̃kir?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Ka Yezu yel kibih daan la yii, Nyɛ n ti bɔɔn nirib yi ba di, da bɔɔn zɔnam bee i sɔ̃se'et bee kpɛse'eh n a bondaanama, seba mi n nan ti tɔ'ɔn bɔɔl nyɛ mi ka i keŋ ti di lerig i samire. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ka nyɛ n tar kibih, bɔɔlim la tarenam, kaarena, wɔbih, ni fɔɔh. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Ka i nan nyɛ kamaalug, den zugo, bam n kun tɔ'ɔn leb wɔ i la, i nan ti nyɛ i wɔɔt la nivosoma vo'ogum dɔɔ daar la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dikãt kibih maɣahir la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Kibih la saam la nkɔ̃, n da wom ŋwala la, u da yel yii, &lt;&lt;Zusondaan n a so n nan ti di boom Na'ayen Na'am yir la!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Ka Yezu yel u yii, &lt;&lt;So' n da iŋ u dikãt kibih laɣahug, ka bɔɔl nirib berug berug. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Ka saŋa la n da paa la, u da tom u da'abir yi u ti yel seba ka u bɔɔl la yii, &lt;Kemi nan-nan na; ka ti maahum se'el woo ba'ah.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ka ba zã'ã a aa ba yel la taaba la, da yet u se'el n so ka ba kun nyaŋ tanaa. Yiiga daan la da yel yii, &lt;N da la tam, ka la nar yi n keŋ nyɛ bu, dim suguru te m.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Nkɔ̃ mi da yel yii, N da la lɔlekɔɔrih pii, ka yi m maɣah ba beh nyaa ba nan sak kɔɔ; dim suguru te m.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Ka nkɔ̃ mi yel yii, &lt;N nan di la pɔɣɔsaaŋ, den zugu n kun nyaŋ tanaa.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Ka da'abir la da pana leb yel u daan la se'el woo n iŋ la. Ka u daan la sũũr da dɔɔ, ka u yel da'abir la yii, &lt;Yim tempoŋi ha ti beh sɔya zut ni zĩ'ĩ woo bɔɔl nɔndem, kaarena, fɔɔh, ni wɔbih.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Ka da'abir la da yel yii, &lt;Naa, nyɛ n yel se'el la poɣun iŋ mi, ka fɔl kpelim be.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Ka daan la leb yel da'abir la yii, yim sɔya ni ha, ti pẽrig nirib yi ba tana, bah ka n yira pɛ'ɛl. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Ka n yet i mi wa, seba ka m bɔɔl la, ba so kun lem diigaa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Nya'andolib Mɛruŋ yela la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Nan-nan na, nirikooŋ n laɣan ken ni Yezu; ka U ŋmɛrig yel ba yii, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />&lt;&lt;So woo n tã Mam sa'ani na ka pu kih u ba' bee u maa, pɔɣɔ bee biiga, sɔ̃ɔ̃t bee tɔ̃ɔ̃h, hali, ni u mɛŋ vom, kun tɔ'ɔn a Mam nya'andola. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />So woo n pu zi u mpuur dɔɔg la dol Mam, kun tɔ'ɔn a Mam nya'andola.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Ya ɔni, n tar putẽ'ẽr yi u mɛ yitoɣoma, ka kun zi'in yiiga beh ligiri alɛ n nan sɛke, ka baŋ nyaa un pĩ'ĩl u nan nyaŋ ba'ah di be? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />La n ka yelaa, ka u pĩ'ĩl mɛɛ ka pu nyaŋ ba'ahe, so woo n nyɛ nan la'ar u, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />ka yet yii, &lt;Ɔ̃ɔ̃ la wa pĩ'ĩl la mɛɛ ka pu nyaŋ ba'ahe.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Bee na' ɔni, n nan yi u zab ni naso', ka kun zi'in yiiga maɣɛh u mɛŋ beh nyaa u nan nyaŋ ni u zabezabirib tuhu piiga, ka u taraan na tar zabezabirib tuhu pihiyi waa? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Un kun nyaŋe, la a la, zabezab bãã la n nan be zãã ha la, u nan tom nirib ka ba to'oh sa, ti belim ba ka ba zi'in pĩ'ĩl suma'ahum sɔ̃hug. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Ŋwala zugu la, ya so kun nyaŋ a Mam nya'andol la, u daan n pu zaŋ u laɣat zã'ã tehe.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaarum yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Yaarum a somma; ka bu mahum n pu le ti bee, bu mahum la nan iŋa yela leb na? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Bu pu le a somma tet ntan bee buɣulugo; la a la ba zaŋ bu lob bah.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:35">Bah mi ka so' n tar toba nan wom la womih!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Pese'eog n borig la maɣahir la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Nan-nan na, lempodɛ'ɛhirib ni yelebe'et dem la da ken lɛmit Yezu mi na yi ba wom U tɔɣum. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Ka Farasiinam ni gban-mi'irib la da buɣun yet yii, &lt;&lt;Ɔ̃ɔ̃ wa bɔɔt yelebe'et dem mi ka dit ni ba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Ka U da mak maɣah dee la wa te ba: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />&lt;&lt;Ya ɔni, n nan tar pihi kɔbig ka kukɔ̃ borig, ka u kun bah pihiwai ni ba wai la sɛ̃ɣir la ni, ka keŋ ti ɛ pese'eog n borig la, hali gur un ti nyɛ ku? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Ka un ti nyɛ ku, u kun zaŋ ku buk u bɔɣɔrin ka nyɛɛmit ni popeelum? <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Ka un ti paa yirin na, u kun bɔɔl u zɔnam ni u kpɛ'ɛh, yet ba yii, nyɛɛm mi nim, ka n nyɛ m pese'eog n daa borig la.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Yela nɔɔ, ka N yet ya wa, popeelum ni nyɛɛma nan zɔ'ɔ tensoŋ yir ha, yelebe'et daan nkɔ̃ n ki'ih u yelebe'et, gaat toonsoma dem pihiwai ni ba wai seba n pu ɛɛt yelebe'et ki'ihugo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Laɣakɔ̃bir la n borig la maɣahir la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />&lt;&lt;Bee bompɔɣɔkani n nan tar laɣakɔ̃ba pii, ka bukɔ̃ n borig, u kun laŋ buɣum, ka piih doog la, ɛ nima nima gur un nyɛ bu? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Ka un nyɛ bu, u nan bɔɔl u zɔnam ni u kpɛ'ɛh, yet yii,' Nyɛɛm mi ni m, ka n nyɛ laɣase'eb m borig la.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Ŋwala zugu, ka N yet ya yii,' popeelum ni nyɛɛma be ni Na'ayen Malekanam la, yelebe'et daan nkɔ̃ n ki'ih u yelebe'et.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawɔsa'alig la Maɣahir la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Ka Yezu da yel yii, &lt;&lt;Buraa n da be tar dawɔɔ siyi. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Ka pit la da yel u ba' la yii, &lt;M ba'a, te m mam se'el n a n vaagir tɔ̃t i laɣara ni nan-nan na.&gt; Ka u ba' la serin da tɔ̃r u laɣat la te ba.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Dabiha n da kããl bɛ'ɛla wa la, pit la da dɔɔ kã'ãh se'el woo n a u den, lɔ kateŋ zãã ha, niŋa ka u da puɣulum u laɣara ni yaalug. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Ka un da sɔ̃tim ti ba'ah la, kon-nyaliŋ da lu teŋ la ni, ka u da pu le tar se'el la. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />U da pana keŋ teŋ la nir nkɔ̃ sa'ani yi u tomit tet u, ka u daan da bah ka u it diit tet u kurikurinam. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />U da ni pana bɔɔt yi u laɣun di kurikurinam diit la; ka so da pu te u wa. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Ka un da tẽ'ẽh ki'i ka u putẽ'ẽr tɛɛ la, u da bɔ'ɔh u mɛŋ yii, &lt;Mam ba' ntomirib balɛ n pu dit dii ka ket sakote, ka behum man n ŋwala vibit ni kom! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />N nan dɔɔ leb m ba' sa'ani, ti yel u yii, &lt;&lt;M ba'a, Mam tom be'em gɛ̃'ɛ̃h Na'ayen ni nyɛ; <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Mam pu le nar yi ba bɔɔn nim yi i dawɔɔga; tarim a aa i ntomiriba nkɔ̃?&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Ka u da pana va dɔɔ leb u ba' sa'ani. Ka un da be zãã ken na la, u ba' la da zɛ̃k zugu nyɛ u ka nimbɔ̃'ɔ̃g sããgu; ka u zo to'oh u ti kɔk ka bob u. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Ka u dawɔɔ la yel u yii, M ba'a, Mam iŋ taal gɛ̃'ɛ̃h Na'ayen ni nyɛ; Mam pu le nar yi ba bɔɔn nim yi nyɛ dawɔɔga.<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ka u ba' la da yel u da'aba la yii, &lt;Kalam, ka ya zaŋ fuug n bɔɔn fuug na yɛɛl u; zaŋ nutoo mi pir u nubil, ni taɣara pir u nɔba. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Ka gbã'ã naɣapaalig n kãrig somma na ko, ka ti di ka nyɛɛm; <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />ka n dawɔɔga daa kpi mi ka leb vo'o, u daa borig mi, ka n le nyɛ u!&gt; Ka ba da pĩ'ĩl dit ka nyɛɛmit.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Sankãã la wa, u dawɔkpɛɛm la da be la pooŋin ha; ka un da yɛ kun na ti pɔr yir la, u da wom baaŋ ni wa'a. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />U da bɔɔl da'aba la nkɔ̃ ti bɔ'ɔh se'el n it. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Ka u lebih yii, &lt;I sɔ̃'ɔ̃g la kul mi na, ka i ba' ko naɣapaalig n kãrig, un nyaŋ leb u sa'ani na ni nima'ahum la.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Ka u dawɔkpɛɛm la sũũr da dɔɔ ka u zaɣah yi u kun kpɛ̃'ɛ̃. Ka u ba' da yina belemit u. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Ka u da lebih u ba' la yii, &lt;Womih maa! Woma wa woo n gaara, mam tomit te i mi a aa da'abir la, m mi pu tabel zaɣah i nɔɔre; ka i pu tabel te mam bobil yi n di ka dɛ'ɛm ni n zɔnama. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ka i dawɔkãã la wa n leb na wa, so' n sãɣam i laɣat yaal ni bompɔɣɔyaalih ha, ka i ko naɣarib-kãt te u!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Ka u ba' la yel u yii, &lt;&lt; &lt;N dawɔɔga, nyɛ be ni mam mi saŋa woo, ka se'el woo n a m bon, a la nyɛ mi bon. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Ka ti n dit ka nyɛɛmit la, i sɔ̃ɔ̃ga daa kpi mi ka leb vo'o; u daa borig mi ka ti leb nyɛ u.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ŋmɛlema zugudaan la maɣahir la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Ka Yezu da yel U nya'andolib la yii, &lt;&lt;Bura-bondaan n da be ka tar u tooma zugudaan, ka ba yet u yii, buraaga sãɣamit laɣat la mi. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Ka u da bɔɔl u yel yii, &lt;Nan bon n la ka n womit i zuga? Pa'alim se'el woo ka i nyɛ tooma behiga ni, se'el n so la i kun le nyaŋ a mam tooma wa zugudaana.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Ka zugudaan la yel u mɛŋ yii, &lt;Lan ka n nan iŋe, nan-nan na, ka n daana dɛ'ɛgit n tooma wa ka bahit m ma? N ka paŋ nan laɣan tũ'u, valim mi tarim yi n soh. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />N tẽ'ẽh baŋ man n nan iŋ se'em, ka ban ti sa'agum n zugudaan tooma wa ni, nirib nan sak yi n kpɛ̃ ba yɛ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Ŋwala, ka u da bɔɔl seba woo n tar u daan la sama la nkɔ̃ nkɔ̃, u da bɔ'ɔh yiiga daan la yii, &lt;Nyɛ tar n daana samir la alɛ?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Ka u lebih yii, &lt;Pihi pii.&gt; Ka u yel u yii, &lt;Dɛ'ɛgum i samir gbauŋ n ŋwala, zi'inim kalam ka bah ka la a pihi anu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Ka u leb bɔ'ɔh so n taɣel la mi, &lt;Nyɛ mi samir a la alɛ?&gt; Ka u lebih yii, &lt;Ki bora pii.&gt; Ka u yel ɔŋ mi yii, &lt;Dɛ'ɛgum i samir gbauŋ n ŋwala ka bah ka la a bora anii.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Ka u daan la da pẽɣɛ ŋmɛlema zugudaan na ni un nyaŋ baŋ u putẽ'ẽr ka tom se'em la; lan a se'em la aa, nan-nan na biih baŋit ba zomaan kãã nirib putẽ'ẽra ba tooma poŋi gaat ntɔɔ biih. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Ka N yet ya mi wa, zãh mi zɔnam ni ŋmɛlema laɣat ka ti n ti ba'ah, ba nan dɛ'ɛ ya ba vom kun ba'ah yɛ la poŋi.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />So woo n tomit ni yelemɛŋir lauk fĩĩ, nan tɔ'ɔn tom ni yelemɛŋir laɣat berug berug; ka so woo mi n tomit ni ŋmɛlema fĩĩ, tomirin ni ŋmɛlema zɔ'ɔ zɔ'ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Ka nyɛ n pu tar yelemɛŋir ni ŋmɛlema laɣat la, ɔni n nan zaŋ sãlema ni ŋwɔɣum laɣat la te i ya? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Ka nyɛ n pu tar yelemɛŋir ni so bonne, ɔni n nan te i se'el n a i mɛŋ bonne?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Da'abir ka' nan nyaŋ tomit tet kpɛ'ɛnam bayii, u sii nan yi nkɔ̃ ka nɔŋ nkɔ̃, bee na'ahit nkɔ̃ ka kih nkɔ̃. I kun nyaŋ tomit tet Na'ayen ni ligirii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Na'ayen Na'am yir la ni Wara la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Farasiinam la, seba n nɔŋ ligiri la, n da wom ŋwala woo la, ba da ɛ̃ɛ̃rigit Yezu mi. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Ka U da yel ba yii, &lt;Yam a la seba n tet ya mɛŋ boot nirib tɔɔn; ka Na'ayen mi ya sũya n a se'em, ka se'el ka nirisaalib beh ka la tar zugu la, a la barih Na'ayen tɔɔn.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />&lt;&lt;Wara la ni nɔdɛ'ɛhirib la da tomiri ka Geon nyaam paa na; sankaŋ la ti paa zina, ba tɔɔn Na'ayen na'am yir yelesoma la mi, ka nir woo zɛɣit yi u kpɛ̃ ni paŋ. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Ka la a la naana tet tensoŋ na'am yir la ni tengbauŋa yi ba mɛlim, gaat wara la yel dikɔ̃ n nan yih.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />&lt;&lt;So n lebih u pɔɣɔ ka tɛɛ di kakɔ̃ toma kamboh, ka so n di pɔɣɔse'e mi n bah ka ser ka yina, mi toma kamboh.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bondaan la ni Lazarɔs Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Bura-bondaan n da be, ka daar woo ka yɛɛra kparikota ka la mah, ka u dit disoŋ sɔ̃r sɔ̃r. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Ka u zanɔrin, nɔndaan, ka u wo'or bɔɔn Lazarɔs da dɔ ni, ka nɔra dɛ'ɛ u ningbina zã'ã, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Lazarɔs da maahum mi gur yi u pɛ'ɛl u poor ni dise'et ka na'ab la dit ka la yaamit teŋ la. U da dɔ la niŋa, hali ka baah da tana lɛɛn u nɔra la.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Daar da paa mi ka nɔndaan la kpi ka Na'ayen Malekanam zi u keŋ yi u ti be ni Ebraham. Ka bondaan la mi da kpi, ka ba pĩ u. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Ba n pĩ u la, ka u keŋ be tenzɛ̃'ɛ̃ug ni, zĩse'e ka la womit u la, u da gɔrig saazugu nyɛ Ebraham zãã ha ka Lazarɔs be u loɣirin. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Ka u bɔɔl yii, &lt;Mba Ebraham, dim suguru te m, ka tom Lazarɔs ka u zaŋ u nɔbil tom kɔ'ɔmi, tana tɔk n zɛlemira na ka la iŋ di ma'ahiri; ka m be la buɣum poŋi ka la pu maha.<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Ka Ebraham yel u yii, &lt;Biiga, tẽr yi ya n daa vo la, nyɛ daa dit la nyaɣahum, ka Lazarɔs daa dit vẽẽha ma'a, ka nan-nan na, u be la ma' ma' niŋa kpela, ka nyɛ mi be vẽẽha ni. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Yit yel ãã la wa ni, yam ni tam tinsok, nangɔn-wɔŋir n beŋ, ka so m bɔɔt yi u zɛ'ɛl kpela yak niŋa na, kun tɔ'ɔn iŋe, ka so mi n zɛ'ɛl nila yi u yak kpela na, kun nyaŋe.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Ka bondaan la yel yii, &lt;Ŋwala, M ba'a, N sohit i mi yi i tom Lazarɔs m ba' yir ha, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />ka n tar sɔ̃'ɔ̃t tinu, u ŋmaagum ba tobir dããl, ka bam mi da ti tã buɣum boo ni na dit vẽẽhaa.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Ka Ebraham lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Ba tar Moozis ni Nɔdɛ'ɛhirib la; ba womihum ban tɔɣum.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Ka u yel yii, &lt;Aai, Mba Ebraham; Ya n tom so ka u zɛ'ɛl kpi'in teŋa keŋ, ba nan ki'ih ba yelebe'et.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Ka u yel u yii, &lt;bam pu womih Moozis ni Nɔdɛ'ɛhirib laa, ba kun womih so'o, hali ni un poɣun yi kpi'in teŋa keŋe.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu yelehum buse'eb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yezu da yel U nya'andolib la yii, &lt;&lt;Sanse'eh be mi, ka yeletoot nan paa nirib, amaa so daana n ke ka yeletoora paa ba la nan nyɛ sabaab! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />La naan aain somma yi, ba zaŋ kugekãt wul i nangɔ̃ɔ̃r ni, ka zaŋ i lob mɔɣir kɔ'ɔmi, nyan nyɛ n bah ka yeletoot paa bibibiha nkɔ̃ ka ka tom be'em. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Beh mi ya mɛŋ somma!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">I sɔ̃ɔ̃g n tom be'em, zɛrig mu, ka un ki'ih u be'em la, dim suguru te u. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Ka un tom be'em gɛ̃'ɛ̃h i sugum buyopoi dabihir poŋi, ka ŋmɛrig yel i sugum buyopoi yii, &lt;N tuu ya,&gt; dim suguru te u?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Yezu Nya'andolib la da yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Pa'ahum ti sera sakir paŋ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />U lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;I sera sakir n aain aa nkansɔ̃ɔ̃g biiluh, i tɔ'ɔn yelin to'oga yii, &lt;Vɔ̃ɔ̃gum i mɛŋ keŋ se mɔɣira ni ha,&gt; ka ka nan iŋ yela nɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />&lt;&lt;Ya ɔni n nan yel u da'abir n zɛ'ɛl poogin bee dunkeoŋi paagit na yii, &lt;kem kpela na naa ni m ka ti di?' <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />I toɣun kun yel u yii, &lt;zaŋ i doɣob laɣat la yɛ, maal dii te m ka m di ka ŋwũ; ka iŋa nya'aŋ ka nyɛ mi di?' <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />U nan po'oh u da'abir la ni toomir la ka i te u laa? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />La a la yela nɔɔ ni yam mi, yan tom toonse'er ka ba te ya yi ya tom la, yel mi yii, &lt;Tam a la da'aba; ti tomma ti pɛ̃rigir toomir!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Teb Ninsãɣuŋ dem Pii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yezu n da be sɔr zugu yɛ Geruzalɛm la, U da buuga Samaariya ni Galili tinsok gaat. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Un da kpɛ̃'ɛ̃t tembil kakɔ̃ ni la, ninsãɣuŋ dem pii da paa U sa'ani. Zɛ nkpeŋ ha, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />ka yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Yezu, Kpɛ'ɛmaa, dim suguru te ti!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Ka Un da nyɛ ba la, U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Kemi ti zaŋ ya mɛh pa'al malemadem la?&gt;&gt; Ka ban da yɛ la, ba da nyɛ yi ba bã'ãh la bah ba.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Ka ba nkɔ̃, n da nyɛ yi u bã'ã la bah ya la, u da ŋmɛrig leb, ti pɛ̃ɣɛt Na'ayen ni nkɔr kpɛ'ɛmir. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Ka kũ'ũl Yezu tɔɔn po'oh U. U mi da a la Samaariya teŋ nir.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Ka Yezu bɔ'ɔh yii, &lt;&lt;Ba ka'an la ninsãɣuŋ dem pii n nyɛ tebug laa? Ka bawai la lee? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Bam ni nkɔ̃ mi pu nyɛ ka la nar yi u leb na te Na'ayen faraa, ka saana ma'a?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />U pana da yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Dɔɔgum keŋ nyɛ n yɛ'ɛn zĩ'ĩ la; ka i sera sakir la n teb i?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tensoŋ Na'am Yir kenna la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Farasiinam la da bɔ'ɔh Yezu yii, Na'ayen So'olum la kenna sankan ma'a na, ka U lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;Na'ayen So'olum la pu kenna ni yela bee se'el ka ya nyɛtaa; <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />bee ba yel yii, &lt;Behima, la n ŋwala!&gt; bee &lt;La n ŋwaha!&gt; Ka yelemɛŋir la aa, Na'ayen so'olum la laɣum be ni ya mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Ka U da yel nya'andolib la yii, &lt;&lt;Dabiha kenna, ka ya nan ti bɔɔt yi ya nyɛ Asaal Dawɔɔga daar dikɔ̃, ka ya kun le maan nyɛ dii. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Ba nan yel i yii, &lt;Behim kpeha!&gt; bee &lt;Behim kpela!&gt; Da keŋe, da dolih so nya'aŋa. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Asaal Dawɔɔ dabihir la a mi aa saa n ni nyak nɛɛ sangbana zɛ'ɛl yɛuŋ kukɔ̃ ti paa kukɔ̃ ha la, yela nɔɔ ka U nan ti a di daar la. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ka yiiga U nan nyɛ namehug hali ti paa zomaaŋ kãã nirib n nan zaɣah U.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />A aa la n da a se'em Nowa saŋa la, yela nɔɔ ka la nan a Asaal Dawɔɔ dabiha la ni. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Ba da diti ka ŋwũũt, dit pɔɣɔb ka ɛn serib, ka Nowa da pana baŋ kpɛ̃ ããruŋ la ni, ka kɔkãt la da tana sãɣum ba zã'ã. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />&lt;&lt;Lɔt dabiha la mi da a la yela nɔɔ, ba da diti ka ŋwũũt, da'at ka kɔɔhit, kɔɔt ka mɛɛt. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ka daase'er ka Lɔt da bah Sodom la, Na'ayen da bah ka buɣum ni kuga niit saazugu na sãɣum teŋ la zã'ã.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />La nan ti a la yela nɔɔ dase'er ka Asaal Dawɔɔga nan nɛɛ U mɛŋ. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Daan den la, so n daan yaɣa gɔhug, un da sigi na yi u zaŋ u laɣare; yela nɔɔ ka so n daan be yeŋ ha un da leb kul naa. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Tẽrin Lɔt pɔɣɔ la yel. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Seba n mɔɔt yi ba gu ba vom nan kɔŋ bu, ka seba n kɔŋ ba vom nan nyɛ bu. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />N yet ya mi wa, wo'on-koŋ la, nirib bayi nan laɣun dɔ; ba nan zaŋ nkɔ̃ keŋ ka bah nkɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Bompɔɣɔh siyi nan laɣun nɛmit zom; ba nan zaŋ kakɔ̃ keŋ ka bah kakɔ̃?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Ka ba bɔ'ɔh U yii, &lt;&lt;Yaha, Daanaa?&gt;&gt; Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Zĩ'ĩ ka dunkpiirig dɔ la, niga ka zũũt nan laɣahit?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Pɔkɔ̃ɔ̃r la ni ŋmɛlema wara gãɣahit maɣahir la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Ka Yezu mak maɣahir pa'al U nya'andolib la n nar se'em yi ba po'ohit saŋa woo ka da ve'era. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />U da yel yii, &lt;&lt;Teŋ kakɔ̃ ni, ka wara gãɣahit da be, ka pu zot Na'ayen bee zaŋ nir da kɔbiga. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Teŋ la ni pɔkɔ̃ɔ̃r mi n da be nɔɔt buraaga kpalinkpaɣara yet yii, &lt;Soŋum ni n yel la n dindaana sa'ani.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Wara gãɣahit daan la da nan zaɣah mi; ka pana da ti tẽ'ẽh buyi ka yel yii, &lt;M mi mam pu zot Na'ayen bee da nir kɔbiga, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />ka pɔkɔ̃ɔ̃ra n ba nɔɔt n kpalinkpaɣara se'em ma, n nan soŋ gãk u yel la te u, ka u da le nɔɔrum yelaa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Ka Daan la da yel yii, &lt;&lt;Womih mi ŋmɛlema wara gãɣahit la n yel se'em. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Ŋwala wa, Na'ayen kun te U mɛŋ nirib seba n kaahit ni U wuntɛɛŋ ni wo'oŋ la ntɔɔ gãkire? U nan go'om ka soŋ baa? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />N yet ya mi wa, U nan soŋ te ba ntɔɔ gãkir kalam ma. Ka dee wa ni, Asaal Dawɔɔ la n tana, U nan nyɛ sera sakir teŋaa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Farasii nir ni Lempodɛ'ɛhit Maɣahir la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />U da le mak maɣahir te seba n nam ba mɛŋ yi bam a la kassidem, ka nyɛ seba ka bam a yelebe'et dem la: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />&lt;&lt;Buraah siyi n da do po'ohug doog la ni yi ba po'oh, nkɔ̃ da a la Farasii nir, ka nkɔ̃ la a lempodɛ'ɛhit. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Farasii nir la da zɛ mi, ka po'ohit yii, &lt;Na'ayene, Mam po'oh I zɔ'ɔ zɔ'ɔ yi, mam pu laɣun a aa niribaa la wa: naɣayiih, nivokãha, barih dem, bee poɣun a aa lempodɛ'ɛhaa. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Mam loot nɔɔr buyi bakɔ'ɔr woo; N tet pii kɔbig poŋi man tomit nyɛt se'el woo la ni.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Ka lempodɛ'ɛha n da zɛ zãã ha la, pu yaŋ poɣun gɔrig saazugu wole, ka u da ŋmɛ'ɛra u ŋwɔ'ɔg ka yet yii, &lt;Na'ayene, dim suguru te m, man n a yelebe'et daan la!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />N yet ya mi wa, burakãã la wa da kul mi ni sũma'ahum gaat ɔ̃ɔ̃ la; seba woo n zɛ̃kit ba mɛh nan nyɛ sirigir, ka seba woo n sirig ba mɛh nan nyɛ zɛ̃kir?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Kamaal Bibibih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Nirib da laɣun tar bibibih ken U sa'ani na yi U zaŋ nu'ug paɣɛl ba zut ka kamaal ba; ka nya'andolib la n da nyɛ yela la, ba da sa'ahit ba mi yi ba da it yelaa. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ka Yezu da bɔɔn ba yi ba leb na ka yet yii, &lt;&lt;Bah mi ka biih la tã N sa'ani na, ka da gu'urin baa; ka la a la bãã la wa n so Na'ayen So'olum la. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Yelemɛŋir ka N yet ya wa, so woo n pu dɛ'ɛ Na'ayen So'olum la a aa bibil laa, ɔŋ daan kun malegun kpɛ̃ di ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tenso'ot-bontat la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Tenso'ot so da bɔ'ɔh Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;Pa'an pa'al-Soŋaa, N nan iŋa yela ka nyɛ vom n kum ba'ah la?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Ka U bɔ'ɔh u yii, &lt;&lt;La iŋa yela ka i bɔɔn Nim yi soŋa? So ka somm, la n ka Na'ayen ma'a. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />I mi nɔdiŋa la: &lt;I da tom barih toomaa; I da ko niraa; I da zuu; I da maɣara; na'ahum i ba' ni i ma.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Ka u lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Mam tomit ãã woo mi m biilimi na?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Ka Yezu N da wom ŋwala la, U da yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Bon lakɔ̃ kpelim pɔ'ɔ i ni. Kɔɔhum nyɛ n tar se'el la zã'ã waabi, ka zaŋ ligiri la tɔ̃r nɔndem, ka i nan nyɛ laɣat Tensoŋi la; ka pana tana dol Mam?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Un da wom ŋwala la, u sũũr da sa'am mi; un da a bondaan la zugu. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yezu da beh u ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;La a kpɛ'ɛmir paa yi bondem nyaŋ kpɛ̃ Na'ayen So'olum la ni! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Sera, la nan a naana tet wɔɣun yi u kpɛ̃ fupĩĩm niuh ni gaat bondaan n nan kpɛ̃ Na'ayen So'olum la ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Seba n da wom dee la wa la, da bɔ'ɔh yii, &lt;&lt;Ka ɔni n nan pana nyɛ fããgire?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Ka U lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Se'el n tɔ tet saalib la, pu tɔ tet Na'ayene?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Ka Pita yel yii, &lt;&lt;Beh maa, ti bah ti yɛ mi ka dol I?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;N yet ya la yelemɛŋira, so pu be bah yir bee pɔɣɔ bee sɔ̃ɔ̃t bee ba' ni ma' bee biih, Na'ayen So'olum la zugu, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />ka kun nyɛ se'el n gaat yela zomaan - kãã la wa, bee zomaan se'e n kenna wa vom kum ba'ah poŋi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu le yel Un nan kpi ka vo'o dɔɔ la pa'ah suɣum butã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />U da pana tar U nya'andolib pii ni bayi la leb nkpeŋ ti yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Beh mi nii, ti yɛ doora Geruzalɛm, ka se'el woo ka nɔdɛ'ɛhirib la da golih yit Asaal Dawɔɔ la ni la, nan dolih yela nɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Ba nan zaŋ U te seba n pu sak sera te Na'ayen la; ka ba nan kɛɛr, to'ot ka tobehit nantɔ̃ɔ̃t ma'ar U. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Ban ŋmɛ U ba'ah, ba nan ko' U, ka dabiha atã ni, U nan vo'o dɔɔ ya'ah?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Ka ba da pu bɔk se'el se'el yit tɔɣum ma nii; Yelemɛŋir, Un da yet se'el la, da pu nɛɛ te baa, ka ba da pu bɔk Un yel se'el la.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu da Teb Soh-soh Fɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Un da pɔ̃r Gɛriko la, burafɔɔ n da zĩ sɔr la nkpeŋ sohit. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Ka un da wom nirikooŋ n yɛ gat la, u da bɔ'ɔh se'el n it. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Ba da yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Yezu Nazarɛf teŋ nir la n yɛ gat?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />U da pana tãh yii, &lt;&lt;Yezu, Devit Dawɔɔgaa, dim suguru te m!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Seba n da be tɔɔn la, da tãh u yi u gɔ'ɔ; ka u da maalin ãrig gaat yela, &lt;&lt;Devit Dawɔɔgaa, dim suguru te m!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yezu da tɛk zɛ'ɛl ki'i ka yel yi ba tar buraa la tã U sa'ani na; ka un da vurig lɛm na la, U da bɔ'ɔh u yii, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />&lt;&lt;Lani ka i bɔɔt yi N iŋ te i ya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Ka u yel yii, &lt;&lt;Daana, n bɔɔt yi n nyɛt i&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yezu da yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Dɛ'ɛgum i nini la; i sera sakir la n fãã i bah?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Nila nila ka u nini la leb nyɛt ka u dol U, pɛ̃ɣɛt Na'ayen; ka nirib la zã'ã, n da nyɛ se'el n iŋ la, da pɛ̃ɣɛt Na'ayen.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu ni Zakeyɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yezu da kpɛ̃ Gɛriko teŋ ni dol gat. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Ka buraa da be ni bɔɔn Zakeyɔs; da a lempodɛ'ɛh-kpɛ'ɛm, ka mi a bondaan. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />U da bɔɔt yi u nyɛ la Yezu, baŋ Un a so, ka u da a la bongelig ka kun nyaŋ zɛ'ɛl nirikooŋ la ni nyɛ U wa. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Yela ka u da zo gaat tɔɔn ti do tiwɔɣir zugu yi u nyɛ Yezu, N nan dol niŋa bɔba gaat la.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yezu N da paa zĩ'ĩ la ni la, U da gɔrig beh u ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;Zakeyɔs, kãbelim sigi na; ka Mam yi N kpelim la nyɛ yir zina wa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Yela ka u da kãbel sigi dɛ'ɛ Yezu ni popeelum.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Seba woo n da nyɛ se'el n iŋ la, da pĩ'ĩl buɣunni yet yii, &lt;&lt;U keŋ yi U a la yelebe'et daan yir saan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Zakeyɔs da zɛ'ɛna niŋa yel Daan la yii, &lt;&lt;Behima, Daana, n nan zaŋ n laɣat la bɔk porigir te nɔndem; ka man le fã la so se'el, n nan lebih la suɣum bunaahi te u daan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Ka Yezu yel u yii, &lt;&lt;zina wa fããgir tã yira poŋi na, lan zugo ɔŋ mi laɣun a la Ebraham dawɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Asaal Dawɔɔga da tana yi U beh mi fãã seba m borig la bah?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pompii Maɣahir la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Ban da womihit ŋwala wa la, ka Yezu da te ba maɣahir, ka la a la Un da pɔ̃r Geruzalɛm la zugu, ka mi a la ban da tẽ'ẽhit yi Na'ayen so'olum la nar yi bu nɛɛ kalam la zugu. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Ka pana yel yii, &lt;&lt;Bondaan n da keŋ katen-zããr yi u ti bob na'am leb na. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />U da bɔɔl u ntomirib pii laɣah na, te ba poŋ poŋ, ka yel ba yii, &lt;Zaŋ mi ni ya tar kɔɔhit ka gur man nan ti leb na.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Buraaga mi teŋ nirib sii da yi u mi, ka un da gaat ba'ah la, ba da tom nirib teŋ la ni, yet yii, &lt;Ti pu bɔɔt yi bura kãã la wa a ti na'aba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Un da bob na'am la, ka leb na la, u da laɣah da'ab-seba ka u da te ba ligiri la, yi u baŋ ban zaŋ u ligiri la kɔɔh nyɛ ŋwɔɔt se'em.<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Ka yiiga daan la tana yel yii, &lt;N daana, n zaŋ i poŋ kukɔ̃ la tom nyɛ la pom pii pa'ah.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Ka u yel da'abir la yii, &lt;I mɔ ya, i a la da'ab-soŋ! Nyɛ n a yelemɛŋir daan ni laɣabil la, a na'ab behit tem-pii.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Ka yi'i daan la tana yel yii, &lt;N daana, n zaŋ i poŋ la tom nyɛ la poŋa anu pa'ah.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Ka bondaan la yel u yii, &lt;Nyɛ mi tar teh sinu behim.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Ka nkɔ̃ la mi tana, yel yii, &lt;N daana, i poŋ la n ŋwala. Mam daa zaŋ ku pɔ̃b mi ni tan diŋ, <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />se'el n so la, dabɛɛm n daa tar mam, nyɛ n a burawuribir; zãhit se'el ka i pu zaŋ diŋe, ka kɛ'ɛt zĩ'ĩ ka i pu bor la.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Ka bondaan la yel u yii, &lt;N nan zaŋ i mɛŋ nɔɔr tɔɣum ma gãk i, da'ab potɔɔliga! I daa poɣun mi yi mam a la burawuribir, zãhit se'el ka m pu diŋe, ka kɛ'ɛt zĩ se'eh ka m pu bor? <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Ka yela ka i daa pu tar n laɣauh la ti diŋ ligiri diŋir zĩ'ĩga? Ka man lebin na wa, n naan dɛ'ɛgin bu ni dɔɣɔliŋ pa'ah.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Ka pana yel seba n zɛ' la yii, &lt;dɛ'ɛ mi poŋ la u sa'ani te so n tar pom pii la.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Ka nirib la lebih yel yii, &lt;Daana, ɔŋ poɣun deŋ tara pompii!<verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />N yet ya mi yi, seba woo n tar la, nan nyɛ berigu pa'ah; ka seba m poɣum pu tar la, se'el fĩĩ ka ba tar la, ba nan dɛ'ɛ la ba sa'ani. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Ka baan a man dindema, pu bɔɔt yi man a na'ab behit ba wa, tarin ba na, ni ya kɔrih ba n tɔɔn.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu N Kpɛ̃ Geruzalɛm aa Na'am la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yezu n da pa'al nirib ba'ah la, U da gaara tɔɔn doot kpɛ̃'ɛ̃t Geruzalɛm. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Ka Un da paagit Betefag ni Bɛtani la, zĩse'e n kpɛ ni Olifs Zɔɔr la, U da tom U nya'andolib la bayi, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Kemi tembil la m be ya tɔɔn la, ka yan yɛ kpɛ̃'ɛ̃t la, ya nan nyɛ bombil ka so nan pu bã'ã kaa lo zɛ. Lorig mi ka tar na. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />So n ti bɔ'ɔh yii, &lt;Ya lorigit ka bo?&gt; yan lebih yii, &lt;Daan la m bɔɔt ka?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Seba ka U da tom la, da keŋ ya ti nyɛ ka a aa Un poɣun yel ba se'em la. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Ban da lorigit bombil la, ka daan la da bɔ'ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yibo ka ya lorigit bombil la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Ka ba lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Daan la m bɔɔt ka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Ba pana da tar ka na te Yezu; zaŋ fut paɣɛl ka, ka bah ka Yezu bã'ã ka. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Un da bã yɛ la, nirib da tar ba fut yarihit sarɔɔg la zugu.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Un da dol sarɔɔg la zɛ'ɛn Olifs Zɔɔr la sigit na la, nirikooŋ la, n a U nya'andolib la, da pĩ'ĩl mi woomit ni nkɔ-kpɛ'ɛma ni popeelum pɛ̃ɣɛt Na'ayen.<verse eid="LUK 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Yet yii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">&lt;&lt;Zusondaan a la na'ab la so n kenna ti Daan wo'or zugu la!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 19:38" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Sũma'ahum be tensoŋi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">ka na'ahug be saazugu ha!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Farasiinam seba n da laɣum be nirikooŋ la ni la da yel Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;Pa'ala ke ka I nya'andolib la gɔ'ɔ vuut?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Ka U lebih yii, &lt;&lt;N yet ya yii, bãã la wa n gɔ'ɔ vuut, kuga wa nan vu bah na?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Un da pɔ̃r na ka nyɛ teŋ la, U da kum mi ka zugu, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />yet yii, &lt;&lt;zina wa ya nirib la nan pu baŋ se'el n nan tar sũma'ahum naa! Nan-nan na, la nan pu nɛɛ te yaa. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Sera, dabiha ken ya sa'ani na, ka ya dindem nan bɛ̃r gilig kaa ya, kpãb ya zã'ã gilig bɔbir woo lebih. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Ba nan mɛrig yam ni ya biih tabel teŋ, ka kun ke ka ya kugir ni dikɔ̃ mi paɣa di taraan zugo; yam m pu baŋ sanse'e ka Na'ayen tã ya sa'ani na la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Sa'ah Nirib Yen Dobil la ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />U da kpɛ̃ po'ohug yir la poŋi, pĩ'ĩl kat nirib la n da kɔɔhit laɣat ni la bahit yeŋ; <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;La golih mi yii,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:46">&lt;&lt; &lt;Mam yir la nan a la po'ohug yir';</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:46">ka yam zaŋ di iŋa fããrib sɔk zĩ'ĩ?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Daar woo U da ni be po'ohug yir la pa'an. Malema kpɛɛnam la, gban-mi'irib ni nirib la tɔɔngatib la da ɛɛra fɔl yi ba ko' U; <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />ka ba da pu nyɛ fɔl-se'er ka ba nan dolihe, se'el n so la, nirib da a la keli yi ba wom U yelehum la.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Bam Bɔ'ɔhit Yezu Kpe'eoŋ la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Daar dikɔ̃, ka Yezu da be Na'ayen po'ohug dobil ni tɔɣɔt yelesoma pa'an nirib la, malemadem kpɛ'ɛnam ni gban-mi'irib la da dol ni kpɛɛnam na <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Yelim ti, lan kpe'eoŋ ka nyɛ tar it yel-ãã la wa? Ɔni n te i kpe'eoŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Ka U lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;Mam mi nan bɔ'ɔh ya bɔ'ɔhug ka ya lebih: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Geon kɔ'ɔm soob la yi la tensoŋi na bee nirib pĩ'ĩla ni na?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Ka ba sɔ̃hit U bɔ'ɔhug la ni taaba yet yii, &lt;&lt;Ti n yel yii, &lt;ku yi la tensoŋi na,&gt; U nan yel yii, &lt;ka yela ka ya da pu sak sera te u wa?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Ti n mi yel yii, &lt;La a la nirisaal pĩ'ĩla,&gt; nirib la zã'ã nan lob ti ni kuga ko; bam n sak yi Geon da a la nɔdɛ'ɛhit la zugu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Yela ka ba lebih yi ba pu baŋ ku n yi zĩ'ĩ naa.<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Ka Yezu yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Mam mi kun yel ya se'el kpe'eoŋ ka N tar tomit yel ãã la waa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pogur-Potɔɔlih Maɣahir la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yezu da pĩ'ĩl yet nirib la maɣah dee la wa: &lt;&lt;Buraa n da kɔ poog, zaŋ bah te u pogutib, ka keŋ tense'e ha ka la wuu. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Ka bunik saŋa n da paa la, u da tom u da'abir dikɔ̃ yi u keŋ u pogutib la sa'ani dɛ'ɛ u poog la tɔ̃t na te u; ka pogutib la gbã'ã da'abir la ŋmɛ sa'a bah ka u leb zaalim. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Ka poog daan la le maan tom da'abir dikɔ̃; ka ba da gbã'ã ɔŋ mi ŋmɛ ka to u, ka bah ka u leb zaalim. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Ka poog daan la sin ka tom so pa'ah butã; ka ba gbã'ã ɔŋ mi ŋmɛ poɣolum ka sa'a gu.<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Niŋa ka poog daan la bɔ'ɔh u mɛŋ, &lt;M pana nan iŋa yela? M baŋ se'el. N nan tom n mɛŋ dawɔse'e ka n nɔŋa; daase'ere ba nan na'ah ɔŋ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Ka pogutib la n da nyɛ u bii la, ba da yel taaba yii, &lt;Bi kãã la wa n nan ti tɛɛ so pooga; yela, bah mi ka ti ko' u ka tɛɛ so ku.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Yela ka ba da sa'agu tar yi poog la yeŋ ha ti ko'.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Poog daan la pana nan iŋ ba la yela? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />U nan tana ko bam mi ka tɛɛ zaŋ poog la te seba?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Ban da wom ŋwala la, ba da yel mi yii, &lt;&lt;Na'ayen da sak ka ŋwala iŋe!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Ka U beh ba ka yel yii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">&lt;Tɔɣɔ-boo la wa vɔ̃ɔ̃r a la: &lt;Kuguse'ere ka mɛtib la zaɣah la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">n nan a ɛ̃ɛ̃bir kugire?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />So woo n lu kugu-dee la wa zugu, nan ŋma bur bur; ka din lu so zugu la mi, nan ŋma yɛrig sãi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Ka gban-mi'irib la ni malema kpɛ'ɛnam la n da baŋ yi maɣahir la gɛ̃ɛ̃ha bam la, ba da bɔɔt yi ba kɔ'ɔn gba'a U la sankaŋa, ka lee da zot dabɛɛm nirib la zugu.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lempoo Wɔɔ Bɔ'ɔhug la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Ba da gur U mi ka tom lɛɣɛh-nam na seba n da niɣimit a aa nir-soma la, ka sɔɣɔ behit ban nan iŋ se'em gba'a U dol U tɔɣum la ni, tar U ti te gãkir dem ni teŋ la gɔmena la. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Lan ka ba bɔ'ɔh U yii, &lt;&lt;Pa'ala, ti mi yii, I tɔɣɔt ka pa'an na laan dol sɔr ka pu bɛɛgira, I pu gãhit nirib I tɔɣuma nii, I pa'an na Na'ayen sɔr la yelemɛŋir n a se'em. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />La tar sɔr yi ti wɔɔt lempoo tet nakãt Siiza la bee la ka'a?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yezu da baŋ ba niɣuŋ la ka yel ba yii, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />&lt;&lt;Pa'al mi nim laɣa-kɔ̃bir. Ɔni wo'or ni u zugu foto m be ni wa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Ka ba yel yii, &lt;&lt;La a la Siiza?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Zaŋ mi se'el n a Siiza bon te Siiza, ka zaŋ se'el n a Na'ayen bon mi te Na'ayen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Ba da pu nyɛ se'el ka ba nan zaŋ bɛ̃r U nirib la tɔ'ɔn dol Un yel se'el la; U lebihug la mi da a la pakir te ba ka ba yar sin.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kum Vo'ogum Dɔɔ Bɔ'ɔhug la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Saduusis dem, n pu sakit yi kum poŋi vo'ogir be la baseba da tã U sa'ani na <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />ka bɔ'ɔh U yii, &lt;&lt;Pa'ala, Moozis da golih te ti yi buraa sɔ̃ɔ̃g n kpi, ka bah u pɔɣa n ka biihe, buraa la tɔ'ɔn di pɔkɔ̃ɔ̃r la dɔɣɔ biih te u sɔ̃ɔ̃g la. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Nan-nan na, sɔ̃ɔ̃t bayopoi n da be; ka yiiga daan la di pɔɣɔ; ka kpi ka pu tar biiga; <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />ka so n taɣel buyi la <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />ni butã daan la mi di ka, ka la iŋa yela ka buraah siyopoi la zã'ã di pɔkɔ̃ɔ̃r la tɛɛh ka kpi ka ka ka' biiga. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Nya'aŋ ka bompɔk la mi kpi. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Kum vo'ogir daar la, ba ɔni pɔɣɔ n ti a bompɔk la, ka ba bayopoi la di ka tɛɛha?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yezu lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;Nirib m be teŋa zugu la n dit pɔɣɔb ka ɛn serib; <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />ka seba n nan vo'o kum poŋi kpɛ̃ tensoŋi la, kun ti dit pɔɣɔb bee ɛn seriba; <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Sera la aa bam ku n le kpi ya'aha, bam nan ŋmani ni Na'ayen maleka nam la ka a Na'ayen biih, vo'ogum dɔɔ kum poŋi la biih. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Lan a la kum vo'ogir yel la, Moozis mɛŋ da golih la yela pa'al yi la be sanse'e ka buɣum da dit mɔɔg la, zĩ'ĩ ka Moozis da tɔɣɔt u Daan la yela yii, U a la Ebraham Na'ayen, Aizik Na'ayen, ni Gekɔb Na'ayen la. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Nan - nan na U ka la kpi'inam Na'ayene, U a la baan vo Na'ayen, Ɔŋ sa'ani ka nir woo tar ŋwɔ̃vom?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Ŋwala ka gban-mi'irib la baseba lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Pa'ala, I tɔɣɔ somma?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Ba da pana zot yi ba le bɔ'ɔh U se'el ya'ah.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu aa Ɔni Bɔ'ɔhug la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Ka U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yela ka nirib yet yi Fããt la a la Devit dawɔɔga? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Ka Devit mɛŋ yel Wooma gbauŋ la ni yii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;Daan la yel mam Daan la yii, &lt;&lt;Zi'inim m dituŋ nu'uga,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />gur ka n ti bah ka i dindem la lebig i nɔba kok.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Devit bɔɔn Yezu la Daan; ka yela ka Yezu nan a Devit dawɔɔga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Ŋmaa Gban-mi'irib la Toba Dããl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Nir woo toba ni, U da yel U nya'andolib la yii, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />&lt;&lt;Baŋ mi gban-mi'iriba yela, seba n gin kaagit ni fuwɔɣa wa, bam nɔŋa nirib n dɔ̃ben teŋ po'ohit ba da'ah poŋi, ka nɔŋ ba zi nindaagin-dem koɣih zut dɛ'ɛnkãra poŋi. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Ba ken saahira pɔkɔ̃ya yɛ', ni bam bɔɔt yi nirib nyɛt ba la zugu, ba po'ohug a la po'oh-wɔɣa. Ba nan nyɛ la sããhekãt n gaat zã'ã?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Pɔkɔ̃ɔ̃r la Teeb Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yezu n da be Na'ayen po'ohug dobil la ni la, U da gɔrig nyɛ ka bondaanam tar ba teeb it teeb peog la ni; <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />ka mi nyɛ ka pɔkɔ̃ɔ̃r n a nɔndaan zaŋ laɣakɔ̃ba n pɔ'ɔ a aa wontiyi la iŋ peog la ni. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Ka Yezu yel yii, &lt;&lt;Sera ka Mam yet ya wa, pɔkɔ̃-nɔndaana teh gaat ba zã'ã. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Se'el n so la, bãã la wa lɔɔ la se'el ba mɔrum la poŋi te, ka ɔŋ ni u nɔŋ la zã'ã la, zaŋa se'el ka u naan dii n la zã'ã te?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dããluŋ Ni Namehug Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Nir seba n da tɔɣɔt Yen po'ohug dobil la yela, pa'an ba n gol ku somma se'em ni kuga ni teson se'eb taab ka ba tar tet Na'ayen ku poŋi la, U da yel yii, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />&lt;&lt;Laɣara woo ka ya nyɛta, dabihir kenna, ka kugir ni dikɔ̃ mi kun le paɣa di taraan zugo; ba zã'ã nan ti gbirig lu teŋ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Ka ba bɔ'ɔh Yezu yii, &lt;&lt;Pa'ala, sankani ka la nan iŋe, ka lani n nan ti a dããluŋ pa'al yi la yi la iŋ mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Ka U yel yii, &lt;&lt;Baŋ mi ka da ke ka so pã'ãh yaa; Ka nirib berigu nan tana Mam wo'or zugu yet ya yii, &lt;Maan a Krista la!&gt; ka, &lt;Saŋa la pɔ̃r mi!&gt; Da dolin baa.<verse eid="LUK 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />&lt;&lt;Ya n ti womit zaba ni gbirigir yela, yan da zot dabɛɛm, ka yel ãã la wa a la se'a n nan ti iŋ yiiga, ka ba'ahug kun dol nila nilaa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Ka U pana da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Teŋ nan dɔɔ zabir ni teŋ, ka so'olum mi dɔɔ zabir ni so'olum; <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />teŋ miiun-kãra nan ti be, ka kompɛɛlig ni bã'ãh mi nan ti be zĩ'ĩ woo; yan-ɛ̃k yela ni yel nyalinkãra dããluŋ nan ti be saazugu ha.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />&lt;&lt;Ka laa la wa zã'ã n ti nyaŋ iŋ la nya'aŋ, ba nan gbã ya namih, ka zaŋ ya te ba zamehug yɛ' ni paɣarib dotin. Ba nan tar ya ti zɛ'ɛl nanam ni tenso'orib tɔɔn Mam wo'or zugu. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Laa la wa n nan a ya sɛhira dii pa'alug. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Yela, ya da fabin ni yan nan yel se'el gu ya mɛŋa; <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Mam nan te ya yam, ka ya baŋ yan nan tɔɣɔ se'em, ka ya dindem la kun tɔ'ɔn zɛ'ɛl ni ya bee tɔɣɔ nyaŋ ya ka yel yi ya tuu mii. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Ya dɔɣɔrib ni ya sɔ̃ɔ̃t, ya yir-dem ni zɔnam nan kɔɔh ya teh; ka ba nan ko' ya seba. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Nirib zã'ã nan dim ni ya Mam wo'or zugu. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Da bahin ka ya yam ŋma'ara, ka ya zugu zɔbug ni kukɔ̃ mi kun borige. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Ya ninŋmibir la zugu ka ya siih nan nyɛ fããgir.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Geruzalɛm Sã'ãuŋ la Yela Deŋ yina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />&lt;&lt;Yan ti nyɛ ka zab-zabirib gilig kaa Geruzalɛm, yan baŋim yi teŋ la sã'auŋ pɔ̃r mi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Yela, seba m be Geudiya la zom do zɔya la ha, ka seba m be tenkãra la poŋi la bahum si ka yi, ka seba mi m be tenkpeh la da kpɛ̃ tenkãra la nii; <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />ŋwala a la toom-be'et dem namehug saŋa, ke ka se'el n da poɣun golih Na'ayen gbauŋ la ni la a mɛɣɛla. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />La nan tɔ te pɔɣɔpooh ni bilɛɛh manam dabih aŋ ni! Namih-kãt nan be teŋa zugu ka sã'auŋ nan paa niriba. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Ba nan zaŋ zaba so'oh ko' ba, ka gbã seba teh tehin a aa da'aba la; ka nir seba m pu dol Na'ayen la, nan nɔ Geruzalɛm taal teŋ, gur ka ba saŋa ti ba'ah.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asaal Dawɔɔ La Lebig Na la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />&lt;&lt;Dããluŋ nan ti be wuntɛɛŋ la ni, ŋwarik la ni ŋmaribibih la ni, ka dããluŋ la nan ti a la sũsa'auŋ be tehin ka teok kɔ'ɔm damig ni bu kɔmiih la ke ka nirib yam borig. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Dabɛɛm nan ke ka nirib ligi ni se'el n it teŋa la, panse'eh m be saazugu ha la nan dam. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Niŋa ka ba pana nan nyɛ' Asaal Dawɔɔ la m be sangbauŋ ni sigit na,' ni paŋ ni pɛ̃ɣɛb berigu. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Yel ãã la wa n ti pĩ'ĩl it, dɔɔ mi zɛ'ɛn gɔr saazugu, ka ya fããgir vurihit du'ut na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkaŋ la Maɣahir Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Ka Yezu mak maɣahir yii, &lt;&lt;Behimi nkaŋa ni tii ha zã'ã; <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />ban ti pĩ'ĩl puhit vamɛla, ya mɛŋ ni nyɛ baŋ yi sɛ̃ug a yamma. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Yela mɛŋ, yan ti nyɛ ka yel ãã la wa it, yam baŋim yi Na'ayen so'olum la a yam ma.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Yelemɛŋir ka N yet ya wa, ti zomaan-kãã la wa niriba kum ba'ahe, yel ãã la wa n pu iŋe. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Saazugu ni teŋ nan gaat, ka Mam yelehum ma ka gaarugo.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Naahug Kpã'auŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Baŋ mi, ka da zaŋi ya saŋa zã'ã tẽ'ẽhit yan nan iŋ se'em dit bee ŋwũũt bee tẽ'ẽhit ya vom putẽraa, ka dabih den ti di'igit ya mi, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />a aa bɛ̃rug la. La nan sigi nir woo m be tempabira zugu na. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Maahum mi ya mɛŋ saŋa woo, po'ohit yi ya nan tar paŋ nyaŋ pɛ̃ɛ̃ yel ãã la wa woo n yi a iŋ la, ka nyaŋ zɛ̃'ɛ̃l Asaal Dawɔɔ la tɔɔn ka U poor pɛɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Daar woo U da ni be la Na'ayen po'ohug doog la ni pa'an, ka wo'oŋ, U da ni do la Olifs Zɔɔr la zugu ha. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Beogin wo'oŋ wo'oŋ, nirib la zã'ã da ni dɔɔ keŋa Na'ayen po'ohug doog la ni ti womihit Yezu tɔɣum.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu Koo Dɔ̃rig la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Boruboru kãha maluŋ la, da bɔɔn Zɔɔgaat la, da pɔ̃r mi. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Malema kpɛɛnam la ni gban-mi'irib la da ɛɛra sɔse'er ka ba nan dolih gbã'ã Yezu ko', ka dabɛɛm da tar ba la nirib la zugu. <verse eid="LUK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Sitaana da kpɛ̃ Geudas m bɔɔn Isekariyɔt, so n da a nya'andolib piiga ni bayi la nkɔ̃ la; <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />U da keŋ mi ha ti tɔɣɔ ni malema kpɛɛnam la ni Na'ayen po'ohug doog kpɛɛnam la ɔŋ n nan kɔɔh Yezu te ba se'em. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Ka nirib la poor pɛɛ hali ka ba gbã'ã nɔɔr yi ba nan te u ligiri. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Ka u sak ka pĩ'ĩl ɛɛt fɔl se'er ka u nan dolih zaŋ Yezu kɔɔh te ba sanse'e ka nirikooŋ kun be niŋa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false" /></note><verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zɔɔgaat Maluŋ la Maahuŋ la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Boruboru kãha maluŋ dabihir la n da paa la, la da a la ba kããb ni Zɔɔgaat pebil la. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yela ka Yezu da tom Pita ni Geon ka yet yii, &lt;&lt;Kemi ti maal Zɔɔgaat diit la ka ti tana di?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Ka ba bɔ'ɔh U yii, &lt;&lt;Ya ha ka Nyɛ bɔɔt yi ti maal diit la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Ka Yezu yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Womih mi,&gt;&gt; yan ti kpɛ̃ teŋ la ni, ya nan to'oh buraa n ziit kɔ'ɔm ni woor; dolin ni u kpɛ̃ yise'er ka u kpɛ̃'ɛ̃t la <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />ni ya yel yir la daan, &lt;Pa'al la bɔ'ɔh i yii, &lt;&lt;Saam doog la lee ka U ni U nya'andolib la nan zi'in di Zɔɔgaat diit la?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />U nam pa'al ya doyaluŋ n be dotoɣoma zugu ha, poɣun maal zɛ ni koɣih. Maahum mi niŋa te ti?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Ka ba keŋ ti nyɛ se'el woo ka la a aa Ɔŋ m poɣun yel ba se'em la; ka ba maahum Zɔɔgaat dii la niŋa.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zusoŋ Diit La Pĩ'ĩlug</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Saŋa la n da paa la, Yezu ni U nya'andolib la da zi'in ba dii zĩ'ĩ la. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;M ba' bɔɔt yi N di Zɔɔgaat diiga mi ni ya ka baŋ pĩ'ĩl namehug; <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />N yet ya mi wa, yi N kun le di ka taaba gur la ti pa'al la n nan a se'em Na'ayen so'olum la ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Ka zaŋ ŋman ni daam U nu'uhin, te Na'ayen tooma ba'ah ka yel ba yii, dɛ'ɛ mi ni ya ŋwũ ka te taaba; <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Mam yet ya yii, nan-nan na tar yɛ ha, Man kun le ŋwũ tiwola daam gur Na'ayen so'olum la n ti paa na?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Ka pana zaŋ boruboru, te Na'ayen tooma ba'ah ka gbɛ̃'ɛ̃h te U nyaandolib la, ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;Mam niŋ n ŋwala ka N zaŋit tet ya wa. Iŋ mi ŋwala ni ya tẽr N yel?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Ban da di ba'ah la, U da le iŋa yela mɛŋ nɔɔ, zaŋ ŋwan ni daam, ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;Ŋwan na ka N kpa'agit tet ya wa, a la Mam nɔdiŋ paal, ka N diŋit ni ya ni N ziima. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Ka behimi nii, so n kɔɔh Mam la n zĩ ni Mam ka u nu'ug be laaga ni wa. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />La a la sera yi Asaal Dawɔɔ la nan keŋ a aa la n poɣun golih dɔ'ɔl se'em na la, ka la nan a yel-kãt te so n kɔɔh U te la!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Ka nya'andolib la pĩ'ĩl gããt bɔ'ɔhit taaba, bam so n nan sak tom di.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gaarug Nɔkpɛ'ɛmir la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Nɔkpɛ'ɛmir da lu nya'andolib la tinsok yi ba baŋ ba poŋi la, ba so n gaat ba zã'ã. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Ka Yezu yel ba yii: &lt;&lt;Teŋa ni, nanam pɛ̃rigit ba nirib mi, ka seba n pa'an ba kpe'eoŋa, ke ka nirib la nyɛt ka ba a soŋirib. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Amaa yam da a aa bam n a se'em laa; ke ka so n gaat zã'ã la a ya bii, ka tɔɔngat la ŋwan ni so n tomit tet ya. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Ɔni n gaat zã'ãga, so ka ba tomit tet la bee so n tomit tet la? La ka la so ka ba tomit tet laa? Ka Mam be ni ya wa, a la so n tomit tet la. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />&lt;&lt;Yam n a seba n zɛ kpɛ ni Mam N namehuga poŋi; <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />ka Mam zaŋ n so'olum ma te ya mi, a aa M ba' la n zaŋ U so'olum te Mam yi N won se'em la <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />ya nan di ka ŋwũ Mam so'olum la poŋi, ka mi nan zĩ na'am koɣih zut gãkit Izirɛal buuri piiga ni bayi la.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu deŋ yel Pita Ki'ihug Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />&lt;&lt;Simɔn, Simɔn, womih ma! Sitaana bɔɔt yi u nyɛ fɔl yɛɛl ya zã'ã mi a aa ki' ut la bah. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ka Mam po'ohit tet i mi yi i sera sakir tar paŋ; ka nyɛ n ti leb na, i nan kpemih i sɔ̃ɔ̃t la?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Ka Pita yel yii, &lt;&lt;N Daana, mam maahum ya yi n dol ni nyɛ keŋ paɣarib doog la ni, ka la n a la kum, mam ni nyɛ laɣan kpi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Ka Yezu yel yii, &lt;&lt;Mam yet nyɛ Pita yii, nɔrɔɔg kun ka'ah zinaa, gur ka nyɛ ti ki'ih sugum butã yi i zi Mam?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Potamaan, Tapɔk ni So'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Man daa tom ya yi ya yim ka da tar potamaan bee tapɔk bee taɣara la, ya daa kɔŋit se'el laa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Ka ba yel yii, &lt;&lt;aai, ti daa pu kɔŋira?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ka nan-nan na, ya so n tar potamaan un zaŋ ma, tapɔk daan mi iŋim yela nɔɔ. Ka so mi n pu tar so'oga kɔɔhum u fuug da nkɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />N yet ya mi wa, golih koo la wa nan dolih yela nɔɔ Mam yel la poŋi; La golih yi ba kããl U pa'aha naɣayiih poŋi.&gt;; La mi a la sera yi ban golih Mam yela se'em la, serin tana tom.<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Ba da yel yii, &lt;&lt;Daana, beh maa, so'oh siyi n ŋwala?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Ka U lebih yii, &lt;&lt;la sɛk ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Po'ohit Olifs Zɔɔr La Zugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />U da yi na keŋ, do Olifs zɔɔr la ha, a aa Un ni poɣun it se'em la, ka U nyaandolib la dolih U; <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Un da paa niŋa la, U da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Po'oh mi yi be'em gãkir la da paa yaa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />U da vurih keŋ tɔɔn ha ka bah ba, ti kpã duna po'ohit yii, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />&lt;&lt;M Ba'a, Nyɛ M bɔɔt, Nyɛ n da ke ka N ŋwũ namehug ŋwan na nii; ka la lee iŋ a aa Nyɛ M bɔɔt se'em la, ka ka Mam N bɔɔt se'em?&gt;&gt; [<verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Ka Na'ayen maleka zɛ'ɛn saazugu tã U sa'ani na pa'ah U paŋ.<verse eid="LUK 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />U putẽtoora da bah ka U malegum po'oh gaat yela, ka murigir so U ka kpa'agit tɔɣɔhit teŋ a aa ziim la.]<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Un da po'oh ka dɔɔ leb U nya'andolib la sa'ani la, U da nyɛ ka ba dɔ' mi gbĩhit, ba sũsa'auŋ la zugu, <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />ka U bɔ'ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yela ka ya gbĩhira? Dɔɔ mi ni ya po'oh ka be'eog gãkir la da paa ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Dɔ̃rig Ni U Gbã'ãgir la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yezu da kpelim be ni tɔɣɔt la, ba di'i ka nirikooŋ paagit na, ka so n bɔɔn Geudas, a U nya'andolib piiga ni bayi la nkɔ̃ la, gaat tɔɔn dol ni ba paagit na. U da paa Yezu sa'ani yi u kɔk U; <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />ka Yezu yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Geudas, la a la kɔkir ka i nan zaŋ dɔ̃r Asaal Dawɔɔgaa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Seba n da zɛ niŋa ka nyɛ se'el n it la, da bɔ'ɔh mi yii, &lt;&lt;Daana, ti kɛ' ba ni so'o laa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Ka ba nkɔ̃ fɔɔ so'o pɛhig malema kpɛɛnam la nkɔ̃ da'abir dituŋ tobir bah.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ka Yezu yel u yii, &lt;&lt;Da le pa'ah dii.&gt;&gt; Ka kalim u tobir la ka di leb tabel.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Ka Yezu pana yel kpɛɛnam la, ni yen po'ohug dobil zab-zabirib kpɛɛnam, ni yizut kpɛɛnam la n tana yi ba gbã'ã U la yii, &lt;&lt;Yibo ka ya yina ni so'oh ni dambana a aa Mam a la naɣayiiga? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Mam n daa be ni yam po'ohug doogin la daar woo la, ka yam pu gbã'ã Mam, ka la a la sankãã la wa n a lik paŋ saŋa wa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pita Zi'ih Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Ba da gbã'ã U tar yɛ la malema daan-kpɛɛm la yir, ka Pita be nya'aŋ zãã ha dol ba. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Ban da laŋ buɣum ndɔuŋ tinsok kaa bu zĩ la, ka Pita tana laɣun zĩ ni ba. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Ka bompuŋ n a pɔɣɔsɔɔg, nyɛ Pita buɣum la ni, beh u ki'i ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;Bura-kãã la wa mi ni dol Yezu mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ka Pita ki'ih yel yii, &lt;&lt;Bompɔkaa, mam pu mi U?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Ka la iŋ bɛ'ɛla, ka so mi nyɛ Pita ka yel u yii, &lt;&lt;nyɛ mi a la ba nkɔ̃?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Ka Pita lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Buraagaa, mam pu pa'ah ba nii!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Ka la iŋ aa gogo mumir dikɔ̃ la, ka bura-se'e mi yel yii, &lt;&lt;Sera, bura kã'ã la wa ni be mi ni Yezu, u yila Galili na?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Ka Pita yel yii, &lt;&lt;Buraagaa, mam zi nyɛ n tɔɣɔt se'el laa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Ka Daan la ŋmɛrig beh Pita. Ka Pita tẽẽ Daan la yelehum la yii, &lt;&lt;Nɔrɔɔg kun kaah zinaa, lan ka nyɛ n ti ki'ih butã yi i pu mi Mam?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Ka Pita yi yeŋ ti fiɣimit ni nkuma.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Kɛhig, ni U Ŋmɛ'ɛt la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Burase'eh n da gur Yezu la, da pĩ'ĩl kɛhir U ka ŋmɛ'ɛr U; <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />ba ni pĩ la U nini ka bɔ'ɔhit U yii, &lt;&lt;Bok ma! Ɔni n ŋmɛ'ɛ i wa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Ka kɔ'ɔn to'ot U pɛsi pɛsi.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Paa Kpɛ'ɛnam Tɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Beog n da yelig la, ba da laɣah kpɛɛnam, ni malema kpɛɛnam, ni gban-mi'irib, tar Yezu tã ba kpɛ'ɛnam kootin la na, <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Ka yel U yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ n a la fããt la, nyɛ n yelim ti?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Ka U lebih yii, Man N yel ya, ya kun sak seraa; <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />ka Mam bɔ'ɔh ya se'el, ya kun lebihe. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ka nan-nan na, tar yɛ ha, Asaal Dawɔɔ la nan zĩ la Na'ayen paŋ waabi Daan la dituŋ nu'ug?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Ka ba zã'ã bɔ'ɔh U yii, &lt;&lt;Ka Nyɛ n pana a Na'ayen Dawɔɔ laa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Ka U lebih ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yam n yel yi N a mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Ka ba yel yii, &lt;&lt;Yelehum boni ka ti le ɛɛt ya'aha? Ti wom di U mɛŋ nɔɔrin!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu be Palet tɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Nir seba woo n da be tigihug la ni la, da dɔɔ mi gbil-li tar Yezu tã Palet tɔɔn na. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Ka pĩ'ĩl zũũhur U, yet yii, &lt;&lt;Ti nyɛ ka buraaga pa'ana laa n ka sommaa, bah ka ti teŋa gbirigit, kat yi ba da wɔɔt lempoo tet Siizaa, ka yet yi ɔŋ mɛŋ n a fããt la, ka a na'ab?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Ka Palet bɔ'ɔh U yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ n a Geudem na'ab laa?&gt;&gt; Ka Yezu lebih yii,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">&lt;&lt;Nyɛ mɛŋ yelehum n la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Ka Palet yel malema kpɛ'ɛnam ni nirikooŋ la yii, &lt;&lt;Mam pu nyɛ se'el ka ya zũũhit buraaga laa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ka ba sin ka zɛ' kankaŋi tãhit lebihit ha yii, &lt;&lt;U gbirigira nirib ni U pa'alug la, dol Geudiya teŋ zã'ã, zɛ'ɛn Galili ni zĩse'e ka U da pĩ'ĩl pa'alug la, tar yela ti paa kpela na?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Be Hɛrɔd Tɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Palet n da wom ŋwala la, u da bɔ'ɔh yi u baŋ nyaa buraaga yila Galili naa. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Ka un da baŋ yi Yezu yila Hɛrɔd so'olum ni na la, u da te sɔr yi ba tar U ti te Hɛrɔd, so n da poɣun deŋ tã Geruzalɛm sankaŋ na la. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Hɛrɔd n da nyɛ Yezu la, u poor da pɛɛ mi, laa n so la, u da wom Yezu yela ka la wɔɣɔ mi, ka da bɔɔt yi u nyɛ Yezu ka U tom nyalima ka ɔŋ mi nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Hɛrɔd da bɔ'ɔh Yezu yela mi berigu, ka U da pu lebih se'el se'ela. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Malema kpɛ'ɛnam ni gban-mi'irib la da zɛ ni, tãhit zɛrigit yi Yezu it la be'em. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Hali Hɛrɔd ni u soogɛnam la da la' Yezu mi ka tom U zɛɛh tooma; ka zaŋ fusoŋ yɛɛl U, ka tar U leb Palet sa'ani. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Hɛrɔd ni Palet da a la dindem ni taaba; ka daan-den nim, ka ba da lebig zɔt.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Palet Gãk Yi Ba Ko' Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Palet da bɔɔl malema kpɛ'ɛnam ni teŋ la kpɛ'ɛnam ni nirib la, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />ka yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya tar buraaga na tem ka yel yi U a la so n daamit nirib; ya mi nyɛ ka m bɔ'ɔhit U ya nindaagin wa, ka pu nyɛ Un tuu yelese'a ka ya zaŋ gãk U laa. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Hɛrɔd mi pu nyɛ U tuugire, ka lebih tulig U te ti na wa. Yelemɛŋir, U pu iŋ se'el ka la nar yi U kpii. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Yela n nan ke ka ba fɛɛb U ka bah U ka U keŋ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Amaa la som yi n yih nir nkɔ̃ te zɔɔgaat maluŋ la daar.<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Yela ka ba zã'ã laɣun tãh berigu, &lt;&lt;Tarin Yezu wa keŋ! Ka zaŋ Barabas te ti!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Barabas da be la sãriga ni dol la ba n da gãk u yi ɔŋ n gbirigit teŋ la, ni un ko' nir la zugu.) <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Palet n da bɔɔt yi u zaŋ Yezu bah la, u da le tɔɣɔ te nirib la mi; <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />ka ba da sin ka vuut tãhit, &lt;&lt;Kpa mi U, kpa mi U mpuur dɔɔg zugu!<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Palet da tɔɣɔ te ba pa'ah butã yii, &lt;&lt;Yibo, U toma den ka la a be'em? Mam pu nyɛ U taal n a se'er ka la nar yi U kpii; yela n nan bah ka ba fɛɛb U ka bah ka U keŋ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ka nirib la da sin ka tãhit berug berug yi ba kpa Yezu; ba da tãh mi hali ti nyaŋ nyɛ bam m bɔɔt se'em la. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Ka Palet da zɛɣɛ kɔŋ ka bah te ba. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />U da tɛɛ yiha burase'e ka bam bɔɔt la bah, so ka ba da wo' u teŋ gbirigir ni u nir koo zugu la, ka zaŋ Yezu te ba, yi ba iŋ bam m bɔɔt se'em la.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba Kpa Yezu Mpuur Dɔɔg Zugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Ba n da tar Yezu yɛ la, soogɛnam la da gĩ buraa ka u wo'or bɔɔn Siimɔn, yi Saarin teŋ na, zaŋ mpuur dɔɔg la to'ogu, ka ke ka u zi dol Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Nirikooŋ n da dol u, ka bompɔɣɔh la n da be ni la, da kaahit Yezu zugu. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Ka Yezu ŋmɛrig beh ba ka yel yii, &lt;&lt;Geruzalɛm pɔɣɔwɔɔhaa, da kaahirin Mam zugo, ka kaah mi tet ya mɛŋ ni ya biih. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Dabih se'er kenna ka ba nan yel yii, &lt;kamaalug be ni bompɔɣɔse'e n nan pu dɔɣɛ, ni seba n nan pu tabel mɔɣɔh biiga.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Bam nan pĩ'ĩl yet zɔya la yii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">&lt;&lt;Lu mi ti zugu na,&gt;&gt; ka yet nkubirih la yii, &lt;Pĩ mi ti na!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Ba n it ŋwala ka dɔɔg la n nan a dɔma'ahire, lani n nan iŋ, kun ti a dɔkpɛ'ɛŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Nirib bayi mi, n da a toom-be'et dem, ka ba da laɣun tar ba ni Yezu yɛ' yi ba ti ko. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Ba n da paa zĩ'ĩ m bɔɔn Zuŋmaliŋmana la, ba da kpa Yezu ni toom-be'et dem la la niŋa, nkɔ̃ U dituŋ nu'ug bɔba, nkɔ̃ mi U gɔbig nu'ug. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Ka Yezu da po'oh yii, &lt;&lt;M Ba'a, dim suguru te ba, ka ba pu mi ba n it se'el la?&gt;&gt; Ka ba da ŋmɛ gbãŋa yi ba tɔ̃r U laɣat la.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Nirib la da zɛ' mi, behit Yezu; ka ba tɔɔngatib la to'ot U, yet yii, &lt;&lt;U fãã seba bah; bah mi ka U fãã U mɛŋ mi bah, Un serin a la fããt, so ka Na'ayen lɔɔ la!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Soogɛnam la mi da kɛhir U mi, ka tar dami'ihug na tet U, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />ka yet yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ n a la Geudem Na'ab la, nyɛ fããgim I mɛŋ bah!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Ba da golih mpuur-dɔɔg la zugu yii,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="LUK 23:38">
    <char style="sc">&lt;&lt;GEUDEM NA'AB LA N ŊWALA?&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Toom-be'et dem la ka ba da laɣun kpa la nkɔ̃ n da to'ot Yezu yet yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ ka la Fããt laa? Fããgim I mɛŋ bah ka fãã tam mi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ka u taraan la tãh u yet yii, &lt;&lt;I pu zot Na'ayene, yi nyɛ ni buraaga sããhug la laɣun a la bukɔ̃laa? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Sera, tam namehuga a la la sɔr, lan zugo, tam dɛ'ɛgira ti toom-be'et la ŋwɔɔt, ka buraaga pu tom be'eogo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Ka pana yel yii, &lt;&lt;Yezu, ti tẽr n yel Nyɛ n ti tã I na'am so'olum la ni na?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Ka Yezu lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Yelemɛŋir ka N yet i wa, nyɛ ni Mam nan be Na'ayen So'olumi la zina?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Kum Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />La da a la wuntɛɛntasoo, ka lik tana pĩ teŋ la zã'ã tar tar ti paa wuntɛɛŋ kariha atã, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />ka wuntɛɛŋ la n da kɔŋ nyɛɛgir la; tan la n da wul Yen-doog la ni bɔk ku buyi la, da ãã mi bɔk buyi. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Ka Yezu kaah ni nkɔr kpɛ'ɛmir yel yii, &lt;&lt;M Ba'a, N zaŋim Sii iŋa I nu'uhin?&gt;&gt; U da yela ŋwala ba'ah ka kpi.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Ka soogɛ so n behit zab-zabirib kɔbig la n da nyɛ se'el n iŋ la, da pẽɣɛt Na'ayen ka yet yii, &lt;&lt;Sera, bura-kãã la wa pu tuu se'el se'el la?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Ka nirikooŋ la zã'ã n da laɣah niŋa la, nyɛ se'el n iŋ la, da leb kul ba yɛ' mi ni sũsã'ãuŋ. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Seba n da mi Yezu la zã'ã, laɣum ni bompɔɣɔse'eh n da dol ni U Galili na la, da zɛ' mi lala ha, ka won se'el n it la.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Laagir la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Burasoŋ, a ntɔɔ daan, n da be, bɔɔn Geozɛf, so, n da laɣun a teŋ la kpɛɛm nkɔ̃ la, <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />da pu sak ni nirib la n da tẽ'ẽh yi ba iŋ se'em laa. U da yi la Arimatia n be Geudem teŋ la, ka da gur ni putẽ'ẽr yi Na'ayen so'olum la tana. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Burakãã la wa da keŋ Palet sa'ani yel yi ba zaŋ Yezu niŋ la te u. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />U da pana yak kum la sigi, pɔ̃b ni fuug, ka zaŋ laa wɔse'eog ka u da tũ taŋ lɛuŋi la, wɔse'eog ka ba nan pu laa nir ku poŋii. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />La da a la maahuŋ dabihir, ka vo'ohug saŋa la mi pi'in.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Bompɔɣɔse'eh n da dol ni Yezu Galili na la, da dol ti nyɛ wɔɔg la ka nyɛ ban laa Yezu se'em. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Ba da leb kul ti maal kpaam n tar ŋwuug somma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Vo'ohug daar la, ba da vo'oh mi, ka la dol wara la m pa'al se'em la.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu N Vo'o Kum Poŋi la Yela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Lahir daar beogin wo'oŋ wo'oŋ, ka bompɔɣɔh la da tar kpasom la ka ba maal la, tã wɔɔg la ni na. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Ba da nyɛ ka sɛtaŋ la bilig wɔɔg nɔɔrin la mi dɔ ha, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />ka ba n da kpɛ̃ ku ni la, ba da pu nyɛ Yezu niŋ laa. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Ka ba n da zɛ bora ni yel la la, ba di'i ka buraah siyi zɛ ni ba, yɛ fut ka ti nyaɣit kpɛɣɛ kpɛɣɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Dabɛɛm da sãã bompɔɣɔha mi ka ba su'un teŋ, ka buraah la yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yibo ka ya ɛɛt so n vo kpi'inam poŋi? U le ka kpelaa, U vo'o dɔɔ mi. <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Tẽrin Un daa nan be Galili ka yel ya se'el la: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />yi ba nan zaŋ Asaal Dawɔɔ la te yelebe'et dem, ka ba kpa U mpuur dɔɔg zugu, ka dabiha atã daar U nan le vo'o dɔɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Niŋa ka ba tẽẽ Yezu yelehum la.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Ka ban zɛ'ɛn wɔɔg la ni lebit la, ba da yel U nya'andolib piiga ni nkɔ̃ la ni nirib la zã'ã se'el n iŋ. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />La da a la Mɛɛri Magedalin, ni Geona, ni Gemis ma Mɛɛri, ni bompɔɣɔse'eh m be ni ba la n da yel nya'andolib la. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Yel ãã la wa da ŋman ni solima mi tet nya'andolib la, ka ba pu sak seraa. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ka Pita da dɔɔ zo keŋ wɔɔg la ni; ka un da ku'un veeh beh ku poŋi la, u da nyɛ la laagir laɣat la ma'a; ka leb kul, ka tẽ'ẽhit ka la iŋ u pakir ni se'el n iŋ la.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sɔr Zugu Ken Yɛ Imayɔs La</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />La da a la daan den ka ba bayi da yɛ Imayɔs, tembil n a aa mɛɛla ayopoi paagit Geruzalɛm, <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />ka tɔɣɔt tet taaba yel se'a n iŋ la. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Ba n da sɔ̃hit la, ka Yezu mɛŋ keŋ paa ba ka ba laɣun ken, <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />la da pu tã ba tẽ'ẽrin na ka ba baŋ yi Un laa.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Ka U bɔ'ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Lan ka ya be sɔr zugu ken ka tɔɣɔt ni taaba?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Ka ba da tɛk zɛ'ɛn kĩ'ĩ, ni sũsã'ãuŋ. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Ka ba nkɔ̃, so n da bɔɔn Kilopas la, lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ a la saan Geruzalɛm ni ka pu mi yel se'a n iŋ dabiha wa nii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Ka U lebih bɔ'ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yel ani?&gt;&gt; Ka ba lebih yii, &lt;&lt;Yel se'a n iŋ Yezu n yi Nazarɛf na la, so n daa a nɔdɛ'ɛh, pɛ'ɛl ni paŋ ni yelehum Na'ayen ni nir woo tɔɔn la. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Ka ti malema kpɛ'ɛnam ni tɔɔngatib la daa zaŋ U teh, ka ba gãk U ka kpa U mpuuredɔɔg zugu la. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Tam daa tar putẽ'ẽr yi U a la so n nan fãã Izirɛal bah. Ɛ̃ɛ̃, se'el m pa'ah ŋwala zã'ã ni la, a la zina a la dabiha atã ka yel ãã la wa woo iŋ. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Se'el m pa'ah a la, bompɔɣɔh seba m pa'ah ti poŋi la n ke ka ti nɔya maam. Zina beogin wo'oŋ wo'oŋ ka ba keŋe wɔɔg la ni, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ka pu nyɛ Yezu niŋ la ni la, ba leb mi na yel ti yi ba nyɛ la Na'ayen ntomirib ka ba yel yi U vo mi. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Seba n been ni ti la, keŋ wɔɔg la ni, ka nyɛ ka la a la bompɔɣɔh la n yel se'em la nɔɔ; bam mi pu nyɛ U wa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Ka U yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Oo, ya gaam mii, ka ya bɔkir mi tɔ ni ya sak se'el ka U nɔdɛ'ɛhirib la yel ya laa! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />La poɣun nar mi yi Fããt la namih yel ãã la zugu ka pana kpɛ̃ U na'am la ni?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Zɛ'ɛn Moozis ni, ni nɔdɛ'ɛhirib la zã'ã, Yezu da tɔɣɔ teba pa'al U Mɛŋ yela n a se'em golihug la zã'ã ni.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Ba n da ken ti pɔ̃r teŋ la ka ba yɛ la, Yezu da keŋ zɔɔ ba aa U gatin ha la. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Ka ba belim U yii, &lt;&lt;Kpelimim ni ti kpela, ka la a la zaanɔɔr ka wuntɛɛŋ yɛ luu. &lt;&lt;Yela ka U da kpɛ̃ yir la ni yi U be ni ba.<verse eid="LUK 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Un da zi'in ni ba yi ba di la, U da zaŋ boruboru, po'oh ka gbɛ̃'ɛ̃ bu, lɔɔh tɔ̃r ba. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Yela ma'a ka ba pana baŋ Un a so; ka U da mɛlim ba tɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Ka ba yet taaba yii, &lt;&lt;Ti sũya pu toligin mi ti poŋi ha Un tɔɣɔrin tet ti sɔr la zugu, ka pa'an Na'ayen yeletɔɣum la n golih se'em la tet ti laa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Sankaŋ, ka ba pana dɔɔ tulig leb Geruzalɛm; ti nyɛ nya'andolib piiga ni nkɔ̃ la ka bam ni ba son-nam laɣah taaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Ba da yet yii, &lt;&lt;Daan la serin vo'o dɔɔ mi, Ka nɛɛ U Mɛŋ pa'al Simɔn!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Ka ba bayi la da pana yel se'el n iŋ sɔr la zugu, ni Un ke ka ba baŋ U boruboru gbɛ̃'ɛ̃hug niŋa la.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Nɛɛ U Mɛŋ Pa'al U Nya'andolib La</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Ba n da nan tɔɣɔt yel se'a n iŋ la, ka Yezu Mɛŋ tana zɛ'ɛn pa'ah ni ba ka yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Sũma'ahum be ni ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Ka ba zɛ gbi'it ni dabɛɛm, ka tẽ'ẽhit yi ba nyɛta kouk. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Ka U bɔ'ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Yibo ka dabɛɛm sãã ya, ka ya tẽ'ẽhit buyi buyi ya putẽ'ẽra poŋi? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Beh mi Mam nu'uh ni N nɔba wa; ka nyɛ yi la a la Mam Mɛŋ. Kalim mi nim beh, ka kouk ka ningbiŋ ni kɔ̃ba a aa yan nyɛ ka Mam tar se'em maa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Un da yel ŋwala ba'ah la, U da pa'al ba U nu'uh ni U nɔba la. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Hali ba n da nyɛɛmit ka sin, ka kpelim pu sak sera ka bo'ot la, Yezu bɔ'ɔh ba yii, &lt;&lt;Ya tar dii kpelaa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Ka ba da zaŋ zin-sɛ̃'ɛ̃rig billa te U, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />ka U dɛ'ɛ ɔb ba tɔɔn.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Ka U pana da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;Mam yelehum n ŋwala, ka N daa yel Man daa nam be ni ya la, yi se'el woo n golih Mam wo'or zugu ka be Moozis wara la, ni nɔdɛ'ɛhirib gbana la, ni Saams-gbauŋ la poŋi la a la, la tom yela?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />U da wo'o ba putẽ'ẽra yi ba bɔk Na'ayen yelehum la n golih se'em la, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />ka da yel ba yii, &lt;&lt;La golih mi, yi Fããt la nan namih ka vo'o kum poŋi dɔɔ dabiha atã daar, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />ka U wo'or poŋi ka ba nan tɔɔn vom tɛɛgir ni yelebe'et suguru dii, pi'in Geruzalɛm tar paagit teh la zã'ã. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Yam a la sɛhira dem yel ãã la wa woo poŋi. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Ka beh mi, Mam nan tet ya dol la M Ba' nɔdiŋa la poŋi; yela, kpelim mi teŋa gur ya n ti pɛ'ɛl ni panse'e n zɛ'ɛn saazugu na la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu N Do Sangbana zugu ha la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Yezu da dol ni U nya'andolib la mi yi keŋ Bɛtani teŋ, ka zɛ̃k U nu'uh saazugu, kamaal ba. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Un da be ni kã'ãt maan ba la, U da bah ba sa'ani mi ka zɛ̃k U Mɛŋ doot ha ti kpɛ̃ tensoŋin ha. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />U nya'andolib la da na'ah U mi ka tulig leb Geruzalɛm ni popeelun-kãt; <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />ti be po'ohug yir la ni na'ahit Na'ayen saŋa woo.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>